<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="LUK" style="id">- Nkangala New Testament Zambia</book>
  <para style="h">Luka</para>
  <para style="toc1">Muzimbu Uacili uasonekele Luka</para>
  <para style="toc2">Luka</para>
  <para style="toc3">Luk</para>
  <para style="mt2">Muzimbu Uacili uasonekele</para>
  <para style="mt1">LUKA</para>
  <para style="imt">Citsindikisi</para>
  <para style="ip">Muzimbu Uacili uasonekele Luka, uapua umo ua mikanda iuana ya mu Litavasano Lialiha uje uhandeka vuyoye vua Yesu Kilistu. Umo na umo ua mikanda eyi va utumbula nguavo “Muzimbu.” kulumbununa nguavo “Muzimbu Uacili.” Vaisonekele hanima ya kutsa ca Yesu kuli Mateu, Mako, Luka na Yiuano. Luka kasonekele lika vimpande via vuyoye vua Yesu, vuno honi uasonekele naua na vilinga vivalingile vandongisi va Yesu hanima ya kutsa na kusanguka cendi, uavisonekele mu mukanda ua Vilinga via Tunganda. Naumo uahi azivuka ntsimbu vene Muzimbu ua Luka vausonekele cipue ku vausonekelele, vuno honi vavengi vaka kulilongesa valivuasana nguavo hamo vausonekele mu muaka ua makumi atanu na avali hanima ya kusemuka ca Yesu. Mukanda ua Luka vausonekele kuli ikeye Luka uje naua uapuile cimbanda. Mucifua mua usonekelelemo nomu muanali kuaseselamo muyati cimonesa ngeci uapuile yala uakulilongesa cikuma. Luka uatondele kulumbununa muacili, kuhandeka vilinga omo mu vialingiuilemo, linga vakuavo vauaneneho vukuasi omo vautanda (Luka 1: 1-3) Uapuile Kayunda (Makolose 4: 10-14), kaha ua usonekele mu cifua cije nava keti Vayunda navo vovuisise. Eci calimuesa hakutoka too muana lumbunuinamo cisemua ca Vayunda (Luka 1: 8) Muzimbu ua Luka ualifu cikuma na mikanda ya Mateu na Mako, muomu ihandeka viuma vimo viakulifua. Ha mikanda itatu eyi, Luka ikeye lika nahandekaho cikuma ha kusemuka ca Yiuano muka kumbuitika. Luka nahandeka naua ha kukonekela (Kapetulu 3: 3, 11:4, 17: 3-4, 23:34, 24:47) na lilombelo (3: 21, 5:16, 6:12, 11:1-12, 22:32)</para>
  <para style="iot">Muvana Vitumbikilamo</para>
  <para style="io1">1. Mu kapetulu 1:1-4, Luka ahandeka ha Muzimbu uendi nakulumbununa vika vije ua usonekelele.</para>
  <para style="io1">2. Ambahoni ahandeka ha kusemuka ca Yesu nomu muva muvuaheselele ha cipangi cendi (1:5; 4:13)</para>
  <para style="io1">3. Kaha ha mutambela uakama uoshe ua Muzimbu Uacili (4:14; 21:38), Luka ahandeka ha vipangi vije Yesu ualingile, cikumani ha vikomoueso via lingile na viuma via longesele.</para>
  <para style="io1">4. Mukumanesa, ha tupetulu vavali (22-24), ali nakuhandeka muje vati Yesu uatsile, namuje mutsindililemo, nomu muasangukile ku vatsi.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="LUK 1" />
  <para style="s">Mezi akulivanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 1:1" />Kuli mukuluntu Telefilo,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 1:1">Vantu vavengi vesekele kusoneka vukaleho vua viuma vije vialishulisilile hakati ketu. <verse eid="LUK 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 1:2" />Vasonekele vije vatulekele kuli vaje vavimuene kumaputukilo avio na kuli vaje vahandekele muzimbu. <verse eid="LUK 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 1:3" />Nankuma, nange njinayongola ngeci njapande ku kusonekelavio yove mukuluntu Telefilo muomu nange njavikavele cikuma ha ntsimbu yalaha hume ha viaputukilile. <verse eid="LUK 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 1:4" />Njalingi evi linga uzivuke vusunga vuacili vua viuma vije vivanakulekesa.<verse eid="LUK 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vambulula kusemuka ca Yiuano muka mumbuitika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 1:5" />Ha matangua aje omo Helonde uapuile muene ua Yundeya, kuakele kasasendote lizina liendi Zakaliya, ua kumuyati ua vasasendote va Aviya. Lizina lia mpueyendi liapuile Elizaveta, nendi naua uapuile uaku ntanga ya Alone. <verse eid="LUK 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 1:6" />Voshe vapuile vaka vusunga ku mesho a Njambi, vendele muacili na kuononoka Mashiko oshe a Muene. <verse eid="LUK 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 1:7" />Vuno honi vakevo kuvakele na muana muomu Elizaveta uapuile ntsimpi, kaha voshe vavali vapuile vakulukazi.<verse eid="LUK 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 1:8" />Ha litangua limo Zakaliya uakele nakupanga vipangi viendi via vusasendote mu njivo ya Njambi, muomu ntsimbu yendi yahetele ya kupanga. <verse eid="LUK 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 1:9" />Ngue kucilika civakavele vasasendote, Zakaliya vamuhanguile hakuta nkela linga akovele ku mutambela uakulela cikuma mu njivo ya Njambi Muene nakutsimika ngongosi ya luengo luacili ha mutula. <verse eid="LUK 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 1:10" />Omo ntsimbu ya Zakaliya yakutsimika ngongosi ya luengo luacili yahetele, civunga ca vantu vakakulemesa vakele hambanza na kulombela, <verse eid="LUK 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 1:11" />kaha kuamusholokelele kangelo ua Muene, uemanene kucilio ca mutula kuje kuvakele nakutsimikila ngongosi ya luengo luacili. <verse eid="LUK 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 1:12" />Omo Zakaliya uamumuene uaniangumukile, kaha uovuile liova. <verse eid="LUK 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 1:13" />Vuno honi Kangelo uahandekele kuli ikeye nguendi, “Keti uvue liova Zakaliya! muomu Njambi novu lilombelo liove. Kaha mpueyove Elizaveta akakusemena muana ua yala, kaha ukamuluka lizina liendi Yiuano. <verse eid="LUK 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 1:14" />Ukavuahelela na kujolela, kaha vavengi vakalisamba ha kusemuka cendi! <verse eid="LUK 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 1:15" />Muomu ou muana akapua uakama ku mesho a Muene. Kakanu viniu cipue viuma viakushasha. Akashula na Cimbembesi Uakulela cipue vene oku acili muzimo lia vaina. <verse eid="LUK 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 1:16" />Akahiluisila vantu vavengi Vaisaleli kuli Muene Njambi yavo. <verse eid="LUK 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 1:17" />Akaya kulutue lua Muene, ngue ku nzili na cifua ca vilinga via kananguizi Eliya. Akahiluisa vaishavo na vana vavo hamo lika. Akatengulula vaka kuhona kuononoka na kuvahiluisila naua ku ngila ya vaka vusunga. Akavuahesela vualumo vantu linga vavandamene Muene.”<verse eid="LUK 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 1:18" />Zakaliya uehuile kangelo nguendi, “Njikazivuka vati muje cuma eci cikafua? Muomu yange njinakolo laja, kaha na mpuevo yange nakolo laja.”<verse eid="LUK 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 1:19" />Kaha kangelo uamukumbuluile nguendi, “Yange Ngambiliyele njinemana ku mesho a Njambi. Nanjitumu kuhandeka nove nakukunehela Muzimbu ou uacili. <verse eid="LUK 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 1:20" />Tala, ukapua u kaveveve muomu kuuatsilielele mezi ange, aje akapua a vusunga omo ntsimbu yauo ikaheta. Ukaholoka kuluu noho litangua lije cikulaheso cange kuli yove cikapua ca vusunga.”<verse eid="LUK 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 1:21" />Vantu vavandamena Zakaliya hambanza kaha valikomokelele cikuma omo uasimbuile cikuma mu Njivo ya Njambi. <verse eid="LUK 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 1:22" />Omo Zakaliya uatuhukilemo kasele kuhandeka kuli vakevo. Kaha hakuhona kuhandeka cipue lizi limo, uapangesele vimueso na mavoko endi, kaha vantu vakele hambanza vazivukile nguavo namono cimona mu Njivo ya Njambi.<verse eid="LUK 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 1:23" />Omo Zakaliya uamanusuile vipangi viendi mu Njivo ya Njambi, kaha uahilukile kuimbo liendi. <verse eid="LUK 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 1:24" />Munima yevi mpueyendi Elizaveta uemitile, kaha uakele mu njivo vingonde vitanu. <verse eid="LUK 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 1:25" />Elizaveta uahandekele nguendi, “Ha mamanusuilo Muene nanjimuesa kavumbi, nanjihumisa shuamua ku mesho a vantu.”<verse eid="LUK 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kangelo Ngambiliyele ambulula kusemuka ca Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 1:26" />Omo Elizaveta uakele na vingonde vitanu na imo via lizimo, Njambi uatumine kangelo Ngambiliyele aye ku Nazaleta mu nganda ya Ngalileya. <verse eid="LUK 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 1:27" />Kangelo uakele na lizi kuli muana mpuevo umo kanda alimone na yala lizina liendi Maliya. Uje uapuile uakulama kuli yala lizina liendi Yosefa, uaku ntanga ya muene Ndaviti. <verse eid="LUK 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 1:28" />Kaha kangelo uezile kuli Maliya uamumenekele na kuhandekele nguendi, “Muene ali nove, kaha nakukuisula cikuma!” <verse eid="LUK 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 1:29" />Vuno honi Maliya uakele na citanga ha lizi lije liahandekele kangelo, uasinganiekele mu mutima uendi nguendi, “Mezi aua analumbunuka vika?” <verse eid="LUK 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 1:30" />Kaha kangelo uahandekele kuli ikeye nguendi, “Keti uvue liova Maliya, muomu unauana kavumbi kuli Njambi. <verse eid="LUK 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 1:31" />Tala, ukemita, kaha ukasema muana ua yala, ukamuluka lizina liendi Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 1:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 1:32" />Ou muana akapua uakama, kaha vaka mutumbula Muna Njambi Uahelu Liavioshe. Kaha Muene Njambi akamupuisa muene, ngue muapuile kukuyendi Ndaviti. <verse eid="LUK 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 1:33" />Kaha akapua muene ua miyati ya Yakomba kumiaka yoshe, na vumuene vuendi kuvukahu!”<verse eid="LUK 1:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 1:34" />Kaha Maliya uahandekele kuli kangelo nguendi, “Nkuma eci cikafua vati? Muomu yange njimuana mpuevo uje kanda alimone na yala.” <verse eid="LUK 1:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 1:35" />Kaha kangelo uamukumbuluile nguendi, “Cimbembesi Uakulela akeja hali yove, na nzili ya Njambi Uahelu Liavioshe ikakufuika. Nankuma, ha cuma eci uje muana Uakulela vakamutumbula Muna Njambi. <verse eid="LUK 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 1:36" />Tala! Munanoko Elizaveta na ikeye nemita muana ua yala muvukuluntu vuendi. Kaha ino inapu ngonde ya mucitanu na imo ya lizimo liendi cipue vene vamutumbuile nguavo ntsimpi. <verse eid="LUK 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 1:37" />Muomu nacimo cahi cuma cacikalu kuli Njambi.” <verse eid="LUK 1:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 1:38" />Kaha Maliya uakumbuluile kangelo nguendi, “Tala, yange njapua njingamba ya Muene, cilingiue kuli yange ngue muje mu unahandeka.” Kaha munima yevi kangelo uamusezele.<verse eid="LUK 1:38" /></para>
  <para style="s">Maliya ameneka Elizaveta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 1:39" />Hanima ya matangua amandende, Maliya ualivuaheselele na kuya ku nganda ya mu minkinda ya mu nganda ya Yundeya. <verse eid="LUK 1:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 1:40" />Omo uahetele kaha uakovelele mu njivo ya Zakaliya, kaha uahinduisile Elizaveta. <verse eid="LUK 1:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 1:41" />Omo Elizaveta uovuile kuhinduisa ca Maliya, kaha kakeke uaniangumukile muzimo liendi. Kaha Elizaveta uashulile na Cimbembesi Uakulela, <verse eid="LUK 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 1:42" />uahandekele na lizi liakama nguendi, “Yove u uakukuisula hakati ka vampuevo voshe, uakukuisula muana uje iukasema!” <verse eid="LUK 1:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 1:43" />Nkuma vikahoni cuma cakama eci cilingiua kuli yange, ngeci vaina ya Muene yange veje kuli yange? <verse eid="LUK 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 1:44" />Tala! Omo njovuile lizi liakuhinduisa kuove, hajevene kakeke muzimo liange uaniangumukile na nzolela. <verse eid="LUK 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 1:45" />Yove u uakukuisula muomu uatsiliela ngeci lizi lia Muene kuli yove likapua lia vusunga!<verse eid="LUK 1:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">Muaso ua Maliya ua vishangala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 1:46" />Maliya uahandekele nguendi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:46">“Mutima uange ushangazala vukama vua Muene,<verse eid="LUK 1:46" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 1:47" />Muono uange unavuahelela muomu ya Njambi Muyoyesi uange,<verse eid="LUK 1:47" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 1:48" />Muomu navuluka yange ngamba yendi uakulikehesa! Kuhuma hano nakuya kulutue, vikota vioshe vakanjitumbula nguavo uakukuisula,<verse eid="LUK 1:48" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 1:49" />Muomu Njambi muka nzili yoshe nanjilingila viakama. Lizina liendi lia kulela.<verse eid="LUK 1:49" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 1:50" />Ikeye akamuesa cikeketima kuli voshe vamusingimika, kuhuma ku cikota kuya naku cikota cikuavo.<verse eid="LUK 1:50" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 1:51" />Ikeye nolola livoko liendi lia nzili, nashandola vaka viyongola via kulihalesa.<verse eid="LUK 1:51" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 1:52" />Nahumisa vamiene vakama ha matanda avo, kaha najundula vaje vavandende ku vukama.<verse eid="LUK 1:52" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 1:53" />Nalisa vaje vali na njala na viakulia viacili, kaha vaka kufuka navasheke mavoko voko.<verse eid="LUK 1:53" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 1:54" />Ikeye naniungu cikulaheso cije calingile na vakukuluila vetu, kaha neja nakukuasa ngamba yendi Isaleli.<verse eid="LUK 1:54" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 1:55" />Navuluka kumuesa cikeketima kuli Avilahama naku vatekuluila vendi voshe ku miaka yoshe!”<verse eid="LUK 1:55" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 1:56" />Maliya uasikamene na Elizaveta vingonde vitatu, kaha uahilukile kuimbo liendi.<verse eid="LUK 1:56" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kusemuka ca Yiuano muka Kumbuitika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 1:57" />Ntsimbu ya Elizaveta yakusema yahetele, kaha uasemene muana ua yala. <verse eid="LUK 1:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 1:58" />Vandambo na vavushoko vendi vovuile muje Muene muanamumuesa cikeketima cakama, kaha voshe vavuahelelele hamo nendi.<verse eid="LUK 1:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 1:59" />Kaha ha litangua lia mucitanu na atatu, vezile nakulovola muana, vatondele kumuhindula ishe Zakaliya. <verse eid="LUK 1:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 1:60" />Vuno honi vaina vahandekele nguavo, “Houe! Mulukeni Yiuano.”<verse eid="LUK 1:60" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 1:61" />Vamukumbuluile nguavo, “Kukuesi kavushoko kove ivaluka lizina eli!” <verse eid="LUK 1:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 1:62" />Ambahoni vaniatelele ishe na kulinga vizivukiso na mavoko avo mukumuihula nguavo, “Lizina muka utonda kuluka munove?”<verse eid="LUK 1:62" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 1:63" />Kaha Zakaliya ualombele citale ngeci asonekeho, omo vacinehele uasonekeleho nguendi, “Lizina liendi Yiuano.” Kaha voshe vali komokelele cikuma! <verse eid="LUK 1:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 1:64" />Ha ntsimbu ijevene Zakaliya uasele kuhandeka naua, kaha uaputukile kushangazala Njambi. <verse eid="LUK 1:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 1:65" />Vandambo voshe vakele na liova, kaha muzimbu ua uatsimanene ku mutambela uoshe ua minkinda mu nganda ya Yundeya. <verse eid="LUK 1:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 1:66" />Voshe vaje vovuile muzimbu ou vasinganiekeleho, kaha valihozuele nguavo, “Ou muanike akafua vati?” Muomu casholokele muacili ngeci nzili ya Muene yakele hali ikeye.<verse eid="LUK 1:66" /></para>
  <para style="s">Zakaliya ahandeka vunanguizi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 1:67" />Ishe ya Yiuano, Zakaliya, uashulile na Cimbembesi Uakulela, kaha uahandekele vunanguizi nguendi,<verse eid="LUK 1:67" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 1:68" />“Kushangazala cikale kuli Muene Njambi ya Isaleli!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:68">Muomu neja nakukuasa vantu vendi na kuvapatula.<verse eid="LUK 1:68" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 1:69" />Natuhana Muyoyesi ua nzili,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:69">mutekulu ua ngamba yendi Ndaviti.<verse eid="LUK 1:69" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 1:70" />Uakulahesele laja kuhitila muli tunanguizi vendi va kulela<verse eid="LUK 1:70" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 1:71" />ngeci akatuamena ku vitozi vetu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:71">na ku nzili ya voshe vaje vatuzinda.<verse eid="LUK 1:71" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="LUK 1:72" />Ualingile eci kumuesa cikeketima kuli vakukuluila vetu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:72">na kuvuluka litavasano liendi lia kulela.<verse eid="LUK 1:72" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="73" style="v" sid="LUK 1:73" />Eci cikeco cisingo cije calisingile na kukuluila yetu Avilahama.<verse eid="LUK 1:73" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="74" style="v" sid="LUK 1:74" />Uakulahesele kutuohiela ku mavoko avitozi vetu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:74">linga tukamupangele cakuhona liova,<verse eid="LUK 1:74" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="75" style="v" sid="LUK 1:75" />linga tupue vakulela na vusunga ku mesho endi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:75">ku matangua oshe a kuyoya cetu.<verse eid="LUK 1:75" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="76" style="v" sid="LUK 1:76" />“Kaha yove munange, vaka kutumbula kananguizi Uahelu Liavioshe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:76">Ukatuama kulutue lua Muene</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:76">mukuvuahesa ngila yendi,<verse eid="LUK 1:76" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="77" style="v" sid="LUK 1:77" />nakuleka vantu vendi ngeci vakavovola</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:77">haku vakonekela ku vipi viavo.<verse eid="LUK 1:77" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="78" style="v" sid="LUK 1:78" />Muomu Njambi yetu uakala na cikeketima cakama.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:78">akatuhuisa ceke ca kuovoka linga citue hali yetu<verse eid="LUK 1:78" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="79" style="v" sid="LUK 1:79" />nakutuila voshe vaje vakala mu milima ya cimbembe ca kutsa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:79">nakutuamenena mikono yetu mu ngila ya ciyulo.”<verse eid="LUK 1:79" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="80" style="v" sid="LUK 1:80" />Yiuano uakolele mu muvila na mu Cimbembesi. Uakele mu mpambo noho litangua liendi lia kulisholola ku vantu Vaisaleli liahetele.<verse eid="LUK 1:80" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="LUK 2" />
  <para style="s">Kusemuka ca Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 1:18-25">Mateu 1:18-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 2:1" />Capuile ngacije ha ntsimbu ije, kuli Sezale Angushitu kua humine lizi lia kushika, linga vasonekese vantu voshe mu vumuene vua Loma. <verse eid="LUK 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 2:2" />Eci cikeco kusoneka cije ca kulivanga civa lingile omo Kiliniu uapuile nguvulu ua Siliya. <verse eid="LUK 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 2:3" />Kaha voshe vayile ku membo avo, linga va kavasonekeleko.<verse eid="LUK 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 2:4" />Yosefa uahumine ku nganda ya Nazaleta mu Ngalileya, uayile ku nganda ya Mbetelehema mu Yundeya ku limbo lia semukilile Muene Ndaviti, muomu uapuile muka muyati ua Ndaviti. <verse eid="LUK 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 2:5" />Uayile nakumusoneka hamo na Maliya uje ya lamene, uje uemitile. <verse eid="LUK 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 2:6" />Kaha tele vacili kuje matangua endi a kusema ahetele. <verse eid="LUK 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 2:7" />Kaha uasemene munendi ua ntuatua ua yala, kaha ua muzengelele ha vintanga, kaha uamu hakele mu cikasa ca kulila vangombe muomu kukuakele mulili mu cihela ca vangenzi.<verse eid="LUK 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tungelo vasholoka ku tuniungi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 2:8" />Ku mutambela uje vene kuakele tuniungi mucana, vakele nakuniunga vampanga vavo vutsiki. <verse eid="LUK 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 2:9" />Kangelo ua Muene uasholokele kuli vakevo, kaha vumpau vua Muene vuatuile ceke hakati kavo. Vovuile liova liakama cikuma. <verse eid="LUK 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 2:10" />Vuno honi kangelo uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi, “Keti muvue liova! Muomu njinaneha muzimbu uacili kuli yeni, uje ukaneha kujolela cakama ku vantu voshe. <verse eid="LUK 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 2:11" />Ha litangua lino vene mu nganda ya Ndaviti munasemuka Muyoyesi ueni, ikeye Kilistu Muene! <verse eid="LUK 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 2:12" />Kaha eci cikapua cimueso ceni, mukauana kakeke vanamuzengela ha vintanga vana mulangeka mu cikasa caku lila vangombe.”<verse eid="LUK 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 2:13" />Hajevene kuasholokele civunga cakama ca masualale ca tungelo va muilu vemanene hamo na kangelo uje uanehele muzimbu, vembile na kushangazala Njambi nguavo,<verse eid="LUK 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 2:14" />“Vumpau vukale kuli Njambi uakuhiana vioshe ua muilu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 2:14">ciyulo cikale hano ha mavu ku vantu vaje vazanga!”<verse eid="LUK 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 2:15" />Omo tungelo vahilukile muilu kuhuma kuli tuniungi, kaha tuniungi valihandekesele umo na mukuavo nguavo, “Tuyeni honi ku Mbetelehema linga tuka mone eci cuma cinalingiuako, cije cana tusholuela Muene.”<verse eid="LUK 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 2:16" />Nankuma, vayile hajevene vuasi vuasi vakauanene Maliya na Yosefa na kakeke vana mulangeka mucikasa caku lila vangombe. <verse eid="LUK 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 2:17" />Omo tuniungi vamumuene, vambuluile mezi aje avalekele kangelo hali kakeke. <verse eid="LUK 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 2:18" />Kaha voshe vaje vovuile valikomokelele ha viuma vije vivahandekele tuniungi. <verse eid="LUK 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 2:19" />Vuno honi Maliya uaniungile mezi oshe aje naku ayongola mu mutima uendi. <verse eid="LUK 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 2:20" />Kaha tuniungi vahilukile oku vahana vumpau na kushangazala Njambi ha viuma vioshe voviule, na vije vamuene. Viuma vioshe vialingiuile ngue vene muje muavalekele kangelo.<verse eid="LUK 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu vamuluka lizina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 2:21" />Hanima ya matangua atanu na atatu, omo ntsimbu yahetele yakulovola kakeke, kaha vamulukile lizina liendi Yesu, lizina lije lia mulukile kangelo ntsimbu kanda vamuimite.<verse eid="LUK 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vakundika Yesu mu Njivo ya Njambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 2:22" />Omo ntsimbu ya kulilelesa yahetele, Yosefa na Maliya valingile ngue ku Lishiko lia Mosesa. Nankuma, vatualele muanike ku Yelusalema linga vaka mukundike kuli Muene, <verse eid="LUK 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 2:23" />ngue muvanacisoneka mu lishiko lia Muene nguavo, “Muana uoshe ua ntuatua ua yala vaka mukundike kuli Muene.” <verse eid="LUK 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 2:24" />kaha naua vaka kombelele nkombelo ya tutela vavali cipue vana va mavembe vavali, kuya ku lishiko lia Muene.<verse eid="LUK 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 2:25" />Kaha honi kuakele yala umo mu Yelusalema lizina liendi Simoni. Uapuile muka vusunga kaha naua uazangele Njambi, uavandamanene kuovoka ca Isaleli. Cimbembesi Uakulela uakele hali ikeye, <verse eid="LUK 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 2:26" />vavisholuele kuli ikeye kuli Cimbembesi Uakulela ngeci kakatsi kuakuhona kumona Kilistu ua Muene. <verse eid="LUK 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 2:27" />Simoni ha kumutuamenena kuli Cimbembesi Uakulela, uakovelele mu Njivo ya Njambi. Omo visemi vanehele kakeke Yesu mu Njivo ya Njambi linga va mulinge ngue kuya ku lishiko lia Mosesa. <verse eid="LUK 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 2:28" />Simoni uatambuile kakeke mu mavoko endi, uatsantselele kuli Njambi na kuhandeka nguendi,<verse eid="LUK 2:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 2:29" />“Honi Muene unaniungu cikulaheso cove kuli yange,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 2:29">honi tava ngamba yove linga aye mu ciyulo,<verse eid="LUK 2:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 2:30" />muomu mesho ange anamono kuovola cove,<verse eid="LUK 2:30" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 2:31" />cije ci unavuahesela vantu voshe.<verse eid="LUK 2:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 2:32" />Cikapua ceke cakusholola kuli vaje keti Vayunda,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 2:32">nakuneha vumpau ku vantu vove Vaisaleli.”<verse eid="LUK 2:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 2:33" />Vaishe na vaina vali komokelele ha viuma vije viahandekele Simoni hali Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 2:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 2:34" />Ambahoni Simoni uavakuisuile na kuhandeka kuli Maliya vaina ya Yesu nguendi, “Tala! kakeke ou vamuhanguile kuli Njambi mukunongesa nakuovola vavengi mu Isaleli. Akapua cimueso ca kuhuma kuli Njambi, cije vantu vavengi vakaluisa, <verse eid="LUK 2:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 2:35" />ngeci cikasholole viyongola viavo via vushueke. Kaha vusiua vukatuva mitima yavo ngue mukuale uakuhomona.”<verse eid="LUK 2:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 2:36" />Kuakele umo kananguizi uakukuluvala uampuevo lizina liendi Ana muna Fanuele uaku muyati ua Ashele. Uje uashombokele lika ha miaka itanu na ivali, <verse eid="LUK 2:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 2:37" />kaha honi uapuile ntuluue ha miaka makumi atanu na atatu na miaka iuana (84) Ikeye kahumine mu mbalanda ya njivo ya Njambi, uakele nakulemesa Njambi mu kuliumina kulia na malombelo vutsiki na mutania. <verse eid="LUK 2:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 2:38" />Ha ntsimbu ijevene uahetele kuli Maliya na Yosefa uahanene citsantsela kuli Njambi, uahandekele hali uje muana kuli voshe vaje vavandamenene Njambi kupatula Yelusalema.<verse eid="LUK 2:38" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vahiluka ku Nazaleta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 2:39" />Omo Yosefa na Maliya vamanusuile vioshe ngue ku lishiko lia Muene, vahilukile kuimbo liavo ku Nazaleta mu Ngalileya. <verse eid="LUK 2:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 2:40" />Kaha muana uakolele uakele na nzili. Uakolele mu mana, kaha kavumbi ka Njambi kakele hali ikeye.<verse eid="LUK 2:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kanike Yesu mu Njivo ya Njambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 2:41" />Ha muaka na muaka visemi va Yesu vakele nakuya ku Yelusalema ku ciuano ca Paseka. <verse eid="LUK 2:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 2:42" />Omo Yesu uakele na miaka likumi na ivali, kaha vayile nendi ku Yelusalema ku cilika ca ciuano ngue ku ntsimbu yoshe. <verse eid="LUK 2:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 2:43" />Omo matangua aje a ciuano ahuile, omo vakele na kuhiluka kuimbo, vuno honi muanike Yesu uasalele munima mu Yelusalema. Visemi vendi ku vazicivukile, <verse eid="LUK 2:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 2:44" />vayonguele nguavo hamo ali ha cendo, nankuma vendele vungezi vua litangua limo, kaha vaputukile kumutonda hakati kava vushoko vuavo nava vusamba vavo, <verse eid="LUK 2:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 2:45" />vuno honi kuva muuanene. Nankuma, vahilukile naua ku Yelusalema mukumutonda. <verse eid="LUK 2:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 2:46" />Kaha ha litangua lia mu citatu vamuuanene mu Njivo ya Njambi, natumama hakati ka valongisi, na kuvovuilila naku vehozola vihula. <verse eid="LUK 2:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 2:47" />Kaha voshe vaje vovuile vali komokelele cikuma mangana endi naku kumbulula cendi. <verse eid="LUK 2:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 2:48" />Visemi vendi omo vamumuene valikomokelele, kaha vaina vahandekele kuli ikeye nguavo, “Munange, nkuma vika unatulingilamo? Tala! Isho nange tunaliniengele nakukutonda.”<verse eid="LUK 2:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 2:49" />Yesu uavakumbuluile nguendi, “Vika munanjitondela? Nkuma kumuazivukile ngueni njinapande kukala mu njivo ya tate ndi?” <verse eid="LUK 2:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 2:50" />Vuno honi vakevo kuvevuisisile vije via vakumbuluile.<verse eid="LUK 2:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 2:51" />Yesu uayile navo ku Nazaleta, kaha kuje uatualeleleho kuvononoka. Vaina vaniungile vioshe evi mu mutima uavo. <verse eid="LUK 2:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 2:52" />Kaha Yesu uakolele mu muvila, na mu mana, uauanene kavumbi kakama kuli Njambi naku vantu.<verse eid="LUK 2:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="LUK 3" />
  <para style="s">Kuambulula ca Yiuano muka kumbuitika</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:1-12">Mateu 3:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:1-8">Mako 1:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:19-28">Yiuano 1:19-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 3:1" />Mu muaka ua vulikumi na itanu ua kuyula ca Sezale Timbeliase kaha Pontiyu Pilato uapuile nguvulu uamu Yundeya, na Helonde uasuanene mu Ngalileya, na munaina Filipu uasuanene mu nganda ya Ituleya na nganda ya Talakoniti, na Lisaniya uasuanene mu nganda ya Ambilene, <verse eid="LUK 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 3:2" />na Anase na Kayafase vapuile vasasendote vakama. Ha ntsimbu ijevene Njambi uahandekele kuli Yiuano muna Zakaliya omo uakele mu mpambo. <verse eid="LUK 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 3:3" />Yiuano uayile ku cihela na cihela ca Ndonga ya Yundau nakuambulula nguendi, “Tengulukeni ku vipi vieni ngeci vamimbuitike, kaha Njambi akamikonekela ku vipi vieni.” <verse eid="LUK 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 3:4" />Ngue muje muvanacisoneka mu livulu liakuzenga lia kananguizi Isaya nguavo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:4">“lizi lia umo atambeka mu mpambo nguendi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:4">‘Vuaheseni tapalo ya Muene,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:4">sungameseni ngila yendi linga akuhitilemo!<verse eid="LUK 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 3:5" />Vimbongo vioshe vanapande ku viofuela,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:5">na minkinda yoshe yaindende neyi yakama vaka viniekumuna,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:5">na vingila via kuhenga vanapande kuviolola visungame,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:5">na vingila viakuzika vanapande kuvilambesa.<verse eid="LUK 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 3:6" />Vantu voshe vakamona kuovola ca Njambi.’”<verse eid="LUK 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 3:7" />Kaha Yiuano ualekele vije vivunga via vantu vaje vezile kuli ikeye na kuvambuitika nguendi, “Eni manoka! Iya honi naminangula linga muteue vukalu vua Njambi vuje vuli nakuija? <verse eid="LUK 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 3:8" />Nga mutonda kuteua ku vukalu vua Njambi lingeni viuma vije vimuesa ngeci munatenguluka ku vipi vieni. Keti mu lihandekese mu mitima yeni ngueni ‘Tuli na tatetu Avilahama.’ Muavusunga njimileka nguange Njambi asa kutengulula mavue aua naku uapuisa vatekuluila va Avilahama! <verse eid="LUK 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 3:9" />Ngimbu vanaihaka laja ku mizi ya muti, muti uoshe uje kuuimi vushuka vuacili vaka uteta naku umbila mu tuhia.”<verse eid="LUK 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 3:10" />Vantu vamuihuile nguavo, “Kaha honi tulinga vati?”<verse eid="LUK 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 3:11" />Uavakumbuluile nguendi, “Uje ali na vikovelo vivali ahaneko cimo uje kesi naco, kaha nou alina via kulia ahaneko vakuavo.”<verse eid="LUK 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 3:12" />Vaka kutambula lisimu vezile linga avambuitike, kaha vamuihuile nguavo, “Mulongisi, nkuma yetu tunapande kulinga vika?”<verse eid="LUK 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 3:13" />Kaha uavalekele nguendi, “Keti mukatambule kupulakana muje muvia ilamo.”<verse eid="LUK 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 3:14" />Masualale vamo naua vamuihuile nguavo, “Nkuma honi yetu tunapande kulinga vika?” Kaha uavalekele nguendi, “Keti muka pukule viuma via vakueni, cipue kuvangeya, simpeni na fueto yeni.”<verse eid="LUK 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 3:15" />Omo vantu vakele na kuvandamena, kaha voshe vakele na kulihozola mu mutima yavo via hali Yiuano indi cilivene ikeye Kilistu. <verse eid="LUK 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 3:16" />Kaha Yiuano uahandekele kuli voshe nguendi, “Njimimbuitika mu mema, vuno honi ouo akeja napu uakama kupulakana yange. Ku njapandele cipue kuzitula miva ya ha vinkaku viendi. Ikeye akamimbuitika na Cimbembesi Uakulela na mu tuhia. <verse eid="LUK 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 3:17" />Lisehua lili mu livoko liendi, ikeye akapekula na kulelesa muacili vinona vioshe kulijunguilo liendi, kaha tiliku akaitulika mu cishete cendi, vuno honi mujungu uoshe akautsimika na tuhia tuakuhona kuzima!”<verse eid="LUK 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 3:18" />Mu vingila viavingi viakuliseza seza Yiuano uambuluile Muzimbu Uacili ku vantu mukuvasindiya linga vatenguluke ku vingila viavo. <verse eid="LUK 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 3:19" />Vuno honi Yiuano uatenukilile nguvulu Helonde, muomu uambatele Helondiya mpuevo ya munaina Filipu, kaha naua naha viuma viavingi via vipi vije viakele nakulinga. <verse eid="LUK 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 3:20" />Ambahoni cuma cacipi cikuma cikuavo cije ca lingile Helonde capuile ca kuhaka Yiuano mu kamenga.<verse eid="LUK 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu vamumbuitika</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:13-17">Mateu 3:13-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:9-11">Mako 1:9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 3:21" />Omo Yiuano uamanusuile kumbuitika vantu voshe, na Yesu naua vamumbuitikile. Ha ntsimbu ijevene Yesu omo uakele na kulombela, lilu liashokolokele. <verse eid="LUK 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 3:22" />Kaha Cimbembesi Uakulela uashulukile hali ikeye mucifua ca livembe. Kaha muilu mua humine lizi ngualio, “Yove munange injazanga, njivuahelela muomu yove.”<verse eid="LUK 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vakukuluila va Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 1:1-17">Mateu 1:1-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 3:23" />Omo Yesu uaputukile kupanga vipangi viendi uakele na miaka makumi atatu. Kaha vantu vakele nakuyongola nguavo ikeye muna Yosefa. Yosefa uapuile muna Heli, <verse eid="LUK 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 3:24" />Heli uapuile muna Matati, Matati uapuile muna Levi, Levi uapuile muna Meleki, Meleki uapuile muna Njanayi, Njanayi uapuile muna Yosefa, <verse eid="LUK 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 3:25" />Yosefa uapuile muna Matiyasi, Matiyasi uapuile muna Amose, Amose uapuile muna Nahumi, Nahumi uapuile muna Eseli, Eseli uapuile muna Nangai, <verse eid="LUK 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 3:26" />Nangai uapuile muna Maate, Maate uapuile muna Matatiya, Matatiya uapuile muna Semehine, Semehine uapuile muna Yoseke, Yoseke uapuile muna Yonda, <verse eid="LUK 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 3:27" />Yonda uapuile muna Youanane, Youanane uapuile muna Lehesa, Lehesa uapuile muna Zelumbambele, Zelumbambele uapuile muna Sheyaletiyele, Sheyaletiyele uapuile muna Neli. <verse eid="LUK 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 3:28" />Neli uapuile muna Meleki, Meleki uapuile muna Andi, Andi uapuile muna Kosame, Kosame uapuile muna Elemandame, Elemandame uapuile muna Ele, <verse eid="LUK 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 3:29" />Ele uapuile muna Yoshua, Yoshua uapuile muna Ezazale, Ezazale uapuile muna Yolime, Yolime uapuile muna Matata, Matata uapuile muna Levi, <verse eid="LUK 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 3:30" />Levi uapuile muna Simioni, Simioni uapuile muna Yunda, Yunda uapuile muna Yosefa, Yosefa uapuile muna Njoname, Njoname uapuile muna Eliakime, <verse eid="LUK 3:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 3:31" />Eliakime uapuile muna Meleya, Meleya uapuile muna Mena, Mena uapuile muna Matata, Matata uapuile muna Natane, Natane uapuile muna Ndaviti, <verse eid="LUK 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 3:32" />Ndaviti uapuile muna Njesi, Njesi uapuile muna Ovende, Ovende uapuile muna Mbouasi, Mbouasi uapuile muna Salemone, Salemone uapuile muna Naheshoni, <verse eid="LUK 3:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 3:33" />Nashone uapuile muna Aminandave, Aminandave uapuile muna Andemine, Andamine uapuile muna Aleni, Aleni uapuile muna Izeloni, Izeloni uapuile muna Peleze, Peleze uapuile muna Yunda, <verse eid="LUK 3:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 3:34" />Yunda uapuile muna Yakomba, Yakomba uapuile muna Isake, Iseke uapuile muna Avilahama, Avilahama uapuile muna Tela, Tela uapuile muna Nahole, <verse eid="LUK 3:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 3:35" />Nahole uapuile muna Selunge, Selunge uapuile muna Leu, Leu uapuile muna Pelenge, Pelenge uapuile muna Hevele, Hevele uapuile muna shela, <verse eid="LUK 3:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 3:36" />Shela uapuile muna Kainane, Kainane uapuile muna Alepakeshande, Alepakeshande uapuile muna Shemi, Shemi uapuile muna Noua, Noua uapuile muna Lameki <verse eid="LUK 3:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 3:37" />Lameki uapuile muna Matusela, Matusela uapuile muna Enoke, uapuile muna Njalende, Njalende uapuile muna Maalalele, Maalalele uapuile muna Kenane <verse eid="LUK 3:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 3:38" />Kenane uapuile muna Enoshe, Enoshe uapuile muna Sete, Sete uapuile muna Andama, Andama uapuile muna Njambi.<verse eid="LUK 3:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="LUK 4" />
  <para style="s">Yesu vamueseka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:1-11">Mateu 4:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:12-13">Mako 1:12-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 4:1" />Yesu hakushula na Cimbembesi Uakulela, uahumine ku ndonga ya Yundau, kaha Cimbembesi ua mutuamenene mu mpambo, <verse eid="LUK 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 4:2" />kuje Liyavolo uakamuesekele matangua makumi auana. Ha ntsimbu ije yoshe Yesu kalile nacimo cahi, omo matangua aje ahuile, kaha uovuile njala.<verse eid="LUK 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 4:3" />Kaha Liyavolo uahandekele kuli ikeye nguendi, “Nga u Muna Njambi shika livue eli ngeci lilihimpule mbolo.”<verse eid="LUK 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 4:4" />Vuno honi Yesu uamukumbuluile nguendi, “Vanacisoneka mu Visoneka nguavo, ‘Muntu kasa kuyoya na mbolo lika houe.’”<verse eid="LUK 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 4:5" />Ambahoni Liyavolo uatualele Yesu helu lia cihela calaha, kaha uamumuesele muka ntsimbu kakandende vumuene vuoshe vua hano ha mavu. <verse eid="LUK 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 4:6" />Kaha Liyavolo uahandekele kuli ikeye nguendi, “Njikakuhana nzili yoshe yakama na vumpau vuavuo, muomu vananjihanavio, kaha njikavihana kuli uoshe uje injitonda. <verse eid="LUK 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 4:7" />Nga unjilemesa, kaha vioshe evi vikapua viove.”<verse eid="LUK 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 4:8" />Yesu uahandekele kuli ikeye nguendi, “Vanacisoneka mu Visoneka nguavo, ‘Ukalemesa Muene Njambi yove, ikeye lika iukapangela!’”<verse eid="LUK 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 4:9" />Ambahoni Liyavolo uamutualele ku Yelusalema, uakamuhakele ha kashongua ka njivo ya Njambi, uahandekele kuli ikeye nguendi, “Nga u Muna Njambi, liumbile ha mavu, <verse eid="LUK 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 4:10" />muomu vanacisoneka mu Visoneka nguavo, ‘Njambi akashika tungelo vendi na kukuniunga.’ <verse eid="LUK 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 4:11" />Kaha vanacisoneka mu Visoneka naua nguavo, ‘Vakakukuata, linga viliato viove keti vikatsutsuke ku mavue.’”<verse eid="LUK 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 4:12" />Vuno honi Yesu uahandekele kuli ikeye nguendi, “Vanacisoneka mu Visoneka nguavo, ‘Keti ueseke Muene Njambi yove.’”<verse eid="LUK 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 4:13" />Omo Liyavolo uamanusuile kueseka Yesu mu vingila vioshe, kaha uamusezele noho hakauanena ntsimbu ikuavo.<verse eid="LUK 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu aputuka vipangi viendi mu Ngalileya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:12-17">Mateu 4:12-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:14-15">Mako 1:14-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 4:14" />Yesu uahilukile ku Ngalileya, na nzili ya Cimbembesi Uakulela yakele muli ikeye. Kaha muzimbu uendi uatsimanene mu nganda yoshe ya Ngalileya. <verse eid="LUK 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 4:15" />Yesu uavalongesele mu vinjivo viavo via malombelo, kaha voshe vamushangazalele.<verse eid="LUK 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu vamuviana ku Nazaleta</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:53-58">Mateu 13:53-58</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:1-6">Mako 6:1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 4:16" />Yesu uayile ku Nazaleta, kuje kuakolelele, kaha uakovelele mu njivo ya malombelo ha litangua lia Sapalalo ngue ku cilika cendi. Kaha uemanene na kutanda Visoneka. <verse eid="LUK 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 4:17" />Vamuhanene livulu liakuzenga liasonekele kananguizi Isaya. Kaha uazengunuine lije livulu liakuzenga, kaha uauanene ha mutambela uje vasoneka nguavo,<verse eid="LUK 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 4:18" />“Cimbembesi ua Muene ali muli yange,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:18">muomu nanjihangula kuambulula Muzimbu Uacili ku vihutu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:18">Nanjitumu kuambulula ngeci vinzinda vaka vapatule,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:18">na kuambulula linga tupuputua vakamone,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:18">na kunjituma kupatula vaje vavali nakuyandesa,<verse eid="LUK 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 4:19" />nakunjituma kuambulula ngeci ntsimbu inahete</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:19">ije Muene akovola vantu vendi.”<verse eid="LUK 4:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 4:20" />Yesu uazengele lije livulu, ualihanene naua kuli muka kuniunga, kaha uatumamene. Vantu voshe vakele muje mu njivo ya malombelo vamutalele ntooma, <verse eid="LUK 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 4:21" />kaha uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi, “Visoneka evi lelo vinalishulisisa ku mesho eni, ngue muje munovu muvanavitanda.”<verse eid="LUK 4:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 4:22" />Kaha voshe vamushangazalele, valikomokelele ku mezi endi acili aje ahandekele, vahandekele nguavo, “Nkuma ou keti ikeye uje muna Yosefa ndi?”<verse eid="LUK 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 4:23" />Yesu uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi, “Muavusunga mukanjitela cisimo eci ngueni, ‘Ove cimbanda likanguise yove vavenia!’ kaha naua mukanjileka ngueni yove linga viuma vioshe muno muimbo liove, vijevene vituovuile ulinakulinga mu Kapenauma.” <verse eid="LUK 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 4:24" />Muavusunga njimileka, naumo uahi “kananguizi ivakatava muimbo liendi. <verse eid="LUK 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 4:25" />Vuno honi muavusunga njimileka mu cifuti cetu ca Isaleli muakele vantuluue vavengi ha matangua a kananguizi Eliya, omo kalunga kanokele ha miaka itatu na vingonde vitanu na imo naua honi kuakele njala yakama mu cifuti coshe. <verse eid="LUK 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 4:26" />Eliya kuvamutumine kuli voshe, vuno honi kuli ntuluue uje keti Kayunda uje uakele mu limbo lia Zelefani kuyehi na nganda ya Sindone. <verse eid="LUK 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 4:27" />Kuakele vantu vavengi vakele nakuvavala mbumba mu Isaleli ha ntsimbu ya kananguizi Elisha, vuno honi naumo uahi yakanguisile kuvanga lika Namane uaku Siliya.”<verse eid="LUK 4:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 4:28" />Omo vantu vaje vakele mu njivo ya malombelo vazivile evi, vanienguele. <verse eid="LUK 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 4:29" />Vakatukile, kaha vakokelele Yesu hambaza lia nganda, vamutualele kuntsongo ya munkinda haje ha vatungile nganda yavo. Vatondele ngeci vakamumbile mu cimbongo. <verse eid="LUK 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 4:30" />Kaha Yesu uahitile mukati kavo nakuya.<verse eid="LUK 4:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yala ua Cimbembesi cacipi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:21-28">Mako 1:21-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 4:31" />Ambahoni Yesu uayile ku Kapenauma, nganda ya mu Ngalileya, kuje uakalongesele vantu ha litangua lia Sapalalo. <verse eid="LUK 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 4:32" />Vantu voshe vakomokele cikuma kuambulula cendi, muomu mezi endi akele na nzili yakama. <verse eid="LUK 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 4:33" />Kaha mu njivo ya malombelo muakele yala umo uakele na lihamba lia lipi, liatambekele cikuma. <verse eid="LUK 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 4:34" />“Naniee! Yove Yesu uaku Nazaleta, nkuma utonda kulinga vika kuno netu? Nkuma uneja nakutunongesa ndi? Njakuzivuka yove uapua umo Uakulela ua Njambi!”<verse eid="LUK 4:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 4:35" />Kaha honi Yesu uashikile cimbembesi cacipi nguendi, “Holoka kuluu huma muli muntu ou!” Kaha lije lihamba lia uisilile uje yala ha mavu ha mesho avo voshe, kaha ca humine muli ikeye kuakuhona kumuvetuesa.<verse eid="LUK 4:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 4:36" />Vantu voshe valikomokelele cikuma vaputukile kulihandekesa umo na mukuavo nguavo, “Nkuma mezi muka aua? Muntu ou ali na nzili ya kushika vimbembesi via vipi kaha vihuma.” <verse eid="LUK 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 4:37" />Vialingile Yesu vioshe va viuvuile mu mitambela yoshe yaku cihela cije.<verse eid="LUK 4:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akanguisa vantu vavengi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:14-17">Mateu 8:14-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:29-34">Mako 1:29-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 4:38" />Yesu uahumine mu njivo ya malombelo uayile ku njivo ya Simoni. Uauanene vainamueno ya Simoni vavavala lisika sika liakama cikuma. Kaha valombele Yesu linga avakangule. <verse eid="LUK 4:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 4:39" />Nankuma Yesu uayile kuli ikeye nakumukotamena, kaha uashikile lije lisika sika linga lihue kaha uakangukile na kuimana nakuputuka kuvapangela viakulia.<verse eid="LUK 4:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 4:40" />Hakulahuka ca litangua, voshe vaje vakele na mishongo yakuliseza seza vavanehele kuli Yesu, voshe uavasalekele mavoko endi na kuvakanguisa. <verse eid="LUK 4:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 4:41" />Kaha aje mahamba naua a huminemo mu vantu vavengi na kutambeka nguauo, “Yove u Muna Njambi!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 4:41">Vuno honi Yesu uashikile aje mahamba ngeci keti ahandeka nacimo cahi naua, muomu akeuo amuzivukile ngeci ikeye Kilistu.<verse eid="LUK 4:41" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ambulula mu vinjivo via malombelo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:35-39">Mako 1:35-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 4:42" />Omo kuacele Yesu uahumine mu nganda, nakuya kuali kaliendi lika. Vantu vaputukile kumutonda, omo vamuuanene vatondele kumuvindika ngeci keti ahume kuli vakevo. <verse eid="LUK 4:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 4:43" />Vuno honi uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi, “Njapande kuambulula Muzimbu Uacili ua Vumuene vua Njambi mu vinganda vieka naua, muomu evi vikevo via njitumine kulinga Njambi.”<verse eid="LUK 4:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 4:44" />Yesu uakele na kuambulula mu vinjivo via malombelo vioshe viamu Yundeya.<verse eid="LUK 4:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="LUK 5" />
  <para style="s">Yesu asana vandongisi va kulivanga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:18-22">Mateu 4:18-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:16-20">Mako 1:16-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 5:1" />Ha litangua limo Yesu uemanene ha ntunda ya cisali ca Ngenesaleta tele vantu vakele nakulisindika kuya kuli ikeye linga vovue lizi lia Njambi. <verse eid="LUK 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 5:2" />Kaha uamuene mato avali vana atutika ku mukulo ua cisali. Vaka kuta vatsi vahumine mu mato na kukusha manda avo. <verse eid="LUK 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 5:3" />Yesu uakovelele mu vuato vumo, vuje vuapuile vua Simoni, kaha uamulombele ngeci avusindikile halahako kamandende na hantunda. Yesu uatumamene mu vuato, kaha ualongesele cije civunga ca vantu.<verse eid="LUK 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 5:4" />Omo Yesu uamanusuile kuhandeka, kaha uahandekele kuli Simoni nguendi, “Sindikila vuato haje ha mema a kulova, kaha yove na vakueni teni manda eni linga mujevele vantsi.”<verse eid="LUK 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 5:5" />Simoni uamukumbuluile nguendi, “Muene, tunapanga cikuma vutsiki vuoshe vuno honi nacimo citunakuata cahi. Vuno honi nga yove unahandeka ngoco, kaha tukata manda.” <verse eid="LUK 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 5:6" />Vatele manda avo kaha vakuatele vantsi vavengi cikuma, kaha manda avo aputukile kutavuka. <verse eid="LUK 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 5:7" />Nankuma, vaniatelele vavusamba vavo vakele mu vuato vukuavo linga veje vaku vakuase. Vezile vashulisile mato oshe na vantsi mukemo vaputukile kuvombela. <verse eid="LUK 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 5:8" />Omo Simoni Petulu uamuene vije vialingiuile, uatsikamene ha mavuli ku mesho a Yesu nakuhandeka nguendi, “Muene, huma kuli yange, muomu yange njimuka vupi!”<verse eid="LUK 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 5:9" />Simoni na vakuavo vali komokelele cikuma ha kumona vantsi vavengi vava kuatele. <verse eid="LUK 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 5:10" />Simoni uakele na vavusamba vendi vavali Yakomba na Yiuano vana va Zembendeo, na vakevo valikomokelele cikuma. Kaha Yesu uahandekele kuli Simoni nguendi, “Keti uvue liova, hume hano ukata vantu.”<verse eid="LUK 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 5:11" />Vatutikile mato avo ku ntunda, vasezele vioshe, kaha vakavele Yesu.<verse eid="LUK 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akanguisa yala ua mbumba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:1-4">Mateu 8:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:40-45">Mako 1:40-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 5:12" />Tele Yesu ali mu nganda imo muje muakele yala umo uje uakele nakuyanda na mushongo ua mbumba. Kaha omo uamuene Yesu, uavulumanene ha mavu nakumulambelela nguendi, “Muene, nga utonda, uasa kunjikanguisa!”<verse eid="LUK 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 5:13" />Yesu uoluele livoko liendi nakumukuata kaha uahandekele nguendi, “Njitonda, kanguka!” Hajevene uakangukile. <verse eid="LUK 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 5:14" />Yesu uamushikile nguendi, “Keti ulekeko muntu umo cuma eci, vuno honi ya ukalisholole kuli kasasendote, ambahoni ukakombelele nkombelo ije yashikile Mosesa linga vantu voshe vazivuke nguavo vakukanguisa.”<verse eid="LUK 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 5:15" />Vuno honi muzimbu ua hali Yesu uashandokelele kuoshe, kaha vivunga via vantu vezile nakumuvuilila na kuvakanguisa ku mishongo yavo. <verse eid="LUK 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 5:16" />Vuno honi Yesu vintsimbu viavingi uakele nakuvaseza nakuya kuali kaliendi lika nakulombela.<verse eid="LUK 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akanguisa yala ua kalepa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:1-8">Mateu 9:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:1-12">Mako 2:1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 5:17" />Ha litangua limo omo Yesu uakele nakulongesa, Vafaliseho vamo na valongisi va mezi a Lishiko lia Mosesa vatumamene kuje, vaje vahumine mu vinganda vioshe mu Ngalileya na viamu Yundeya na viamu Yelusalema. Nzili ya Muene yakele hali Yesu mukukanguisa vantu. <verse eid="LUK 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 5:18" />Kaha vamala vamo vanehele yala muka kalepa vamulangekele ha citala tala, vesekele kumukovelesa mu njivo linga vamulangeke ku lutue lua Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 5:19" />Muomu ya civunga ca vantu, kuvauanene ngila yaku mukovelesela mukati. Nankuma, vamutualele helu lia njivo, vatuvile mbengua mu mateya, kaha vamusoselele na citala tala cendi ha mavu mukati ka civunga kulutue lua Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 5:20" />Omo Yesu uamuene lutsilielo luavo, uahandekele kuli uje yala nguendi, “Kavusamba kange, vipi viove vana vikonekela.”<verse eid="LUK 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 5:21" />Valongisi va mezi a Lishiko lia Mosesa na Vafaliseho vaputukile kulihandekesa vakevo vavenia nguavo, “Iya ou yala alinakushaula Njambi? Njambi lika ikeye muka kukonekela vupi!”<verse eid="LUK 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 5:22" />Yesu uazivukile viyongola viavo, kaha uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi, “Vikahoni mulina kuyonguela viuma via ngacije? <verse eid="LUK 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 5:23" />Nkuma cacasi cika, kuhandeka nguange, ‘Vipi viove vana vinavikonekela,’ indi kuhandeka nguange, ‘Katuka uende?’ <verse eid="LUK 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 5:24" />Njimimuesa linga muzivuke ngueni Muna Muntu ali na nzili yakama hano ha mavu ya kukonekela vipi.” Kaha uahandekele kuli uje muka kalepa nguendi, “Njikuleka nguange katuka, ambata citala tala cove, uye kuimbo liove!”<verse eid="LUK 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 5:25" />Kaha hajevene uakatukile hakati kavo, uambatele citala tala cendi uayile kuimbo nakushangazala Njambi. <verse eid="LUK 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 5:26" />Kaha voshe valikomokelele cikuma! Vovuile liova, vashangazalele Njambi vahandekele nguavo, “Lelo tunamono viuma via kukomouesa!”<verse eid="LUK 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu asana Levi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:9-13">Mateu 9:9-13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:13-17">Mako 2:13-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 5:27" />Hanima yeci, Yesu uahumineko kaha uamuene muka kutambula lisimu, lizina liendi Levi, natumama mu njivo yendi ya kutambuila lisimu. Kaha Yesu uahandekele kuli ikeye nguendi, “Njikave.” <verse eid="LUK 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 5:28" />Kaha Levi uakatukile, uasezele vioshe na kumukava.<verse eid="LUK 5:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 5:29" />Ambahoni Levi ualingilile Yesu ciuano cakama mu njivo yendi, kaha hakati kavaje vangenzi vavalaniene hakele vaka kutambula lisimu vavengi na vantu veka. <verse eid="LUK 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 5:30" />Vuno honi Vafaliseho vamo na valongisi va mezi a Lishiko lia Mosesa vaje vakundamene ku mpunga yavo valiniengelele kuli vandongisi va Yesu. Vehuile nguavo, “Vikahoni mulila hamo na kunua hamo na vaka kutambula lisimu na vaka vipi?” <verse eid="LUK 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 5:31" />Yesu uavakumbuluile nguendi, “Vakangule kuvekutonda cimbanda, vuno honi kuvanga vaka kuvavala lika. <verse eid="LUK 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 5:32" />Nankuma yange kunjezile mukusana vaka vusunga, vuno honi vaje vaka vipi linga vatenguluke.”<verse eid="LUK 5:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Cihula ca ha kuliumina kulia</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:14-17">Mateu 9:14-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:18-22">Mako 2:18-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 5:33" />Vantu vamo vahandekele kuli Yesu nguavo, “Vandongisi va Yiuano vakaliumina kulia vintsimbu viavingi na kulombela, na vandongisi va Vafaliseho naua vakalingi cuma cimo, vuno honi vandongisi vove vakali na kunua ntsimbu yoshe.”<verse eid="LUK 5:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 5:34" />Yesu uavakumbuluile nguendi, “Nkuma yeni mutalelela vangenzi ku ciuano ca vulo linga vaye na njala ndi? Muavusunga vene houe! Omo vavenia vulo acili navo kuvapandele kulinga ngacije. <verse eid="LUK 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 5:35" />Vuno honi litangua likeja omo vakahumisa vavenia vulo hakati kavo, ambahoni vakaliumina kulia.”<verse eid="LUK 5:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 5:36" />Yesu uavatelele naua cisimo eci nguendi, “Kuuasa kutavula citopeko ku kazaku kakaha na kucitongela ha kazaku ka laja. Nga ulingamo, kaha utavula kazaku kakaha, citopeko ca ntanga ya iha kucilitombola na ntanga yalaja. <verse eid="LUK 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 5:37" />Naua vene kuvekulongela viniu via viha mu vinjeke via vilambu via laja. Nga ulingamo vije vinjeke via vilambu vitavuka kaha viniu vihitila muangoco, kaha vije vinjeke via vilambu vikapihia. <verse eid="LUK 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 5:38" />Vuno honi viniu via viha vaka vilongela mu vinjeke via vilambu via viha. <verse eid="LUK 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 5:39" />Naumo uahi asa kunua viniu via viha hanima yakunua viniu via laja, muomu kahandeka nguendi, ‘Viniu via laja vikevio viacili cikuma.’”<verse eid="LUK 5:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="LUK 6" />
  <para style="s">Cihula ca ha litangua lia Sapalalo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:1-8">Mateu 12:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:23-28">Mako 2:23-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 6:1" />Ha litangua limo lia Sapalalo Yesu na vandongisi vendi vakele nakuhita mu mehia a tiliku. Vandongisi vendi vaputukile kutomona mitue ya tiliku, vaitsenene mu mavoko avo, kaha valile vinona. <verse eid="LUK 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 6:2" />Kaha Vafaliseho vamo vaje vakele kuje vavehuile nguavo, “Nkuma vika mulina kulingila evi kuvekulinga ha litangua lia Sapalalo?”<verse eid="LUK 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 6:3" />Yesu uavakumbuluile nguendi, “Nkuma kanda mutande vije vialingile Ndaviti na vaje vakele hamo nendi omo vazivile njala ndi? <verse eid="LUK 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 6:4" />Uakovelele mu njivo ya Njambi, uanonene ije mbolo ivakombelele kuli Njambi, ualile, na kuhanako naua vantu vendi. Mbolo ije kuya ku lishiko lietu kuvapandele kuyilia ku muntu uoshe kuvanga lika vasasendote.”<verse eid="LUK 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 6:5" />Kaha Yesu uamanusuile kuhandeka nguendi, “Muna Muntu ikeye Muene ua Litangua lia Sapalalo.”<verse eid="LUK 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akanguisa yala uakusekua livoko</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:9-14">Mateu 12:9-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:1-6">Mako 3:1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 6:6" />Ha litangua lia Sapalalo likuavo Yesu uakovelele mu njivo ya malombelo, kaha ualongesele. Muakele yala umo uakusekua livoko lia cilio. <verse eid="LUK 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 6:7" />Kaha valongisi va mezi a Lishiko lia Mosesa na Vafaliseho vamo vatondele kashuilo hali Yesu linga vamu uaneneho mulonga, nankuma vamutalele ntooma muyehi linga vamone nga ikeye akanguisa uje muntu ha litangua lia Sapalalo. <verse eid="LUK 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 6:8" />Vuno honi Yesu uazivukile viyongola viavo, kaha uahandekele kuli uje yala uakusekua livoko nguendi, “Katuka uije kuno kulutue.” Kaha uje yala uakatukile nakuya kuje. <verse eid="LUK 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 6:9" />Ambahoni, Yesu uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi, “Njimihula nguange, cuma muka vanatutavesa ha lishiko lietu kucilinga ha litangua lia Sapalalo? Kupanga viacili indi kupanga viavipi? Kuovola muono ua muntu indi ku unongesa?” <verse eid="LUK 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 6:10" />Uatalele kuli vakevo voshe noku noku, kaha uahandekele kuli uje yala nguendi, “Olola livoko liove.” Uoluele livoko liendi, kaha liakangukile.<verse eid="LUK 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 6:11" />Ha cuma eci valongisi va mezi a Lishiko lia Mosesa na Vafaliseho vakele na matoto, kaha valihandekesele hakati kavo vivapande kulinga kuli Yesu.<verse eid="LUK 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ahangula tunganda likumi na vavali</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:1-4">Mateu 10:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:13-19">Mako 3:13-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 6:12" />Ha ntsimbu ije Yesu ualondele ku munkinda na kulombela, kaha uakele nakulombela vutsiki vuoshe kuli Njambi. <verse eid="LUK 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 6:13" />Omo litangua liatuhukile, kaha uasanene vandongisi vendi linga veje kuli ikeye, kaha uahanguileho likumi na vavali hakati kavo, vaje vatumbuile tunganda. <verse eid="LUK 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 6:14" />Aua akeuo mazina avo: Simoni uje yalukile Petulu na munaina Anduleo, Yakomba na Yiuano, Filipu na Mbatolomeo, <verse eid="LUK 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 6:15" />Mateu na Tomasi, Yakomba muna Alufeya, na Simoni (uje ivatumbuile “Zelote.”) <verse eid="LUK 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 6:16" />Yundasa muna Yakomba, na Yundasa Sakaliote uje uamuendele vungungu.<verse eid="LUK 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu alongesa na kukanguisa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:23-25">Mateu 4:23-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 6:17" />Omo Yesu na tunganda vendi vahumine ku munkinda kaha vemanene ku mutambela uaku jalamanena. Na civunga ceka cakama ca vandongisi vendi vakele kuje nakumuvandamena. Naua civunga cakama ca vantu cahumine ku Yundeya kuoshe na ku Yelusalema, naku vinganda via ku cikuma ca Tile na ku Sindone na vakevo vakele kuje. <verse eid="LUK 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 6:18" />Vezile nakumuvuilila na kuvakanguisa ku mishongo yavo. Voshe vaje vakele nakuyanda na vimbembesi via vipi vezile, kaha uavakanguisile. <verse eid="LUK 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 6:19" />Kaha civunga coshe ca vantu vesekele kumukuata, muomu nzili yahumine kuli ikeye na kuvakanguisa voshe.<verse eid="LUK 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vikuisulo na tuyando</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:1-12">Mateu 5:1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 6:20" />Yesu uatalele vandongisi vendi, kaha uahandekele nguendi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:20">“Vakukuisula yeni vaka kuhutua,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:20">muomu Vumuene vua Njambi vunapu vueni!”<verse eid="LUK 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 6:21" />“Vakukuisula yeni muli na njala hano,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:21">muomu mukakuta!”</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:21">“Vakukuisula yeni mulinakulila hano,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:21">muomu mukajolelela!”<verse eid="LUK 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 6:22" />“Muvakukuisula omo vantu vamizinda na kumiviana na kumishaula na kumitumbula nguavo muva vapi, muomu ya kukava Muna Muntu!” <verse eid="LUK 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 6:23" />Joleleni omo eci cilingiua, kineni na kujolela, muomu Njambi namivuahesela cikandelela ceni cakama muilu. Muomu vakukuluila vavo valingile ngacije kuli tunanguizi.<verse eid="LUK 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 6:24" />“Vuno honi tuyando kuli yeni munafuku laja,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:24">muomu muatambula laja kuyoya cacili!”<verse eid="LUK 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 6:25" />“Tuyando tueni yeni munakuta hano,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:25">muomu mukevua njala!”</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:25">“Tuyando tueni yeni muli nakujolela hano,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:25">muomu muka pihilila na kulila!<verse eid="LUK 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 6:26" />“Tuyando tueni omo vantu voshe vali nakumishangazala, muomu vakukuluila vavo valingile muje vene ku tunanguizi va makuli.<verse eid="LUK 6:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Zangeni vitozi veni</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:38-48">Mateu 5:38-48</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 7:12a">7:12a</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 6:27" />“Vuno honi njimileka yeni vaka kunjivuilila nguange, zangeni vitozi veni, lingeni muacili kuli vaje vamizinda, <verse eid="LUK 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 6:28" />kuisuleni vaje vamisinga, kaha lombeleleni vaje vali nakumiyandesa. <verse eid="LUK 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 6:29" />Nga muntu akupupa ku litama limo, kaha mutenguluile akupupe ku litama likuavo naua, nga muntu akunieka kazaku kove, muhane naua na cikovelo cove. <verse eid="LUK 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 6:30" />Muntu uje amilomba muhaneni cuma cije canamilombo, omo muntu ambata cuma cove, kaha keti ucihule naua. <verse eid="LUK 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 6:31" />Lingileni ku vakueni vije vimutonda linga vamilingilevio.<verse eid="LUK 6:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 6:32" />“Nga muzanga lika vaje vamizanga, vikahoni mutambuila vishangala? Cipue vaka vipi vakazanga vaje vaka kuvazanga! <verse eid="LUK 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 6:33" />Nga mulinga lika muacili kuli vaje vaka kumilinga muacili, nkuma vikahoni mukatambuila vuana? Muomu cipue vene vaka vupi mukemo muvakalingi! <verse eid="LUK 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 6:34" />Nga mukumuisa lika vaje muavandamena ngueni vakamihiluisila, nkuma vikahoni mukatambuila vuana? Muomu cipue vene vaka vupi naua vakalikumuisa, linga vatambule ngue muje muvanahanena. <verse eid="LUK 6:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 6:35" />Vuno honi zangeni vitozi veni, kaha lingeni muacili kuli vakevo, vakumuiseni vuno honi keti muvandamene ngueni mukavitambula naua. Kaha vuana vueni vukapua vuakama, mukapua vana va Njambi ua Helu lia Melu. Muomu ikeye akevuila ngozi vaje kuve kumutsantsela na vaje vaka vipi. <verse eid="LUK 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 6:36" />Pueni vaka cikeketima ngue Ishueni uapua muka cikeketima.<verse eid="LUK 6:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kusompa vakueni</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:1-5">Mateu 7:1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 6:37" />“Keti musompe, kuteua neni vakamisompa, keti muhise, kuteua neni vakamihisa, konekeleni vakueni, kaha neni vakamikonekela. <verse eid="LUK 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 6:38" />Haneni, kaha neni vakamihana. Cikapua ngue muka kulandesa uje akuhana seteko ya vinona, aka izindangeya nakui niekumuna kaha akashulisisaho cikuma noho ishulisa mu vimbango via cisetekelo na kumuanianga kaha honi akakuhanavio vioshe. Seteko ije museteka nayo vakueni, ikeyo naua vakamiseteka nayo.”<verse eid="LUK 6:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 6:39" />Yesu uavatelele cisimo eci nguendi, “Kapuputua kasa kutuamenena kapuputua mukuavo, nga alingamo voshe vavali vakauila mucina. <verse eid="LUK 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 6:40" />Kukuesi ndongisi apulakana mulongisi uendi vuno honi ndongisi uoshe, omo namanesa kulilongesa cendi, na ikeye naua akapua hamo na mulongisi uendi.<verse eid="LUK 6:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 6:41" />“Vikahoni umona kacishoni kali ha lisho lia mukueni, vuno honi ku uyongola mukambo uli mulisho liove? <verse eid="LUK 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 6:42" />Vatihoni uhandeka na mukueni nguove, ‘Mukuetu, teua njikuhumise kacishoni kali ha lisho liove,’ omo yove uli na mukambo mu lisho liove? Yove muka civembulu! Ha kulivanga humisa mukambo uli mu lisho liove, linga umone muacili hakuhumisa kacishoni kali ha lisho lia mukueni.<verse eid="LUK 6:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Muti na vushuka Vuauo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:16-20">Mateu 7:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:33-35">12:33-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 6:43" />“Muti uacili ku uasa kuima vushuka vuavupi, cipue muti ua upi kuuasa kuima vushuka vuacili. <verse eid="LUK 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 6:44" />Muti uoshe vauzivukila ku vushuka vuauo, muomu kuuasa kuhela vushuka vua mukuyu ku muti ua mingonga cipue vushuka vua viniu ku muti ua mingonga naua. <verse eid="LUK 6:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 6:45" />Muntu uacili ikeye muka kusholola viuma via viacili via ku mutima uendi, muntu ua mupi akasholola viuma viavipi via ku mutima uendi muomu kanua kakahandeka vije viashula mu mutima.<verse eid="LUK 6:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vaka kutunga vinjivo vavali</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:24-27">Mateu 7:24-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 6:46" />“Nkuma vika munjitumbuila ngueni, ‘Muene, Muene’, vuno honi kumuekulinga vije vinjikamileke? <verse eid="LUK 6:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 6:47" />Njimileka cifua cendi uoshe uje eja kuli yange nakuvuilila mezi ange na ku uononoka. <verse eid="LUK 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 6:48" />Napu ngue yala uje atunga njivo yendi, uahindile nakulovesa luvula ha mavu a mavue. Livazi liezile liapupile kuje ku njivo, vuno honi kuyaningangele, muomu luvula luaije njivo luakele ha mavu a mavue. <verse eid="LUK 6:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 6:49" />Vuno honi uoshe uje evua mezi ange kuakuhona ku uononoka napu ngue yala uje uatungile njivo yendi kuakuhona kuhinda luvula. Omo livazi liapupile kuje ku njivo, kaha yasiukile hajevene, kuua kuayo kuapuile kuakupi cikuma!”<verse eid="LUK 6:49" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="LUK 7" />
  <para style="s">Yesu akanguisa ngamba ya mukuluntu ua masualale va Loma</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:5-13">Mateu 8:5-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 7:1" />Omo Yesu uamanusuile kuhandeka viuma vioshe evi ku vantu, kaha uayile ku Kapenauma. <verse eid="LUK 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 7:2" />Mu nganda ije muakele mukuluntu ua masualale va Loma uje uakele na ngamba yendi uaseho cikuma kuli ikeye. Uje ngamba yendi uavavalele kaha uatondele kutsa. <verse eid="LUK 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 7:3" />Omo uje mukuluntu uovuile lutsimo lua Yesu, uatumine vamo vakuluntu va Vayunda kuli ikeye nakumulomba linga eje mukukanguisa ngamba yendi. <verse eid="LUK 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 7:4" />Vezile kuli Yesu vamulambelelele cikuma nguavo, “Ou yala uapande kumukuasa. <verse eid="LUK 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 7:5" />Ikeye uazanga vantu vetu, naua uatutungilile njivo ya malombelo.”<verse eid="LUK 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 7:6" />Yesu uayile navo, vuno honi omo uahetele kuyehi na njivo, uje mukuluntu ua masualale uatumine vavusamba vendi kuli Yesu nakumuleka nguavo, “Muene, keti ukaluuise mutima uove muomu kucanjipandele yove ukakovele mu njivo yange. <verse eid="LUK 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 7:7" />Ngecivene nange naua kucanjipandele kuheta kuli yove. Handeka lika lizi, kaha ngamba yange akakanguka. <verse eid="LUK 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 7:8" />Njizivuka eci muomu nange uana nji lisualale uje ononoka vaje vanjituamenena, kaha nange naua njili na masualale vaje vanjikatuamenena, kaha njihandeka kuli umo nguange, ‘Ya!’ kaha aya, kaha naua kuli mukuavo nguange, ‘Ija!’ kaha eja. Njikahandeka kuli ndungo yange nguange, ‘Linga evi!’ kaha acilinga.”<verse eid="LUK 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 7:9" />Yesu ualikomokelele omo uovuile evi, kaha uatengulukilile kuli cije civunga camukavele, uahandekele nguendi, “Njimileka nguange, cipue vene mu Isaleli kunjauanenemo lutsilielo luakama ngue olu.”<verse eid="LUK 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 7:10" />Omo vaje vamala vavatumine vahilukile ku njivo ya uje mukuluntu vaka uanene uje ndungo yendi nakanguka.<verse eid="LUK 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu asangula muna ntuluue ua Yala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 7:11" />Munima yevi Yesu uayile ku nganda ya Naine, vandongisi vendi na civunga cakama vamukavele. <verse eid="LUK 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 7:12" />Omo ikeye uahetele kuyehi na cikolo ca nganda, kaha vantu vatuhuile civimbi hambanza, uje yala uatsile uapuile muana umolika uaumo ntuluue, kaha civunga cakama cahumine muje mu nganda cakele hamo na uje ntuluue. <verse eid="LUK 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 7:13" />Omo Muene uamumuene, kaha uamuvuilile cikeketima, kaha uahandekele kuli ikeye nguendi, “Keti ulile.” <verse eid="LUK 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 7:14" />Ambahoni Yesu uayile uakakuatele ku citala tala, kaha vaje tufunde vemanene. Yesu uahandekele nguendi, “Ove mukuenje, njikuleka nguange, hinduka!” <verse eid="LUK 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 7:15" />Uje yala uatsile uasangukile uatumamene nakuputuka kuhandeka, kaha Yesu uamuhanene kuli vaina.<verse eid="LUK 7:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 7:16" />Vantu voshe vovuile liova, kaha vashangazalele Njambi, vahandekele nguavo, “Kananguizi uakama neja kuli yetu na Njambi neja nakuovola vantu vendi!”<verse eid="LUK 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 7:17" />Kaha lutsimo olu lua Yesu luashandokelele mu Yundeya muoshe naku vinganda vioshe via kulihata.<verse eid="LUK 7:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tunganda vaje vatumine Yiuano muka kumbuitika</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:2-19">Mateu 11:2-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 7:18" />Omo vandongisi va Yiuano vamulekele viuma vioshe evi, kaha uasaneneko vandongisi vendi vavali. <verse eid="LUK 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 7:19" />Uavatumine kuli Muene nakumuhula nguavo, “Nkuma yove vene ukeja? Indi tuvandameneko ueka naua.”<verse eid="LUK 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 7:20" />Omo vamala vezile kuli Yesu vahandekele nguavo, “Yiuano muka kumbuitika natutumu kuli yove nakuihula nga yove uje eja indi tucivandameneko ueka naua.”<verse eid="LUK 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 7:21" />Ha ntsimbu ijevene Yesu uakanguisile vantu vavengi ku kuvavala cavo, naku mishongo yavo nakuhumisa vimbembesi via vipi nakuimuisa tupuputua vavengi. <verse eid="LUK 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 7:22" />Kaha uakumbuluile vandongisi va Yiuano nguendi, “Yemuye mukahandeke kuli Yiuano vimunamono nevi vimunovu. Tupuputua vamona, vilema venda, vaka mbumba vanalele, tusinda matuitui vevua, vatsi vasanguka, kaha Muzimbu Uacili vauambulula kuli vihutu. <verse eid="LUK 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 7:23" />Vakukuisula vaje kuvatsuntsuka mu lutsilielo luavo muomu yange.”<verse eid="LUK 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 7:24" />Omo vandongisi va Yiuano vahilukile, kaha Yesu ualekele cije civunga hali Yiuano nguendi, “Nkuma omo muayile kuli Yiuano mu mpambo vika muatondele kukamona? nkuma muayile mukumona lihongo litepuzoka na mpunzi ndi? <verse eid="LUK 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 7:25" />Nkuma muayile nakumona vika honi? Muntu nazala vuzalo vuasenga ndi? Vantu vakakuzala vuzalo vuasenga na kukala muacili vakala mu mapela a muene. <verse eid="LUK 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 7:26" />Njilekeni nkuma muatondele kukamona vikahoni? Muatondele kukamona kananguizi ndi? Eyo, ikeye vene, vuno honi muakamuene viakama kupulakana kananguizi. <verse eid="LUK 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 7:27" />Ou ikeye Yiuano uje visoneka vihandeka nguavio, ‘Njikatuma kanganda kange kulutue luove. Akavuahesa ngila yove.’ <verse eid="LUK 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 7:28" />Njimileka nguange, ku vantu voshe vaje vanakeleko, naumo uahi napulaka Yiuano. Vuno honi uje uamundende kumanusuilila mu Vumuene vua Njambi ikeye napulakana Yiuano.”<verse eid="LUK 7:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 7:29" />Vantu voshe hamo na vaka kutambula lisimu vononokele vusunga vua Njambi, kaha vavambuitikile kuli Yiuano. <verse eid="LUK 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 7:30" />Vuno honi Vafaliseho na valongisi va Mashiko a Mosesa vavianene vilinga via Njambi hali vakevo, mukemo kuva vambuitikile kuli Yiuano.<verse eid="LUK 7:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 7:31" />Yesu uahandekele nguendi, “Kuliveya njasa kusetekesa vantu va matangua ano? Nkuma vanapu ngue vika? <verse eid="LUK 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 7:32" />Vakevo vanapu ngue vanike vanatumama ku cihela ca kulandesela, kaha valitambakana umo na mukuavo, ‘Tunamimbilile miaso ya vushombolua, vuno honi kumuakinine! Tuamimbilile miaso ya vusiua vuno honi kumua lilile!’ <verse eid="LUK 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 7:33" />Omo Yiuano muka kumbuitika uezile, kalile mbolo cipue kunua viniu, kaha muahandekele ngueni, ‘Ali na mahamba!’ <verse eid="LUK 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 7:34" />Kaha omo Muna Muntu uezile, ikeye ualile nakunua, kaha muahandekele ngueni, ‘Taleni ou yala! Uapua muka mutupu na kupenda, kaha kavusamba ua vaka kutambula lisimu na vaka vipi!’ <verse eid="LUK 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 7:35" />Vuno honi mana a Njambi vana amuesa kupua a vusunga kuli vaje voshe va atambula.”<verse eid="LUK 7:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu mu njivo ya Simoni Kafaliseo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 7:36" />Omo umo ua Vafaliseho ualizina lia Simon ualaniene Yesu kulia nendi, kaha uakovelele mu njivo ya uje Kafaliseo nakutumama nakulia. <verse eid="LUK 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 7:37" />Kuakele mpuevo ua mu nganda ije, uapuile muka vupi. Omo uovuile nguendi Yesu ali na kulia mu njivo ya Kafaliseo, uanehele kantsazi ka mazi aluengo luakunika muacili. <verse eid="LUK 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 7:38" />Kaha uemanene kuyehi na viliato viendi, na kulila kaha uaputukile kujulisa viliato via Yesu na misozi yendi, ambahoni uavihundile navi nkambu viendi nakutsemba ku viliato viendi, kaha uamuitilile mazi ku mikono. <verse eid="LUK 7:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 7:39" />Omo Kafaliseo uje uamusanene uamuene eci, ualihandekese ikeye vavenia nguendi, “Nga ou yala uapuile kananguizi, ngue nazivuka cifua muka cou mpuevo na mukuata. Ngue nazivuka nguendi uapua muka vupi.”<verse eid="LUK 7:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 7:40" />Yesu uamulekele nguendi, “Simoni njili na cuma cimo njitonda kukuleka.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 7:40">Kaha uatavele nguendi, “Nkuma cikahoni Mulongisi?”<verse eid="LUK 7:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 7:41" />Yesu uamutelelele cisimo nguendi, “Kuakele vamala vavali vakumuine vimbongo kuli muka kukumuisa. Umo uakumuine vimbongo via Siliva viakupua vihita vitanu, mukuavo naua uakumuine vimbongo via Siliva makumi atanu. <verse eid="LUK 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 7:42" />Omo vahonouele kuvihiluisa, uava konekelele voshe vavali. Hakati kavo iya uje akamuzanga cikuma?”<verse eid="LUK 7:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 7:43" />Simoni uamukumbuluile nguendi, “Njasinganieka nguange uje ya hanene viavingi ikeye ya konekelele cikuma.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 7:43">Kaha Yesu uahandekele kuli ikeye nguendi, “Unahandeka muacili.” <verse eid="LUK 7:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 7:44" />Ambahoni uatengulukilile kuli uje mpuevo nakuhandekele kuli Simoni nguendi, “Uamumono ou mpuevo? Njakovelele mu njivo yove, ku uanjihanene mema akutana ku viliato viange, vuno honi natanesa viliato viange na misozi yendi na kuvihunda na vinkambu viendi. <verse eid="LUK 7:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 7:45" />Unahonouele cipue kunjitsemba, vuno honi kuhuma ntsimbu njakovelele muno mu njivo yove kecelele kutsemba viliato viange. <verse eid="LUK 7:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 7:46" />Ku uanjivuavesele na mazi ku mutue uange, vuno honi ikeye nanjitila mazi aluengo ku viliato viange. <verse eid="LUK 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 7:47" />Nankuma njikuleka nguange, vipi viendi vije viavingi vanavikonekela muomu na muesa cizango cakama, vuno honi uje ivanakonekela muvundende, akamuesa cizango ca cindende.”<verse eid="LUK 7:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 7:48" />Kaha Yesu uahandekele kuli uje mpuevo nguendi, “Vipi viove vana vanavikonekela.”<verse eid="LUK 7:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 7:49" />Kaha vaje vakele nendi ku mesa vaputukile kusinganieka nguavo, “Nkuma iya ou, uje asa kukonekela vipi?”<verse eid="LUK 7:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 7:50" />Kaha uahandekele kuli uje mpuevo nguendi, “Lutsilielo luove lua kuovola. Ya mu ciyulo.”<verse eid="LUK 7:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="LUK 8" />
  <para style="s">Vampuevo vaje vakavangeyele Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 8:1" />Hanima yevi, Yesu uakele nakuendangana mu vinganda na mu membo, nakuambulula Muzimbu Uacili ua Vumuene vua Njambi. Kaha uayile hamo na vandongisi vendi likumi na vavali, <verse eid="LUK 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 8:2" />na vampuevo vaje vahumisile vimbembesi via vipi na kuvakanguisa ku mishongo yavo. Umo uavo uapuile Maliya mangandalena uje muli ikeye uahumisile mahamba atanu na avali. <verse eid="LUK 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 8:3" />Mukuavo uapuile Njuana mpuevo ya Kuza, mukuluntu uakulama vitenga via mu njivo ya Helonde, Mukuavo uapuile Suzana na vakuavo vavengi, vampuevo ava vakevo vaje vakele nakukuasa Yesu na vandongisi vendi vukuasi vua vimbongo.<verse eid="LUK 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Cisimo ca muka kukuva vimbuto</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:1-9">Mateu 13:1-9</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:1-9">Mako 4:1-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 8:4" />Omo civunga cakama calikunguluile hamo, na vantu vavengi vahumine ku vinganda via kuliseza seza vezile kuli ikeye, kaha uaputukile kuhandeka navo muvisimo nguendi,<verse eid="LUK 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 8:5" />“Muka kuva uayile na kukuva vimbuto viendi. Omo uakele nakukuva vimbuto viendi, imo yauililile ku mukulo ua ngila kaha vantu valiatangeleleho na tuzila vailile. <verse eid="LUK 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 8:6" />Imo yauililile ha mavu a mavue kaha omo yasokele, yomine muomu kuyakele na mema. <verse eid="LUK 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 8:7" />Imo ya vimbuto yauililile ha mingonga, kaha omo yakolele vaituvile ku mingonga. <verse eid="LUK 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 8:8" />Vikuavo vimbuto via uililile ha mavu a cili, mbuto imo lika ya tuhuile cihita cavimbuto.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:8">Kaha Yesu uamanusuile kuhandeka nguendi, “Uje uoshe ali na matuitui, ovue!”<verse eid="LUK 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vutumbe vua visimo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:10-17">Mateu 13:10-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:10-12">Mako 4:10-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 8:9" />Omo vandongisi vendi vamuihuile nguavo, eci cisimo cilumbununa vika. <verse eid="LUK 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 8:10" />Yesu uavakumbuluile nguendi, “Kuli yeni vanamihana kuzivuka vushueke vua Vumuene vua Njambi, vuno honi kuli vamo njihandeka mu visimo linga, ‘Cipue vamona, vuno honi kuvamonesesa, kaha naua cipue vovua vuno honi kuvovuisisa.’”<verse eid="LUK 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu alumbununa cisimo ca muka kukuva mbuto</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:18-23">Mateu 13:18-23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:13-20">Mako 4:13-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 8:11" />“Eci cikeco vicilumbununa eci cisimo: mbuto ikeyo lizi lia Njambi. <verse eid="LUK 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 8:12" />Vimbuto vije via uililile ku mukulo ua ngila vinapu ngue vantu vaje vevua lizi lia Njambi. Kaha satana eja na kuambata lizi mu mitima yavo, linga keti vatsiliele nakuvovola. <verse eid="LUK 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 8:13" />Vimbuto viauililile ha mavu a mavue vinapu ngue vantu vaje vatambula lizi nakuvuahelelela omo valivua, vuno honi kuvesi na mizi, vakatsiliela lika mukantsimbu kakandende kaha omo vieseko vivauana vahilukila munima. <verse eid="LUK 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 8:14" />Vimbuto vije viauililile ha mingonga vinapu ngue vantu vaje vevua lizi lia Njambi, vuno honi kulinienga, na vufuko na senga via vuyoye via vatuvile. Kaha kuviakolele na kuima vushuka. <verse eid="LUK 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 8:15" />Vuno honi vimbuto vije via uililile ha mavu acili vinapu ngue vantu vacili vaje vali na mitima yacili, vovua lizi lia Njambi na kuliniunga na kukolesa ngoo noho vema vushuka.<verse eid="LUK 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Cisimo ca ndeya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:21-25">Mako 4:21-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 8:16" />“Naumo uahi a shuameka ndeya na kuishueka muintsi lia liendeko cipue kuyihaka muntsa muhela. Vuno honi vaihaka helu lia citumbiko linga uoshe akovela amone ceke.<verse eid="LUK 8:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 8:17" />“Vioshe vije vanashueke hano vikajomboloka na vioshe vije via kushueka hano vakavizivuka, na kuvineha ha ceke.<verse eid="LUK 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 8:18" />“Mukemo munapande kuivuilila muacili kuvilongesa viange. Vaje vali navimo vakatambula viavingi vuno honi voshe kuvesi nacimo vakavanieka cipue vije viavindende vivasinganieka nguavo valinavio.”<verse eid="LUK 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vaina na vamunaina ya Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:46-50">Mateu 12:46-50</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:31-35">Mako 3:31-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 8:19" />Kaha vaina ya Yesu na vamunaina vezile kuli ikeye na kumumona, vuno honi vahonouele kushuena kuli ikeye muomu ya civunga ca vantu. <verse eid="LUK 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 8:20" />Umo ua vantu vaje vakele kuje uamulekele nguendi, “Vanoko na vamunanoko vanemana hambanza, vatonda ku kumona.”<verse eid="LUK 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 8:21" />Yesu uamukumbuluile nguendi, “Vanana na vamunana vanapu vaje vovua mezi a Njambi na ku akavangeya.”<verse eid="LUK 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu aholuesa mankimba akama</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:23-27">Mateu 8:23-27</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:35-41">Mako 4:35-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 8:22" />Ha litangua limo Yesu uakovelele mu vuato na vandongisi vendi kaha uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi, “Tuyeni musinia lia cisali.” Kaha vaputukile kuya. <verse eid="LUK 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 8:23" />Omo vakele nakujavuka Yesu uayile mutulo. mankimba a mpunzi yakama akatukile mu cisali, ngeci na vuato vuaputukile kushula na mema, kaha vakele mu vukalu. <verse eid="LUK 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 8:24" />Vandongisi vayile nakumuhindula, nguavo, “Muene, Muene, tuli nakunonga!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:24">Kaha Yesu uahindukile uatenukilile ije mpunzi na mankimba, kaha vioshe vialikelele na kuholoka. <verse eid="LUK 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 8:25" />Yesu uavehuile nguendi, “Nkuma lutsilielo lueni luli kuli?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:25">Mu liova na mukukomoka valihuezele umo na mukuavo nguavo, “Iya ou? Ashika mpunzi na mema, kaha vimuononoka.”<verse eid="LUK 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akanguisa yala ua mahamba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:28-34">Mateu 8:28-34</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 5:1-20">Mako 5:1-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 8:26" />Yesu na vandongisi vendi vajavukile kuya ku cihela ca Ngelasa, cije cakele musinia lia cisali ca Ngalileya. <verse eid="LUK 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 8:27" />Omo Yesu uahetele ha ntunda, uali uanene na yala ua muje mu nganda uje uakele na mahamba. Ntsimbu yalaha ou yala kakele nakuzala vuzalo cipue kukala hembo, vuno honi uakele nakukala lika ku vihilo. <verse eid="LUK 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 8:28" />Omo uamuene Yesu ualilile cikuma na kuuila ku viliato viendi, kaha uatambakanene nguendi, “Utonda kulinga vika kuli yange, Yesu Muna Njambi Uakuhiana? Njikulomba keti unjiyandese!” <verse eid="LUK 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 8:29" />Uje yala uahandekele evi muomu Yesu uashikile cije cimbembesi cacipi linga cimuhume. Muomu ha vintsimbu viavingi cakele nakumuyandesa. Vantu vakele na kumukuta na malienge ku mavoko na ku mikono naku muniunga, vuno honi uakele nakuvatula kaha lihamba liakele nakumutuala mu mpambo.<verse eid="LUK 8:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 8:30" />Yesu uamuhuile nguendi, “Lizina liove yove iya?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:30">Kaha uamukumbuluile nguendi, “Tuvavengi,” muomu mahamba vavengi vakovelele muli ikeye. <verse eid="LUK 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 8:31" />Kaha mahamba vamulombele nguavo keti avatuale mu cina ca kuhona masima.<verse eid="LUK 8:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 8:32" />Kuakele vangulu vavengi vakele na kulia ku mukulo ua munkinda. Kaha mahamba alombele Yesu ngeci akovele muli vaje vangulu, kaha ua atavesele. <verse eid="LUK 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 8:33" />Ambahoni aje mahamba ahumine muli uje yala, aile muli vaje vangulu, kaha vaje vangulu vahumine ha munkinda vashatukilile mu cisali nakunonga.<verse eid="LUK 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 8:34" />Omo vaje vaka kuniunga vangulu vamuene vije vialingiuile, vashatukile naku kambulula mu nganda na mu membo akulihata. <verse eid="LUK 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 8:35" />Kaha vantu vayile nakumona vije vialingiuile. Omo vahetele kuli Yesu, vamuene uje yala yahumisile mahamba natumama ku viliato via Yesu, nazala na visinganieka viendi viakele muacili, kaha vovuile liova. <verse eid="LUK 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 8:36" />Vaje vavimuene valekele vantu vati muje uje yala uakele na mahamba muva mukanguisile. <verse eid="LUK 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 8:37" />Ambahoni vantu voshe vamu nganda ya Ngelasa naku vihela viakulihata valombele Yesu nguavo, ahume kuli vakevo muomu vateuele cikuma. Kaha Yesu uakovelele mu vuato na kulivuahesela linga aye. <verse eid="LUK 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 8:38" />Uje yala ya humisile mahamba ualombele Yesu nguendi, “Njikukave!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:38">Vuno honi Yesu uavianene uahandekele nguendi, <verse eid="LUK 8:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 8:39" />“Hiluka kuimbo ukavaleke viakama viana kulingila Njambi.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:39">Kaha uje yala uayile na kuleka vantu mu nganda vije Yesu namulingila.<verse eid="LUK 8:39" /></para>
  <para style="s">Muna Njailosi ua mumbanda na mpuevo uje uakuatele ku kazaku ka Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:18-26">Mateu 9:18-26</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 5:21-43">Mako 5:21-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 8:40" />Omo Yesu uahilukile ku Ngalileya, civunga ca vantu camutambuile, muomu voshe vakele naku muvandamena. <verse eid="LUK 8:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 8:41" />Kaha yala umo uezile kuli Yesu. Lizina liendi Njailosi mukuluntu ua njivo ya malombelo. Uauile ku viliato via Yesu na kumulomba nguendi, aye ku njivo yendi, <verse eid="LUK 8:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 8:42" />muomu munendi umo lika ua miaka likumi na ivali, uatondele kutsa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:42">Yesu uayile hamo nendi. Omo vakele nakuya civunga ca vantu vakele nakusindika Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 8:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 8:43" />Mu civunga cije vene muakele mpuevo uakele na mushongo uakuhita maninga ha miaka likumi na ivali vuno honi naumo uahi uamukanguisile. <verse eid="LUK 8:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 8:44" />Uezile munima ya Yesu kaha uakuatele ku mukunduilo ua kazaku kendi, kaha hajevene kuhita maninga cemanene. <verse eid="LUK 8:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 8:45" />Yesu uehuile nguendi, “Iya nanjikuata?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:45">Omo voshe vavianene Petulu uahandekele nguendi, “Muene vantu vakuzengeleka kaha naua vakusindika.”<verse eid="LUK 8:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 8:46" />Vuno honi Yesu uahandekele nguendi, “Kuli umo nanjikuata, muomu njazivuka nguange nzili yahumu muli Yange.” <verse eid="LUK 8:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 8:47" />Kaha uje mpuevo ha kumona ngeci vanamuzivuka, uezile kuli Yesu na liova oku alinakujaja na kuuila ku viliato viendi. Kaha ku mesho a civunga ca vantu uahandekele vika vije uakuatelele Yesu na muje muana kangukila mu vuasi. <verse eid="LUK 8:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 8:48" />Kaha Yesu uahandekele kuli ikeye nguendi, “Munange, lutsilielo luove lua Kukuangisa. Ya mu ciyulo.”<verse eid="LUK 8:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 8:49" />Omo tele Yesu acili nakuhandeka, kuezile yala umo kuhuma ku njivo ya Njailosi, kaha uahandekele nguendi, “Munove ua mpuevo natsi keti uyandese mulongisi naua.”<verse eid="LUK 8:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 8:50" />Vuno honi Yesu hakuvua eci uahandekele kuli Njailosi nguendi, “keti uvue liova, tsiliela lika, kaha akayoya naua.”<verse eid="LUK 8:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 8:51" />Omo Yesu uahetele ku njivo ya Njailosi, katavesele muntu kukovela nendi kuvanga lika Petulu, na Yiuano, na Yakomba, na vaishe na vaina vauje mumbanda. <verse eid="LUK 8:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 8:52" />Ha ntsimbu ije, vantu voshe vakele nakusikoka na kulila. Kaha Yesu uahandekele nguendi, “Eceleni kulila, katsile vuno honi nakosa tulo.”<verse eid="LUK 8:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 8:53" />Vamujolele, muomu vazivukile nguavo natsi. <verse eid="LUK 8:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 8:54" />Vuno honi Yesu uamukuatele ku livoko, kaha uahandekele nguendi, “Muanike, hinduka!” <verse eid="LUK 8:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 8:55" />Muono uendi uahilukile kaha ha ntsimbu ijevene uemanene. Kaha Yesu ualekele visemi vendi linga vamuhane viakulia alie. <verse eid="LUK 8:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 8:56" />Visemi vendi vali komokelele, vuno honi Yesu uavashikile linga keti valeke cipue umo vije vialingiuile.<verse eid="LUK 8:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="LUK 9" />
  <para style="s">Yesu atuma vandongisi likumi na vavali</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:5-15">Mateu 10:5-15</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:7-13">Mako 6:7-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 9:1" />Omo Yesu uasanene vandongisi likumi na vavali veje kuli ikeye, kaha uavahanene nzili yakama cikuma ya kuhumisa mahamba voshe na kukanguisa mishongo. <verse eid="LUK 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 9:2" />Kaha uavatumine kuya na kuambulula Vumuene vua Njambi nakukanguisa vaka kuvavala. <verse eid="LUK 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 9:3" />Uavalekele nguendi, “Keti muambate cuma cimo ha vungenzi vueni, cipue mbueti, cipue cola, cipue viakulia, cipue vimbongo, cipue vikovelo vivali. <verse eid="LUK 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 9:4" />Kuoshe kuje kuvaka mitambula muacili, tumameni ku njivo ijevene noho mukahuma mu nganda ije. <verse eid="LUK 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 9:5" />Kuoshe kuje vaka viana kumitambula, kaha omo muhuma mu nganda muje totomoneni likungu ku viliato vieni linga cipue vukaleho hali vakevo.”<verse eid="LUK 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 9:6" />Kaha vandongisi vayile, vaihitanganene mu membo oshe na kuambulula Muzimbu Uacili na kukanguisa vantu kuoshe.<verse eid="LUK 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Citanga ca Helonde</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:1-12">Mateu 14:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:14-29">Mako 6:14-29</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 9:7" />Omo Helonde, muka kusuana mu Ngalileya, uovuile viuma vioshe vialingiuile, kaha uakele na citanga, muomu vantu vamo vakele nakuhandeka nguavo, “Yiuano muka kumbuitika nasanguka ku vatsi.” <verse eid="LUK 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 9:8" />Kaha vamo nguavo Eliya nasholoka, vamo nguavo, “Umo ua tunanguizi vakulaja nasanguka.” <verse eid="LUK 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 9:9" />Kaha Helonde uahandekele nguendi, “Yiuano njamutetele mutue, vuno iya honi ou yala injili nakuvua viendi?” Kaha uatondele cikuma kumumona.<verse eid="LUK 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ahana viakulia makulukazi atanu a vantu (5,000)</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:13-21">Mateu 14:13-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:30-44">Mako 6:30-44</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:1-14">Yiuano 6:1-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 9:10" />Omo tunganda va Yesu vahilukile vamulekele vioshe vije vivalingile. Kaha uayile hamo navo uavatualele kualikaliavo lika ku nganda ivatumbuile Mbetesainda. <verse eid="LUK 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 9:11" />Omo civunga ca vantu vovuile evi, kaha vamukavele. Uavatambuile na kuvalongesa via Vumuene vua Njambi nakukanguisa vaje vakele nakuvavala.<verse eid="LUK 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 9:12" />Omo capuile cinguezi, vandongisi vaje likumi na vavali vezile kuli ikeye nakuhandeka nguavo, “Shandola vivunga evi linga vaye ku membo na ku mehia aje ali muyehi vaka liuaneneko viakulia vakevo vavenia noku kuakukosa, muomu muno munapu mu musenge uangoco.”<verse eid="LUK 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 9:13" />Vuno honi Yesu uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi, “Yeni vene vahaneni viakulia linga valie.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:13">Kaha vamukumbuluile nguavo, “Kutuesi na viakulia vieka kuvanga vimbolo vitanu na vantsi vavali. Nkuma yove utonda tuye na kulanda viakulia via civunga coshe eci ndi?” <verse eid="LUK 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 9:14" />Kuakele vamala vakupua makulukazi atanu kuje.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:14">Yesu uahandekele kuli vandongisi vendi nguendi, “Lekeni vantu vatumame ha mavu mu vivunga, ha civunga na ha civunga hakale vantu makumi atanu.”<verse eid="LUK 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 9:15" />Vandongisi valingile ngacije, kaha na vantu voshe vatumamene ha mavu. <verse eid="LUK 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 9:16" />Kaha Yesu uatambuile vije vimbolo vitanu na vantsi vavali, uatalele muilu, uatsantselele kuli Njambi, kaha uavipazuile, uavihanene kuli vandongisi vendi linga vavipangezele vivunga via vantu. <verse eid="LUK 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 9:17" />Voshe valile vakutile, kaha vandongisi vakunguluile vimbazuvuila vije viasaleleho, vashulisile mitonga likumi na ivali.<verse eid="LUK 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Petulu atava ngeci Yesu ikeye Kilistu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:13-20">Mateu 16:13-20</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:27-29">Mako 8:27-29</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 9:18" />Litangua limo omo Yesu uakele nakulombela kualikaliendi, vandongisi vendi vakele kuyehi nendi. Kaha uavehuile nguendi, “Vantu vali nakunjitumbula nguavo yange iya?”<verse eid="LUK 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 9:19" />Vamukumbuluile nguavo, “Vamo vali nakuhandeka nguavo yove Yiuano Muka kumbuitika, veka naua nguavo yove Eliya, vakuavo naua nguavo yove umo ua tunanguizi va laja uje nasanguka.”<verse eid="LUK 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 9:20" />Kaha Yesu uavehuile nguendi, “Nkuma yeni honi munjitumbula ngueni yange iya?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:20">Petulu uamukumbuluile nguendi, “Yove Kilistu ua Njambi.”<verse eid="LUK 9:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ahandeka viakulutue via tuyando tuendi na kutsa cendi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:20-28">Mateu 16:20-28</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:30">Mako 8:30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:1">9:1</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 9:21" />Ambahoni Yesu uavashikile nguendi keti valekeko muntu umo cuma eci. <verse eid="LUK 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 9:22" />Kaha uahandekele naua kuli vakevo nguendi, “Muna Muntu napande kuyanda cikuma, na kumuviana ku vakuluntu naku vakuluntu va vasasendote, naku valongisi va mezi a Lishiko lia Mosesa. Kaha vakamutuala ku kutsa, vuno honi hanima ya matangua atatu, vaka musangula.”<verse eid="LUK 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 9:23" />Ambahoni Yesu uahandekele naua ku vantu voshe vaje vakele kuje nguendi, “Nga muntu atonda kunjikava, napande kuliviana ikeye vavenia, ambate cilindakano cendi ha litangua na litangua, kaha anjikave. <verse eid="LUK 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 9:24" />Muomu muntu uoshe uje atonda kuniunga muono uendi akauzimbalesa, vuno honi muntu uoshe uje azimbalesa muono uendi muomu ya lizina liange akauovola. <verse eid="LUK 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 9:25" />Muomu seho muka iliho nga muntu anganiala mavu oshe, vuno honi anongesa muono uendi? <verse eid="LUK 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 9:26" />Nga muntu anjuvuila shuamua na vilongesa viange, kaha Muna Muntu naua nendi akamuvuila shuamua omo akeja mu vumpau vuendi na mu vumpau vua Ishe na mu vumpau vua tungelo vakulela. <verse eid="LUK 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 9:27" />Muavusunga njimileka nguange, kuli vamo kuno, vaje kuvakatsi kuvanga vanamono Vumuene vua Njambi.”<verse eid="LUK 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuhimpuka ca Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:1-8">Mateu 17:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:2-8">Mako 9:2-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 9:28" />Hanima ya matangua atanu na atatu omo uahandekele viuma evi, Yesu uayile hamo na Petulu, na Yiuano, na Yakomba ku munkinda nakulombela. <verse eid="LUK 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 9:29" />Tele ali nakulombela, cihanga cendi cahimpukile, kaha vuzalo vuendi vuatokele too ngue ceke. <verse eid="LUK 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 9:30" />Hajevene vamala vavali vasholokele vaputukile kuhandeka nendi, vapuile Mosesa na Eliya, <verse eid="LUK 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 9:31" />vaje vasholokele mu vumpau vua muilu kaha vakele nakuhandeka na Yesu ha ngila ije muakashulisisila vutumbe vua Njambi ha kutsila mu Yelusalema. <verse eid="LUK 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 9:32" />Petulu na vaje vakele navo vakele mu tulo, vuno honi omo vahindukile vamuene vumpau vua Yesu na vamala vavali vaje vemanene navo. <verse eid="LUK 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 9:33" />Omo Mosesa na Eliya vatonde kuya, kaha Petulu uahandekele kuli Yesu nguendi, “Muene, cacili kuli yetu nga tukala kuno! Tukatunga vintsingi vitatu, imo yove, imo ya Mosesa na imo ya Eliya.” Kazivukile vije viakele nakuhandeka.<verse eid="LUK 9:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 9:34" />Tele Petulu acili nakuhandeka, lishelua liezile na kuvafuika, kaha vandongisi vazivile liova omo lishelua liavafuikile. <verse eid="LUK 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 9:35" />Kaha lizi liahumine mu lishelua liahandekele ngualio, “Ou ikeye Munange injinahangula, muvuilileni!”<verse eid="LUK 9:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 9:36" />Omo lizi liaholokele, Yesu uakele halikaliendi lika. Kaha vandongisi vaholokele kuluu ha viuma vioshe evi, kaha ha ntsimbu ije kuvalekeleko muntu umo viuma vije vivamuene.<verse eid="LUK 9:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akanguisa muanike ua yala uje uakele na cimbembesi Cacipi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:14-18">Mateu 17:14-18</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:14-27">Mako 9:14-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 9:37" />Omo kuacele Yesu na vandongisi vendi vatatu vasikumukile kuhuma ku munkinda, civunga cakama caliuanene na Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 9:38" />Yala umo ua haje ha civunga uatambakanene nguendi, “Mulongisi, njikulomba tala munange, muomu ikeye lika muana umolika. <verse eid="LUK 9:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 9:39" />Evi vikevio vikalingiua nga lihamba limu uana, kaha atambeka na kushinia na kututumuna lifulu ku kanua, lika muvetuesa cikuma kaha ku liekumuecela vuasi. <verse eid="LUK 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 9:40" />Njalambelelele vandongisi vove ngeci vamuhumise vuno honi kuvasele.”<verse eid="LUK 9:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 9:41" />Yesu uakumbuluile nguendi, “Yeni vaka kujeneka kutsiliela na vantu vaka vupi! Nkuma lungahi honi njikakala neni? Lungahi honi mukeseka kusimpa kuange?” Kaha uahandekele kuli uje yala nguendi, “Neha kuno munove.”<verse eid="LUK 9:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 9:42" />Omo muanike uakele nakuija, kaha lihamba liamu uisilile ha mavu kaha uaputukile kushinia cikuma. Yesu uashikile cije cimbembesi ca cipi, uje muanike ua yala uakangukile kaha uamuhanene kuli ishe. <verse eid="LUK 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 9:43" />Kaha vantu voshe vali komokelele ha nzili yakama ya Njambi.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="LUK 9:43">Yesu ahandeka naua via kulutue via ha kutsa cendi</para>
  <para style="r" vid="LUK 9:43">(<ref loc="MAT 17:22-23">Mateu 17:22-23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:30-32">Mako 9:30-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:43">Tele vantu voshe vakele nakulikomokela ha vioshe vije Yesu uapangele, kaha uahandekele kuli vandongisi vendi nguendi, <verse eid="LUK 9:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 9:44" />“Ivuilileni keti musuve evi njimileka! Muna Muntu vakamuhana ku mavoko a vantu.” <verse eid="LUK 9:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 9:45" />Vuno honi vandongisi kuzivukile mucalumbunukile cuma eci. Vavashuekelele linga keti vacivuisise, kaha naua vovuile liova liakumuhula vije viahandekele.<verse eid="LUK 9:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">Iya uakama cikuma?</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:1-5">Mateu 18:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:33-37">Mako 9:33-37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 9:46" />Vandongisi vakele na vimpata hakati kavo ngeci iya honi uakama cikuma. <verse eid="LUK 9:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 9:47" />Yesu uazivukile viyongola via mu mitima yavo, nankuma, uasanene muanike uamundende, uamuimikile kuyehi nendi, <verse eid="LUK 9:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 9:48" />kaha uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi, “Uoshe atambula muanike ou mu lizina liange, kaha natambula yange vene, uoshe uje anjitambula, natambula naua uje uanjitumine. Muomu uoshe uje napu uamundende hakati keni muva voshe, ikeye napu uakama cikuma.”<verse eid="LUK 9:48" /></para>
  <para style="s">Uoshe uje kamiluisa ikeye alihamo neni</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:38-40">Mako 9:38-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 9:49" />Yiuano uahandekele nguendi, “Muene, tuamuene yala umo uakele nakuhumisa mahamba mu lizina liove, kaha tuamulekele linga alikele, muomu kakundamene ku civunga cetu.” <verse eid="LUK 9:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 9:50" />Yesu uahandekele nguendi, “Keti mumuvindike, muomu uoshe uje kamiluisa ikeye ali hamo neni.”<verse eid="LUK 9:50" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vantu vamo vamu Samaliya vaviana kutambula Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 9:51" />Omo matangua ashuenene kuyehi linga Yesu vamutuale muilu, uatenguluile viyongola viendi, nakuya ku Yelusalema. <verse eid="LUK 9:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 9:52" />Uatumine tunganda vendi kulutue, kaha vayile na kukovela mu limbo lia vaka Samaliya linga vaka muvuahesele vualumo kuakutulila. <verse eid="LUK 9:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 9:53" />Vuno honi vantu vakele kuje kuva mutambuile, muomu vungenzi vuendi vuapile vuakuya ku Yelusalema. <verse eid="LUK 9:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 9:54" />Omo vandongisi vendi Yakomba na Yiuano vamuene evi, vahandekele nguavo, “Muene, nkuma utonda linga tusane tuhia tua muilu tuije nakuvanongesa ndi?”<verse eid="LUK 9:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 9:55" />Vuno honi Yesu uatengulukile kuli vakevo na kuvavindika. <verse eid="LUK 9:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 9:56" />Kaha vayile ku limbo likuavo.<verse eid="LUK 9:56" /></para>
  <para style="s">Makalu akala hakukava Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:19-22">Mateu 8:19-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 9:57" />Omo Yesu na vandongisi vendi vakele nakuya mu ngila, yala umo uahandekele kuli Yesu nguendi, “Njikakukava kuoshe kuje ukaya.”<verse eid="LUK 9:57" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 9:58" />Yesu uahandekele kuli ikeye nguendi, “Vambanje vali na vina, na tuzila vali na mashua, vuno honi Muna Muntu kesi naha kusatela mutue uendi.”<verse eid="LUK 9:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 9:59" />Kaha Yesu uahandekele kuli yala mukuavo nguendi, “Njikave.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:59">Vuno honi uje yala uahandekele nguendi, “Muene, cakulivanga njitave njihiluke njikatsinde tahi tate.”<verse eid="LUK 9:59" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 9:60" />Yesu uamukumbuluile nguendi, “Seza vatsi valitsinde vakevo vavenia. Yove ya na kuambulula via Vumuene vua Njambi.”<verse eid="LUK 9:60" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 9:61" />Yala mukuavo uahandekele nguendi, “Njikakukava Muene, vuno honi ca kulivanga njitave njiye njikasalese tahi vavushoko vuange.”<verse eid="LUK 9:61" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 9:62" />Yesu uahandekele kuli ikeye nguendi, “Nga umo naputuka kulima na vangombe kaha atala kunima, kaha vipangi viendi kuvikapu viaseho mu Vumuene vua Njambi.”<verse eid="LUK 9:62" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="LUK 10" />
  <para style="s">Yesu Atuma vandongisi makumi atanu na avali na vavali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 10:1" />Hanima yevi Muene uahanguile vandongisi veka makumi atanu na avali na vavali. Kaha uavatumine kulutue luendi vavali na vavali vaye mu vinganda namu vihela kuje vavenia uatondele kuya. <verse eid="LUK 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 10:2" />Tele kanda vaye uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi, “Kuteja kuakama, vuno honi vaka kuteja vavandende. Lombeni kuli Muene ua kuteja atume vaka kuteja mu lihia liendi. <verse eid="LUK 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 10:3" />Yamuyeni! Kaha teleni njimituma kupua ngue vampanga mukati ka tungunga. <verse eid="LUK 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 10:4" />Keti muambate vikuama cipue cola cipue vinkaku, kaha keti mumeneke muntu uoshe mu ngila. <verse eid="LUK 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 10:5" />Ntsimbu yoshe nga mukovela mu njivo, cakulivanga handekeni ngueni, ‘Ciyulo cikale mu njivo ino.’ <verse eid="LUK 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 10:6" />Nga muli muntu ua ciyulo mu njivo ije, ciyulo ceni cikakala hali vakevo, nga keti ngoco kaha cikamihilukila. <verse eid="LUK 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 10:7" />Tumameni mu njivo ije, nueni na kulia vioshe vamihana, muomu muka kupanga napande kutambula fueto yendi. Keti muendangane ku njivo na njivo. <verse eid="LUK 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 10:8" />Nga mukovela mu nganda na vantu vamo vamitambula, lieni vivana mivuahesela. <verse eid="LUK 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 10:9" />Kanguiseni vaka kuvavala valimo, kaha handekeni kuli vakevo ngueni, ‘Vumuene vua Njambi vuneja muyehi neni.’ <verse eid="LUK 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 10:10" />Vuno honi nga mukovela mu nganda muje ku vamitambula, kaha yeni mu vingila muhandeke ngueni, <verse eid="LUK 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 10:11" />‘Cipue likungu lia mu nganda yeni lije lili ku mikono yetu tulitotomona linga limiluise. Vuno honi zivukeni eci ngeci, Vumuene vua Njambi vuneja muyehi neni.’ <verse eid="LUK 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 10:12" />Njimileka, ha litangua lia Kusompa Njambi akamuesa cikeketima ku vantu vamu Sondoma kupulakana vantu vamu nganda ije!<verse eid="LUK 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mu vinganda muje muakele vantu vakuhona kutsiliela</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:20-24">Mateu 11:20-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 10:13" />“Tuyando kuli yeni vaka Kolazini! Tuyando kuli yeni naua vaka Mbetesainda! Nga evi vikomoueso vivalingile mu vinganda vieni, ngue vavipangele mu vinganda via vaje keti Vayunda va mu Tile na Sindone, vantu ava ngue vatengulukile laja ha kuzala vinjeke naku likuita muto. <verse eid="LUK 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 10:14" />Ha litangua lia Kusompa Njambi akamuesa cikeketima ku vantu vamu Tile na Sindone kupulakana yeni. <verse eid="LUK 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 10:15" />Vuno honi yeni vantu vamu Kapenauma, nkuma mutonda vaka mijundule kuheta na muilu ndi? Houe, vaka mineha ha mavu nakuya mu Ngehena!”<verse eid="LUK 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 10:16" />Yesu uahandekele kuli vandongisi vendi nguendi, “Ou evuilila yeni novuilila yange, kaha nauje aviana yeni naviana yange naua, kaha nou aviana yange naviana naua nauje uanjitumine.”<verse eid="LUK 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuhiluka ca vandongisi makumi atanu na avali na vavali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 10:17" />Vaje makumi atanu na avali na vavali vahilukile nakuvuahelela cakama, kaha vahandekele nguavo, “Muene mu lizina liove na mahamba a tuvuililile omo tuakele naku uahumisa!”<verse eid="LUK 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 10:18" />Kaha Yesu uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi, “Eyo! Njamuene Satana aua muilu ngue muhiato. <verse eid="LUK 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 10:19" />Taleni, njamihana nzili yakama ya kuliata manoka na manieue, na kuhiana nzili yoshe ya citozi, kaha na cimo cahi cika mivetuesa. <verse eid="LUK 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 10:20" />Cipue ngocovene, keti muvuahelele hali eci lika, ngueni na mahamba amivuililile, vuno honi vuaheleleni cikuma ngueni mazina eni vana asoneka muilu.”<verse eid="LUK 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu avuahelela</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:25-27">Mateu 11:25-27</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 13:16-17">13:16-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 10:21" />Ha ntsimbu ijevene Yesu ua vuahelelele mu Cimbembesi Uakulela kaha uahandekele nguendi, “Njikutsantsela Tate, Muene ua melu na mavu, muomu unashueka viuma evi ku vaka mana na vaka kuzangama kaha uavisholola ku vanike vavandende, cili Tate, muomu omu mukemo mu uatondele linga cika lingiue.<verse eid="LUK 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 10:22" />“Tate nanjihana viuma vioshe. Naumo uahi azivuka Muana kuvanga Ishe cipue naumo uahi azivuka Ishe kuvanga Muana. Nakuli vaje Muana akatondo linga avashololueye.”<verse eid="LUK 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 10:23" />Ambahoni uatengulukilile kuli vandongisi vendi na kuhandeka kuli vakevo muvushueke nguendi, “Akukuisula aje mesho amona vije vimu mona yeni! <verse eid="LUK 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 10:24" />Njimileka nguange vavengi tunanguizi na vamiene vatondele kumona vimumona yeni, vuno honi kuva vimuene, naua vatondele kuvua vimuli na kuvua yeni, vuno honi kuva viuvuile.”<verse eid="LUK 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Cisimo camu Kasamaliya Uacili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 10:25" />Hajevene mulongisi ua mashiko uemanene mukueseka Yesu nguendi, “Mulongisi,” “Nkuma njinapande kulinga vika ngeci njikakale na muono uayaye?”<verse eid="LUK 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 10:26" />Yesu uamuhuile nguendi, “Nkuma vika vanasoneka mu Lishiko lia Mosesa? Nkuma vika ukatandamo?”<verse eid="LUK 10:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 10:27" />Kaha uamukumbuluile nguendi, “Zanga Muene Njambi yove na mutima uove uoshe, na muono uove uoshe, na nzili yove yoshe, na visinganieka viove vioshe, kaha zanga mukueni ngue muje ualizanga yove vavenia.”<verse eid="LUK 10:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 10:28" />Kaha Yesu uahandekele kuli ikeye nguendi, “Uahandeka muacili, linga eci, kaha ukakala muono uayaye.”<verse eid="LUK 10:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 10:29" />Vuno honi uje mulongisi uatondele kulisambuesa ikeye vavenia, uehuile Yesu nguendi, “Mukuetu ikeye iya?”<verse eid="LUK 10:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 10:30" />Yesu uamukumbuluile mu cisimo nguendi, “Litangua limo kuakele yala umo uahumine ku Yelusalema nakuya ku Yeliko, kaha ualiuanene na vezi. Vamushuluile vuzalo vuendi, na kumuveta na kuteua, na kumuseza na lezumuka. <verse eid="LUK 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 10:31" />Kaha capuile ngeci, kasasendote uayile mu ngila ijevene, kaha omo ua mumuene ou yala, uamuongolokele kumukulo. <verse eid="LUK 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 10:32" />Na Kalevi naua omo uahetele ku cihela cije ua mumuene nendi naua kaha uamuongolokele. <verse eid="LUK 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 10:33" />Vuno honi Kasamaliya umo uakele nakuhita mu ngila ijevene, omo uahetele ku cihela cije kuakosele uje yala, omo ua mumuene ua muvuilile ngozi. <verse eid="LUK 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 10:34" />Uashuenene kuyehi nendi nakumuhaka mazi na viniu ha vimbandu viendi kaha uamuzengeleho vintanga, ambahoni uamuhakele ha cimulu cendi na kumutuala ku njivo ya vangenzi, naku kamuniungilako. <verse eid="LUK 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 10:35" />Kaha liamukuavo uambatele vimbongo via muuaya uaya vivali nakuhana muka kuniunga njivo ya vangenzi, kaha uahandekele kuli ikeye nguendi, ‘Umuniunge muacili,’ kaha omo njikahiluka nja kukufueta vioshe vije viulinalikuasesa.”<verse eid="LUK 10:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 10:36" />Hanima yevi Yesu uehuile uje mulongisi ua mezi a mashiko a Mosesa nguendi, “Muviyongola viove nkuma iya hakati ka vantu ava vatatu uje ualingile ngue mundambo ua uje yala, ivaluisile vezi?”<verse eid="LUK 10:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 10:37" />Kaha uahandekele nguendi, “Uje uamumuesele ngozi.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 10:37">Kaha hanima yevi Yesu uahandekele kuli ikeye nguendi, “Eyo, ya ukalinge ngoco.”<verse eid="LUK 10:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu amenekela Mata na Maliya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 10:38" />Omo Yesu na vandongisi vendi vayile mu ngila, vahetele hembo haje hakele mpuevo ua lizina lia Mata ikeye uamutambuile mu njivo yendi. <verse eid="LUK 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 10:39" />Uakele na munaina Maliya, uje uatumamene ku viliato via Muene na kuvuilila ku vilongesa viendi. <verse eid="LUK 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 10:40" />Vuno honi Mata uangienguele muomu uakele na vipangi viavingi, kaha uezile kuli Yesu na kumuhula nguendi, “Muene, ku umono munanana na njecelela vipangi vioshe likaliange ndi? Muleke anjikuaseko.”<verse eid="LUK 10:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 10:41" />Vuno honi Muene uamukumbuluile nguendi, “Mata, Mata, yove ualijujukila na kuniengua muomu ya vipangi viavingi. <verse eid="LUK 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 10:42" />Vuno honi kuli cuma cimo citondeka. Maliya na hangula cuma cacili, cije ku vaka cihumisa kuli ikeye.”<verse eid="LUK 10:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="LUK 11" />
  <para style="s">Yesu avalongesa ha kulombela</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 6:9-13">Mateu 6:9-13</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 7:7-11">7:7-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 11:1" />Ha litangua limo Yesu uakele ku cihela cimo na kulombela, omo uamanusuile kulombela, umo ua vandongisi vendi uahandekele kuli ikeye nguendi, “Muene, tulongese kulombela ngue muje Yiuano muka kumbuitika mualongeselele vandongisi vendi.”<verse eid="LUK 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 11:2" />Yesu uavalekele nguendi, “Omo mulombela kuli Njambi lombeleni ngueni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:2">“Tatetu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 11:2">valemese lizina liove</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 11:2">Vumuene vuove vuije.<verse eid="LUK 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 11:3" />Tuhane lelo kulia cetu ca ha litangua na litangua.<verse eid="LUK 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 11:4" />Tukonekele ku vipi vietu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 11:4">muomu netu tukakonekela vaka kutuvulumuina,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:4">keti ututuamenene muvieseko.”<verse eid="LUK 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 11:5" />Ambahoni Yesu uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi, “Singanieka ngue uli na kavusamba kove kaha uyako mukati ka vutsiki na kuhandeka nguove, ‘Kavusamba, njatsantsela njilombako vimbolo vitatu lika, <verse eid="LUK 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 11:6" />muomu kavusamba kange neja mukunjimenekela kaha kunjesi na viakulia viaku mujumbula!’ <verse eid="LUK 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 11:7" />Kaha uje kavusamba kove oku ali mu njivo akutava nguendi, ‘Keti unjitanganese njapata laja ku njivo kaha yange na vana vange tuakosa laja, kunjasa kuhinduka na kukuhana cimo naua.’ <verse eid="LUK 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 11:8" />Njimileka nguange, cipue ngocovene kakahinduka na kukuhana viakulia muomu uapua kavusamba kove, vuno honi akahinduka na kukuhana vioshe vije viutonda muomu kuuesi na shuamua yakulomba kushuakumo. <verse eid="LUK 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 11:9" />Kaha njimileka nguange, lombeni, kaha vakamihana, tondeni kaha mukauana, toteni kaha vaka mishokoluela. <verse eid="LUK 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 11:10" />Muomu uoshe uje alomba akatambula, kaha uoshe uje atonda akauana, kaha kuli uje atota vaka mushokoluela. <verse eid="LUK 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 11:11" />Iya ishe hakati keni, nga munendi amulomba intsi, kaha ikeye amuhana linoka? <verse eid="LUK 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 11:12" />Cipue nga amulomba mayaki kaha amuhana linieue? <verse eid="LUK 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 11:13" />Nga yeni, vaka vupi muzivuka kuhana viacili kuli vana veni, nkuma honi cikafua vati kuli Ishueni ua muilu uje akahana Cimbembesi Uakulela kuli vaje vamulomba!”<verse eid="LUK 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu Vamutumbula nguavo Mbelezembulu muene ua mahamba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:22-30">Mateu 12:22-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:20-27">Mako 3:20-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 11:14" />Litangua limo Yesu uakele nakuhumisa lihamba lije lialingisile muntu kupua kaveveve. Omo lije lihamba liahumine kaha uje yala uaputukile kuhandeka. Omo vantu vamuene evi valikomokelele. <verse eid="LUK 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 11:15" />Vuno honi vamo vavo vahandekele nguavo, “Nahumisa lihamba mu nzili ya Mbelezembulu muene ua mahamba.”<verse eid="LUK 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 11:16" />Vamo vatondele kumueseka, kaha vamulombele linga alinge cikomoueso cije cimuesa ngue Njambi ikeye namutumu. <verse eid="LUK 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 11:17" />Vuno honi Yesu ha kuzivuka voyongola viavo, kaha uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi, “Vumuene vuje vulitepa hakati na kuliluisa vukevuo vavenia vukaua. Nga vantu vanjivo imo valiluisa hakati kavo kaha ije njivo ikaua. <verse eid="LUK 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 11:18" />Nga vumuene vua Satana vuli na vivunga vililuisa vikevio vavenia, nkuma vumuene vuendi vukakola vatihoni? Njinehula eci muomu yeni muhandeka ngueni, njikahumisa mahamba mu nzili ya Mbelezembulu. <verse eid="LUK 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 11:19" />Kaha nga njihumisa mahamba mu nzili ya Mbelezembulu, kaha vandongisi veni vaka likuasesa nzili yeya omo muvakahumisa mahamba? Eci cikeco vandongisi veni vaka mihisa. <verse eid="LUK 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 11:20" />Vuno honi nga njikahumisa mahamba mu nzili ya Njambi, kaha Vumuene vua Njambi vuneja kuli yeni.<verse eid="LUK 11:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 11:21" />“Omo nga yala ua nzili nalivuahesela laja vitua viendi aniunga njivo yendi, kaha vupite vuendi vuoshe vukaniungiua muacili. <verse eid="LUK 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 11:22" />Vuno honi nga uje ali na nzili yakumupulakana eja nakuluisa nakumuhiana kaha akambata vitua vioshe via uje muntu vije via tsilielele. Kaha akalipangezela na vakuavo vije vioshe vianevi.<verse eid="LUK 11:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 11:23" />“Kaha uoshe uje kesi kumutambela uange, muavusunga ikeye anjiluisa, kaha uoshe uje kakungulula nange ashandola.<verse eid="LUK 11:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuhiluka ca cimbembesi cacipi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:43-45">Mateu 12:43-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 11:24" />“Omo cimbembesi cacipi cihuma muli muntu, kaha cendakana mu mpambo kutalezeka cihela cakuhuimina. Nga kucasa kuuana cihela kaha cilihandekesa cikeco vavenia nguaco, ‘Njihiluka ku njivo yange kuje njahumine.’ <verse eid="LUK 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 11:25" />Kaha omo cihiluka ciuana ije njivo vanaikombo nakuihaka muacili. <verse eid="LUK 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 11:26" />Ambahoni ciya na kukaneha vimbembesi vitanu na vivali vieka vakupihia cikuma kupulakana cikeco kaha vikovelamo na kukalamo. Kaha kupihia ca muntu uje cakukotokela cikapua cacipi cikuma kupulakana cije cakulivanga!”<verse eid="LUK 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vikuisulo via vusunga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 11:27" />Omo Yesu uakele nakuhandeka evi, mpuevo umo uamuje mu civunga uje uakele nakuvuilila evi uatambakanene cikuma na kuhandeka nguendi, “Uakukuisula uje mpuevo uakusemene na kukulela!”<verse eid="LUK 11:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 11:28" />Vuno honi Yesu uamukumbuluile nguendi, “Vakukuisula cikuma vaje vovua lizi lia Njambi naku liononoka!”<verse eid="LUK 11:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Valomba Yesu cimueso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:38-42">Mateu 12:38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 11:29" />Omo civunga ca vantu calivuezelelele, Yesu uahandekele nguendi, “Vantu vavapi va matangua ano vatonda lika cimueso vuno honi kuvacimono, kuvanga lika cimueso ca Yona. <verse eid="LUK 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 11:30" />Ngue muje Yona uapuile cimueso ca vantu vamu Ninive, mucifua cimo vene na Muna Muntu akapua cimueso ca vantu va matangua ano. <verse eid="LUK 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 11:31" />Lisano uaku Shemba akemana nakuluisa vantu va matangua ano ha litangua lia kusompa na kuvahisa. Muomu uahuminine kulahako kuakuvua mana a Solomoni. Honi taleni! Umo uakupulakana Solomoni uno alikuno. <verse eid="LUK 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 11:32" />Vantu vaku Ninive vaka katuka nakuluisa vantu va matangua ano ha litangua lia kusompa naku vahisa. Muomu vantu vaku Ninive vatengulukile ku vilinga viavo via vipi omo vovuile kuambulula ca Yona. Honi taleni! Uakama cikuma kupulakana Yona uno alikuno!<verse eid="LUK 11:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ceke ca muvila</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:15">Mateu 5:15</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 6:22-23">6:22-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 11:33" />“Naumo uahi asa kushuameka ndeya yendi nakuishueka cipue kuihaka muintsi ya liendeko, vuno honi ihaka ha citumbiko, ngeci uoshe uje akovela mu njivo amone ceke. <verse eid="LUK 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 11:34" />Mesho ove akeuo ceke ca muvila uove. Nga mesho ove amona muacili kaha muvila uoshe ukashula na ceke, vuno honi nga mesho ove kuamono kaha muvila uove uoshe ukashula na milima. <verse eid="LUK 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 11:35" />Nankuma zangama ngeci ceke cije cili muli yove keti cipue milima. <verse eid="LUK 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 11:36" />Nga muvila uove uoshe uashulu na ceke, kua kuhona kapenga ka milima, kaha ukashula na ceke ngue muje ndeya muikaneha misha ya ceke hali yove.”<verse eid="LUK 11:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu anangula hali Vafaliseho na valongisi va mezi a Lishiko</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:1-36">Mateu 23:1-36</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:38-40">Mako 12:38-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 11:37" />Omo Yesu uamanusuile kuhandeka, Kafaliseo umo uamulaniene linga akalie nendi. Kaha Yesu uakovelele na kutumama nakulia hamo nendi. <verse eid="LUK 11:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 11:38" />Kafaliseo ualikomokelele omo uamuene Yesu katanene ku mavoko endi mukulia. <verse eid="LUK 11:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 11:39" />Muene uahandekele kuli ikeye nguendi, “Taleni, yeni Vafaliseho muka lelesa nganja na lilonga hambanza, vuno honi mukati keni muashulu na lizangamena na vupi. <verse eid="LUK 11:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 11:40" />Yeni vilema! Kumuzivuka ngueni, Njambi uje uatangele helu lieni, ikeye naua uatangele mukati ndi? <verse eid="LUK 11:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 11:41" />Vuno honi haneni ku vihutu viuma vije vili mukati, kaha viuma vioshe vikapua via vakulela kuli yeni.<verse eid="LUK 11:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 11:42" />“Tuyando kuli yeni Vafaliseho! Muomu mukahana kuli Njambi ca vulikumi ha viuma vije mukashingasana ha via kulia ngue minte, na luku, na visapa sapa vikuavo, vuno honi yeni muakala na civembulu ku vantu naua kumuazangele Njambi. Evi munapande kuvilinga kuakuhona kuecela vije vikuavo.<verse eid="LUK 11:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 11:43" />“Tuyando tueni, Vafaliseho! Muomu muazanga kutumama ha vituamo viacili mu vinjivo via malombelo, kaha muazanga vantu kumikandelela na kasingimiko mu vihela viakulandesela. <verse eid="LUK 11:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 11:44" />Tuyando tueni, muomu yeni muapua ngue vihilo vije viakuhona kumoneka. Vantu vakendeho kuakuhona kuzivuka.”<verse eid="LUK 11:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 11:45" />Kaha umo ua valongisi va mezi a lishiko lia Mosesa uahandekele kuli Yesu nguendi, “Mulongisi, omo uli nakuhandeka evi, uli nakushaula yetu naua.”<verse eid="LUK 11:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 11:46" />Kaha uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi, “Tuyando tueni, yeni naua valongisi va mezi a mashiko a Mosesa! Muomu mukatuika vantu viteli via kulema vuno honi yeni vavenia kumuekukuatako cipue na munie umo kukuasa vaje vajundula vije viteli. <verse eid="LUK 11:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 11:47" />Tuyando tueni, muomu mukavuahesa ha vihilo via tunanguizi vaje vavatsihile vakukuluila veni. <verse eid="LUK 11:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 11:48" />Nkuma yeni mulina vukaleho vuje mutava vije vivalingile vaje vakukuluila veni. Muomu vatsihile vaje tunanguizi kaha yeni muatungile vihilo viavo. <verse eid="LUK 11:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 11:49" />Nankuma ha cuma eci mana a Njambi ahandekele nguauo, ‘Njikavatumina tunanguizi na tunganda kaha vamo vavo vakavatsiha na kuvapakesa cikuma.’ <verse eid="LUK 11:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 11:50" />Nankuma vantu va ntsimbu ino vaka vazangamesa ha kutsiha tunanguizi voshe hume hakutanga ca mavu, <verse eid="LUK 11:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 11:51" />hume ha maninga a Avele nakuheta ha maninga a Zakaliya, uje ivatsihilile mukati ka mutula na Cihela Cakulela. Njimileka nguange, vantu va ntsimbu ino vaka vazangamesa voshe hali evi.<verse eid="LUK 11:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 11:52" />“Tuyando kuli yeni, valongisi va mezi a lishiko lia Mosesa! Muomu munanieke vantu sapi yakushokoluesa ku cikolo ca mangana, vuno honi yeni vavenia kumua kovelelemo, kaha muka vindika vaje veseka kukovelamo!”<verse eid="LUK 11:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 11:53" />Omo Yesu uamanusuile kuhandeka evi, uahumine ku cihela cije. Kaha valongisi va mezi a Lishiko lia Mosesa na Vafaliseho vaputukile kumuluisa cikuma na kumuhula vihula viavingi viaku munienguesa, <verse eid="LUK 11:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 11:54" />vavandamenene indi nga ahandeka viavipi linga vamukuateleho.<verse eid="LUK 11:54" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="LUK 12" />
  <para style="s">Cinangulo ca ha civembulu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:26-27">Mateu 10:26-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 12:1" />Ha ntsimbu ije vene vivunga via makulukazi a vantu viakungulukile hamo, vapuile vavengi mukemuo vakele na kuliliatangela umo na mukuavo, Yesu uaputukile kuhandeka kuli vandongisi vendi nguendi, “Liniungeni ku cimbaluila ca Vafaliseho, cije cikeco civembulu cavo. <verse eid="LUK 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 12:2" />Keti mupue ngue vakevo muomu nacimo cahi cakufuika cije kuvakakufula, cipue cakushueka cije kuvaka jombolola. <verse eid="LUK 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 12:3" />Viunahandeka mu milima vaka vivua mu mutania, nevi uayevetela ku muhela vaka vihandeka hambanza.”<verse eid="LUK 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Uje itunapande kuvuila liova</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:28-31">Mateu 10:28-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 12:4" />“Njimileka vavusamba keti muteue uje atsiha muvila kaha kuhumaho kasa naua kulinga cuma cimo. <verse eid="LUK 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 12:5" />Vuno honi njimileka uje imunapande kuteua. Muteue uje nga namanesa kutsiha muvila, hanga hali na nzili yaku miumbila mu ngehena. Eyo, njimileka muteueni.” <verse eid="LUK 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 12:6" />“Nkuma tumpiasa vatanu kuve kuvalandesa na vimbongo vivali ndi? Vuno honi naumo uahi uatuo uje ivakasuvu kuli Njambi. <verse eid="LUK 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 12:7" />Cipue vene vinkambu viaku mutue uove vana vitanda. Nankuma keti uteue, uli naseho yakama cikuma kupulakana tumpiasa vavengi.<verse eid="LUK 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kutava Yesu cipue kumuviana ku mesho a vantu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:32-33">Mateu 10:32-33</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:32">12:32</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 10:19-20">10:19-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 12:8" />“Njimileka nguange uoshe uje ahandeka ha civunga nguendi uakundama kuli yange, mucifua cimo vene na Muna Muntu naua aka muhandeka ku tungelo va Njambi. <verse eid="LUK 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 12:9" />Vuno honi uoshe uje anjiviana hakati ka civunga ca vantu, nange naua njikamuviana ku mesho a tungelo va Njambi.<verse eid="LUK 12:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 12:10" />“Uoshe uje ahandeka viavipi hali Muna Muntu vaka mukonekela, vuno honi uoshe uje ashaula Cimbembesi Uakulela ku vaka mukonekela.<verse eid="LUK 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 12:11" />“Omo vakamituala mu vinjivo via malombelo kuli vaka kuyula na vaka nzili yakama mukumieseka, keti mukalinienge vati muje mukaliluila yeni vavenia, kuli vije mukahandeka na muje mu mukavakumbulula, <verse eid="LUK 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 12:12" />muomu Cimbembesi Uakulela akamilongesa ha ntsimbu ije vimunapande kukahandeka.”<verse eid="LUK 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Cisimo ca muka kufuka ua cilema</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 12:13" />Muntu umo uje uakele mu civunga uehuile Yesu nguendi, “Mulongisi, leka muanetu linga tulipangele vitenga vije tate uatusezelelele.”<verse eid="LUK 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 12:14" />Vuno honi Yesu uamukumbuluile nguendi, “Kavusamba, iya nanjihangula kupua muka kuyula cipue muka kuimanena hakati keni?” <verse eid="LUK 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 12:15" />Kaha uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi, “Liniungeni! Zangameni ku miyati ya lizangamena lioshe: muomu vuyoye vua muntu kuvuesi mu vufuko vuendi.”<verse eid="LUK 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 12:16" />Kaha uavatelele cisimo eci nguendi, “Kuakele muntu umo uakufuka mu lihia liendi muakele viakuteja viavingi, <verse eid="LUK 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 12:17" />kaha uasinganiekele ikeye vavenia nguendi, ‘Nkuma njikalinga vati, muomu kunjesi na vishete viakama via kutulikila viakuteja viange?’ <verse eid="LUK 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 12:18" />Kaha uahandekele nguendi, ‘Njikalinga eci, njikasiula vishete viange na kutunga viakama, muje mukemo njikahaka vimbuto viange na viuma viange vioshe. <verse eid="LUK 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 12:19" />Kaha njikahandeka ku muono uange nguange, Muono, uli na viuma viavingi unalitumbikila ha miaka yaingi, huima, lia, nua na kuvuahelela.’ <verse eid="LUK 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 12:20" />Vuno honi Njambi uahandekele kuli ikeye nguendi, ‘Yove cilema! Vutsiki vuno vene muono uove vauambata. Kaha vije viuma viuna livuahesela vikapua vieya?’”<verse eid="LUK 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 12:21" />Yesu uamanusuile nguendi, “Omu mukemuo mucikafua ku muntu uje na litulikila vufuko vuavuingi ikeye vavenia, vuno honi kafukile ku mesho a Njambi.”<verse eid="LUK 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tsilieleni muli Njambi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 6:25-34">Mateu 6:25-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 12:22" />Kaha Yesu uahandekele kuli vandongisi vendi nguendi, “Nankuma njimileka nguange, keti mulinienge ha vuyoye vueni vimukalia, cipue vimukazala ha mivila yeni. <verse eid="LUK 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 12:23" />Muomu vuyoye vunapu vuaseho kupulakana viakulia, na muvila kupulakana vuzalo. <verse eid="LUK 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 12:24" />Singaniekeni makololo kuve kulima cipue kuteja, kuvakele na vishete cipue muakutulikila viakulia, vuno honi Njambi alina kuvalisa. Yeni muli naseho cikuma kupulakana tuzila. <verse eid="LUK 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 12:25" />Iya hakati keni mu kulinienga asa kuhakelako cipue ka ntsimbu kakandende ku vuyoye vuendi? <verse eid="LUK 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 12:26" />Nga honi kumuasa kulinga eci cuma cacindende, kaha vika honi muliniengela ha vioshe? <verse eid="LUK 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 12:27" />Singaniekeni vintemo muvikakolela, kuvie kupanga cipue kulizika. Vuno honi njimileka nguange, cipue vene muene Solomoni mu vufuko vuendi vuoshe kazalele vuzalo vuacili ngue vintemo evi. <verse eid="LUK 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 12:28" />Nga omu mukemo Njambi muakazikilamo vishoni via mu musenge, vije vikalako lika lelo kaha imene vavintsimika mu tuhia, nkuma yeni kasa kumizika ndi? Yeni vaka lutsilielo lua lundende.”<verse eid="LUK 12:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 12:29" />“Keti mutualeleleho kulinienga hali vimu kalia cipue vimu kanua. <verse eid="LUK 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 12:30" />Muomu vaka mavu vakevo vakatondo evi viuma vioshe. Vuno honi Ishueni ikeye azivuka nguendi muvitonda. <verse eid="LUK 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 12:31" />Vuno honi tondeni tahi Vumuene vuendi, kaha navioshe evi vaka mihanavio.”<verse eid="LUK 12:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vufuko vua muilu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 6:19-21">Mateu 6:19-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 12:32" />“Keti muvue liova yeni vutanga vuavundende vua vampanga, muomu Ishueni navuahelela kumihana Vumuene. <verse eid="LUK 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 12:33" />Landeseni vufuko vueni nakuhana vimbongo kuli vihutu. Livuaheseleni vikuama vieni vavenia vije kuvikapihia, na vufuko vua muilu vuje kuvuekuhua cipue vezi kuvasa kuvushuena na tuntembulu kuvasa kuvupihisa. <verse eid="LUK 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 12:34" />Muomu kuje kuli vufuko vuove, kukeko naua kukakala mutima uove.”<verse eid="LUK 12:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ngamba uakutalelela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 12:35" />“Livuaheseleleni vipangi na vindeya vieni vishuame, <verse eid="LUK 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 12:36" />ngue vangamba vaje vavandamena muene uavo ahuma ku cilika cavulo. Omo nga eja nakutota ku cikolo kaha hajevene vaka mushokuelela. <verse eid="LUK 12:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 12:37" />Vakukuisula vangamba vaje muene uavo akavauana okuvatona na kulivuahesela omo akeja. Muavusunga njimileka nguange, muene uavo akalizitula muiva uendi na kuvalania vatumame ku mesa na kuvahana viakulia.” <verse eid="LUK 12:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 12:38" />Vakukuisula vangamba vaje nga muene uavo eja avauana vanalivuahesela laja cipue eje hakati ka vutsiki cipue kuvandemba. <verse eid="LUK 12:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 12:39" />Vuno honi uvuisiseni eci, “Nga vavenia njivo akazivuka ntsimbu muka ije muizi akeja, ngue kekuseza njivo yendi vaituve. <verse eid="LUK 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 12:40" />Neni naua munapande kuli vuahesela, muomu Muna Muntu akeja ha ntsimbu ije kumua livuaheselele.”<verse eid="LUK 12:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ngamba uakulongua cipue uakuhona kulongua</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:45-51">Mateu 24:45-51</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 12:41" />Petulu uehuile nguendi, “Muene, nkuma uli nakutulekesa eci cisimo yetu lika indi na voshe?”<verse eid="LUK 12:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 12:42" />Kaha Muene uamukumbuluile nguendi, “Iya honi ngamba ua kulongua ua mana, uje muene uendi uamuhakele kuendesa vakuavo vangamba nakuvahana viakulia ha ntsimbu ya cili? <verse eid="LUK 12:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 12:43" />Uakukuisula uje ngamba omo muene uendi ahiluka amuuana ali laja ku vipangi. <verse eid="LUK 12:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 12:44" />Muavusunga njimileka nguange, muene uendi akamupuisa kupua mukuluntu ua vufuko vuendi vuoshe. <verse eid="LUK 12:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 12:45" />Vuno honi nga uje ngamba alihandekesa ikeye vavenia nguendi, ‘Muene uange nasimbula kuhiluka,’ kaha akaputuka kupupa vangamba vakuavo, va vamala nava va vampuevo na kulia na kunua na kupenda? <verse eid="LUK 12:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 12:46" />kaha muene ua uje ngamba akahiluka ha litangua lije kamuvandamenene na ha ntsimbu ije kazivukile, kaha akamuhana kashitiko na kumuhaka hamo nava kakuhona kulongua.<verse eid="LUK 12:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 12:47" />“Nga uje ngamba azivuka vije viatonda muene uendi, vuno honi kavivuahesa cipue kalingi vije viatonda muene uendi vaka muhana kashitiko ka kumupupa cikuma. <verse eid="LUK 12:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 12:48" />Vuno honi uje kazivuka vika vije viatonda muene uendi, kaha alinga viuma vije vifuila kashitiko vaka mupupa kavundende. Kuli uoshe vanahana viavingi, viavingi naua vakatonda kuli ikeye, kuli uje vanatulikisile viavingi, viavingi cikuma vakamuihula.<verse eid="LUK 12:48" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vantu valihangununa muomu ya Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:34-36">Mateu 10:34-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 12:49" />“Njezile nakuneha tuhia ha mavu, kaha njatondo ngue tunakuata laja! <verse eid="LUK 12:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 12:50" />Njili na cimbuitiko cije cinanji vandamena, kaha njinali shoshomuena kuvanga noho kumbuitika eci cinahiti! <verse eid="LUK 12:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 12:51" />Nkuma musinganieka ngueni njinanehe ciyulo hano ha mavu? Houe njimileka, vuno honi njinaneha kulitepa. <verse eid="LUK 12:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 12:52" />Hume hano ntanga ya vantu vatanu vakalitepa, vatatu valiluisa na vavali, kaha vavali valiluisa na vatatu. <verse eid="LUK 12:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 12:53" />Vakalipanga, vaishe vakaluisa vana va vamala, na vana va vamala vakaluisa vaishavo, naua vaina vakaluisa vana vavo va vampuevo kaha na vana va vampuevo vakaluisa vainavo. Vainamueno vakaluisa vaniotomueno yavo, kaha naua vaniotomueno vakuluisa vainamueno yavo.”<verse eid="LUK 12:53" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuvuisisa vintsimbu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:2-3">Mateu 16:2-3</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 12:54" />Yesu uahandekele ku civunga nguendi, “Nga mumona lishelua lihuminina mu kangombe kayambi, vuasi vuasi muhandeka ngueni, ‘Ikanoka’, kaha inoka. <verse eid="LUK 12:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 12:55" />Kaha nga muvua mpunzi ihuminina mu mbuela, muhandeka ngueni, ‘Kukayukuma’, kaha mukemo vene. <verse eid="LUK 12:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 12:56" />Yeni vaka civembulu! Muzivuka kulumbununa cifua ca mavu cipue ca melu, vuno honi nkuma vika kumuzivukila kulumbununa viuma via ntsimbu ino?<verse eid="LUK 12:56" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kulikonekela na muka nkole</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:25-26">Mateu 5:25-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 12:57" />“Nkuma vika muhonoua kuli yula yeni vavenia hakulinga viuma viacili? <verse eid="LUK 12:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 12:58" />Nga uya na citozi cove kunzango, eseka cikuma kulivuasana nendi mu ngila. Nga houe akakutuala kuli muka kuyula, kaha muka kuyula akakutuala kuli mukuluntu ua kamenga kaha akakutuala mu kamenga. <verse eid="LUK 12:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 12:59" />Njimileka nguange, ku ukahumumo kuvanga noho unafuete mbongo ya mamanusuilo ku mukuli.”<verse eid="LUK 12:59" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="LUK 13" />
  <para style="s">Kutengulukeni ku vipi vieni linga muovoke</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 13:1" />Ha ntsimbu ije kuakele vantu vamo valekele Yesu via Vangalileya vaje Pilato uatsihile, tele valinakulambula vinkombelo viavo kuli Njambi. <verse eid="LUK 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 13:2" />Yesu uavehuile nguendi, “Nkuma yeni muayongola ngueni vaje Vangalileya vakevo vapuile vaka vupi cikuma kupulakana Vangalileya voshe, muomu vakevo vavatsihile mu ngila eyi ndi? <verse eid="LUK 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 13:3" />Njimileka nguange, houe! Vuno honi nga kumutenguluka mukanonga ngue vakevo naua. <verse eid="LUK 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 13:4" />Singaniekeni vaje vantu likumi na vatanu na vatatu vaje vatsile omo njivo yalaha cikuma ya mu Siloame yavauililile. Nkuma musinganieka ngueni vaje vapuile vaka vupi cikuma, kupulakana voshe vaje vakele mu Yelusalema ndi? <verse eid="LUK 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 13:5" />Njimileka nguange, houe! Vuno honi kuvanga mutenguluke keti ngoconi mukanonga ngue vakevo naua.”<verse eid="LUK 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Cisimo ca muti ua mukuyu uakuhona Kuima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 13:6" />Kaha Yesu uavatelele cisimo eci nguendi, “Kuakele yala umo uakunine muti ua mukuyu mu lihia liendi. Kaha uayile nakumonako indi unemi vushuka vuno honi kavu uaneneko. <verse eid="LUK 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 13:7" />Kaha uahandekele kuli ndimi yendi nguendi, ‘Tala, mu miaka itatu njinakala nakuija nakutondako vushuka oku ku muti ua mukuyu, hanga nakamo kanjinauanako kahi. Utete! Nkuma vikahoni utualelelaho kushamuisa livu eli?’ <verse eid="LUK 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 13:8" />Vuno honi uje ndimi uamukumbuluile nguendi, ‘Muene, acitaleleleko muaka umo naua, njikahindako kuuzengeleka nakuhakako vuilo. <verse eid="LUK 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 13:9" />Nga ukema vushuka mungolosika, kaha muacili, vuno honi nga kuukemi, ambahoni njikauteta.’”<verse eid="LUK 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akanguisa mpuevo ha litangua lia Sapalalo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 13:10" />Ha litangua limo lia Sapalalo Yesu uakele nakulongesa mu njivo ya malombelo. <verse eid="LUK 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 13:11" />Kaha kuakele mpuevo uje uakele na cimbembesi ca cipi cije camu vavalesele miaka likumi na itanu na itatu. Kaha ikeye uakotamene kasele kuhetuka. <verse eid="LUK 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 13:12" />Omo Yesu uamumuene, uamusanene nakuhandeka kuli ikeye nguendi, “Mpuevo, unakanguka ku mushongo uove.” <verse eid="LUK 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 13:13" />Kaha Yesu uasalekele mavoko endi hali ikeye, kaha hajevene uahetukile na kuputuka kushangazala Njambi.<verse eid="LUK 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 13:14" />Vuno honi mukuluntu ua mu njivo ya malombelo uanienguele muomu Yesu uakanguisile muntu ha litangua lia Sapalalo, uakele na kuhandeka ku vantu nguendi, “Kuli matangua atanu na limo aje tunapande kupanga vipangi. Ijeni mu matangua aje linga vamikanguise, keti ha litangua lia Sapalalo.”<verse eid="LUK 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 13:15" />Ambahoni Muene uamukumbuluile nguendi, “Yeni vaka civembulu! Nkuma yeni kumue kushokoluela vangombe veni cipue vimulu veni nakuvatuala ku mema ha litangua lia Sapalalo ndi? <verse eid="LUK 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 13:16" />Taleni ou Mpuevo! Ikeye mutekuluila ua Avilahama uje yakutile Satana ha miaka likumi na itanu na itatu. Nkuma kuvapandele kumuzitula ha litangua lia Sapalalo ndi?” <verse eid="LUK 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 13:17" />Omo uahandekele evi, kaha vitozi vendi voshe vovuileshuamua, kaha vantu voshe va vuahelelele ha viuma viakukomouesa viacili vije vialingile.<verse eid="LUK 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Cisimo ca mbuto ya musalata</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:31-32">Mateu 13:31-32</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:30-32">Mako 4:30-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 13:18" />Ambahoni Yesu uavehuile nguendi, “Vumuene vua Njambi vunapu ngue vika? Nkuma njivusetekesa na vika? <verse eid="LUK 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 13:19" />Vunapu ngue muje, muntu anona kanona kamo kambuto ya musalata nakukakuna mu lihia liendi. Kaha kakakola kapua muti uakama, kaha tuzila veja vakutungila mashua avo ku mintango yauo.”<verse eid="LUK 13:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Cisimo ca cimbaluila</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:33">Mateu 13:33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 13:20" />Kaha naua Yesu uavehuile nguendi, “Vumuene vua Njambi njivusetekesa na vika? <verse eid="LUK 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 13:21" />Vunapu ngue cimbaluila cije mpuevo uanonele naku shingasana na vunga vua vuingi vua tiliku mu lilonga, noho mukasha uoshe uafutunukile.”<verse eid="LUK 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Cikolo ca cindende</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:13-14">Mateu 7:13-14</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 21">21</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 23">23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 13:22" />Yesu uahitile mu Vinganda na mu membo, ualongesele vantu oku ali mu vungenzi vuakuya ku Yelusalema. <verse eid="LUK 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 13:23" />Kaha umo uamuhuile nguendi, “Muene, nkuma vavandende lika vakovoka ndi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 13:23">Yesu uamukumbuluile nguendi, <verse eid="LUK 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 13:24" />“Licikinineni ngeci mukovele mu cikolo ca cindende, muavusunga muomu vavengi vakatonda ku kovelamo vuno honi kuvakasa. <verse eid="LUK 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 13:25" />Omo vavenia njivo akemana na kushoka lipito, kaha mukemana hambanza na kutota ha lipito ngueni, ‘Muene, tushokolueleko!’ Kaha akamikumbulula nguendi, ‘Kunjizivuka oku kumuhuma.’ <verse eid="LUK 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 13:26" />Ambahoni mukaputuka kuhandeka ngueni, ‘Tualile na kunua nove, kaha ualongesele mu vinganda vietu.’ <verse eid="LUK 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 13:27" />Vuno honi akahandeka naua nguendi, ‘Kunjizivuka oku muhuminina, humeni kuli yange, yeni voshe vaka kulinga viavipi!’ <verse eid="LUK 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 13:28" />Mukalila na kulishumanga ku mazo omo mukamona Avilahama, na Isake, na Yakomba, na tunanguizi voshe mu Vumuene vua Njambi, vuno honi yeni vakamiumbila hambanza. <verse eid="LUK 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 13:29" />Vantu vakahuma mu ngangela na mu kangombe kayambi, naku kunto na mu mbuela, vakatumama ku ciuano mu Vumuene vua Njambi. <verse eid="LUK 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 13:30" />Cilivene vaka kukotokela vakapua vaka kulivanga, kaha vaka kulivanga vakapua vakevo vaka kukotokela.”<verse eid="LUK 13:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu alilila Yelusalema</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:37-39">Mateu 23:37-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 13:31" />Ha ntsimbu ijevene kuezile Vafaliseho vamo kuli Yesu na ku handeka nguavo, “Unapande kuhuma kuno uye kueka, muomu Helonde atonda kukutsiha.”<verse eid="LUK 13:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 13:32" />Yesu uavakumbuluile nguendi, “Yeni mukamuleke uje mbanje ngueni, ‘Njicili nakuhumisa mahamba na kukanguisa vantu kumavezi avo ku litangua lialelo na imene, kaha ha litangua lia mucitatu ambahoni njikamanesa vipangi viange.’ <verse eid="LUK 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 13:33" />Cipue ngocovene njinapandele kuenda lelo na imene na imenevuze, muomu keti cacili kuli kananguizi kutsila kueka vuno honi kuvanga mu Yelusalema.<verse eid="LUK 13:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 13:34" />“Yelusalema, Yelusalema, yove muka kutsiha tunanguizi nakuasha mavue vaje vava tumine kuli yove! Vintsimbu viavingi njatondele kukungulula vantu vove hamolika ngue cali muakavutikiya vana vendi mu mambava endi, vuno honi yove ku uanjitavesele! <verse eid="LUK 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 13:35" />Tala, njivo yove ikasala ya mupulungua. Njikuleka nguange, kuukanjimono naua kuvanga noho ntsimbu ikeja omo ukahandeka nguove, ‘Uakuvezika uje eja mu lizina lia Muene.’”<verse eid="LUK 13:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="LUK 14" />
  <para style="s">Yesu akanguisa Yala uakuvavala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 14:1" />Ha litangua limo lia Sapalalo omo Yesu uayile ku njivo ya mukuluntu ua Vafaliseho na kulia, vantu vakele na kumutalela muyehi linga va uaneneho kashuilo. <verse eid="LUK 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 14:2" />Ha lutue luendi hakele yalauje uakele nakuvavala kuzimba mikono na mavoko uezile kuli Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 14:3" />Kaha Yesu uehuile Vafaliseho na valongisi va mezi a lishiko a Mosesa nguendi, “Cinapu cacili kuli Lishiko lietu ku kanguisa vantu ha litangua lia Sapalalo, indi houe?”<verse eid="LUK 14:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 14:4" />Vuno honi vaholokele. Kaha Yesu uambatele uje yala uakuvavala na kumukanguisa, nakumuecela aye. <verse eid="LUK 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 14:5" />Ambahoni uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi, “Nga hakati keni hali umo ali na muana cipue ngombe uje nauila mulisima ha litangua lia Sapalalo, nkuma hajevene kumuasa ku muhumisamo ndi?”<verse eid="LUK 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 14:6" />Kaha vahonouele kumukumbulula.<verse eid="LUK 14:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kulikehesa na kutambula vangenzi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 14:7" />Omo Yesu uamuene vangenzi vanahangula vihela via vituamo via vulemu, uavatelelele cisimo nguendi, <verse eid="LUK 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 14:8" />“Omo nga vanakulania ku cilika cavulo, keti ukatumame ha cituamo ca vulemu, muomu hamo kuli umo ua vulemu kupulakana yove ivanalania, <verse eid="LUK 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 14:9" />kaha uje uamilaniene muva voshe akahandeka kuli yeni nguendi, ‘Huma aha haunatumama linga ou yala atumame ha cihela cove.’ Kaha na shuamua ukambata cituamo ca cindende cakumanusuilila. <verse eid="LUK 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 14:10" />Vuno honi nga vanakulania, ya ukatumame ha cituamo ca cindende ca kumanusuilila, nga vavenia cilika akeja, akahandeka kuli yove nguendi, ‘Kavusamba, tumama ku cituamo ca vulemu,’ ambahoni uka tumama na vulemu ku voshe ukatumama navo ku mesa. <verse eid="LUK 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 14:11" />Muomu voshe vaje vaka lijundula vakevo vavenia va kavaneha ha mavu, kaha voshe vaje vakalikehesa vakevo vavenia vaka vajundula.”<verse eid="LUK 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 14:12" />Ambahoni Yesu uahandekele kuli uje uamulaniene nguendi, “Nga uhana viakulia ha ciuano, keti lika ulanie vavusamba cipue va vamunanoko cipue vavushoko vove cipue vaka kufuka, vamua lihata navo, ngeci hamo navakevo vakamisana naua, kaha eci cikamuesa ngue vali nakumifueta. <verse eid="LUK 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 14:13" />Vuno honi nga uhana viakulia ha ciuano, lania vihutu, na visualonda, na vilema na tupuputua, <verse eid="LUK 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 14:14" />nga ulinga muje, kaha ukapua uakukuisula muomu kuvakasa kukufueta, kaha vaka kufueta ha kusanguka ca vaka vusunga.”<verse eid="LUK 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Cisimo ca ciuano cakama</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:1-10">Mateu 22:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 14:15" />Omo umo ua vaje vangenzi vavalaniene kukulia uovuile eci, uahandekele kuli Yesu nguendi, “Uakukuisula uje akatumama ku ciuano mu Vumuene vua Njambi!”<verse eid="LUK 14:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 14:16" />Yesu uahandekele kuli ikeye nguendi, “Kuakele muntu umo uje ualingile ciuano cakama kaha ualaniene vantu vavengi. <verse eid="LUK 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 14:17" />Ha ntsimbu ya ciuano uatumine vangamba kuli vaje vavalaniene nguendi, ‘Ijeni, muomu vioshe vinavua laja.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 14:18" />Vuno honi umo na umo uakele nakuhana lisesa. Uakulivanga uahandekele nguendi, ‘Njinalanda lihia, kaha njitonda linga njikalimone, tambula lisesa liange.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 14:19" />Mukuavo uahandekele nguendi, ‘Njinalanda vangombe likumi, kaha njili nakuya na kuveseka, tambula lisesa liange.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 14:20" />Mukuavo naua uahandekele nguendi, ‘Njinambata mpuevo hano vene, nankuma kunjasa kuija.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 14:21" />Kaha uje ngamba uahilukile na kuambulula kuli muene uendi. Ambahoni uje vavenia njivo uanienguele kaha uahandekele kuli ngamba yendi nguendi, ‘Ya hano vene mu vingila na mu vitapalo via nganda unehe vihutu, na visualonda, na tupuputua na vilema.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 14:22" />Omo ngamba yendi uahilukile uahandekele nguendi, ‘Muene, viunashikile via lingiua, vuno honi hanga kucili cihela.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 14:23" />Ambahoni muene uahandekele kuli ngamba yendi nguendi, ‘Ya mu vingila via mumikulo na mu vitapalo via mumikulo, usindiye vantu veje vakovele mu njivo yange linga ishule. <verse eid="LUK 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 14:24" />Kaha njikuleka nguange naumo uahi kuli vaje vanjalaniene vaka makela ku viakulia viange!’”<verse eid="LUK 14:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Makalu akala mukukava Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:37-38">Mateu 10:37-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 14:25" />Litangua limo omo vantu vavengi vayile na Yesu, kaha uatengulukile na kuhandeka kuli vakevo nguendi, <verse eid="LUK 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 14:26" />“Uoshe uje eja kuli yange vuno honi kazindi vaishe na vaina, na mpueyendi na vana vendi, na vamunaina va vamala na vamunaina va vampuevo, cilivene, cipue muono uendi, kasa kupua ndongisi uange. <verse eid="LUK 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 14:27" />Uoshe uje kambata cilindakano cendi na kunjikava kasa kupua ndongisi uange. <verse eid="LUK 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 14:28" />Nga utonda kutunga njivo yalaha, unapande kutumama ha mavu na kumona vije vitondeka, kumona nga uasa kuimanusula. <verse eid="LUK 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 14:29" />Vuno honi nga uputukila kuhinda luvula, kuhumaho ku imanesa, kaha voshe vaje vakaimona kaha vakakujola <verse eid="LUK 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 14:30" />na kuhandeka nguavo, ‘Uje mukuetu uaputukile kutunga vuno honi nahonoua.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 14:31" />Cipue muene, nga aya ku nzita na kulua na mukuavo muene, nkuma kasa kutumama ha mavu na kumona nga asa kulua na vantu va kupua makulukazi likumi na uje mukuavo eja na vantu vakupua makulukazi makumi avali. <verse eid="LUK 14:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 14:32" />Nga kasa, kaha omo mukuavo acili kulahako, akatumako vantu linga vakahandeke via ciyulo. <verse eid="LUK 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 14:33" />Mucifua cimo vene,” “Naumo uahi hali yeni apua ndongisi uange nga kaseze vioshe vianafuku.<verse eid="LUK 14:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Muongua ua kushamuka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:13">Mateu 5:13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:50">Mako 9:50</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 14:34" />“Muongua uapua uacili, vuno honi nga uanashamuka kaha kutovala cauo cikahiluka vati? <verse eid="LUK 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 14:35" />Ku ukapu uacili ku mavu cipue ku vuilo, vaka umbila kuti. Uoshe ali na matuitui, ovue!”<verse eid="LUK 14:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="LUK 15" />
  <para style="s">Cisimo ca mpanga ua kuzimbala</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:12-14">Mateu 18:12-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 15:1" />Ha litangua limo omo vaka kutambula lisimu vavengi na vaka vipi vezile na kuvuilila Yesu, <verse eid="LUK 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 15:2" />vuno honi Vafaliseho na valongisi va mezi a mashiko a Mosesa vakele nakuningozola na kuhandeka nguavo, “Ou yala alinakutambula vaka vupi na kulia navo.” <verse eid="LUK 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 15:3" />Ambahoni Yesu uavatelele cisimo eci nguendi,<verse eid="LUK 15:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 15:4" />“Nkuma iya hali yeni nga ali na vampanga cihita kaha azimbalesaho umo, nkuma kaseze vaje makumi atanu na auana na vatanu na vauana (99) mu musenge na kuya nakutonda uje nazimbala kuvanga noho na muuana ndi? <verse eid="LUK 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 15:5" />Kaha nga omo namuuana, avuahelela na kumuhaka ha vitsili viendi, <verse eid="LUK 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 15:6" />kaha omo aya kuimbo, akasana vavusamba vendi nava vaje valihata navo kaha akahandeka nguendi, ‘Vuaheleleni hamo nange muomu njinauana mpanga uange uje uazimbalele.’ <verse eid="LUK 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 15:7" />Njimileka nguange, mucifua cimo vene kukapua kuvuahelela kuakama muilu hali muka vupi umo nga natenguluka kupulakana vaje makumi atanu na auana na vatanu na vauana vantu vaje kuvatondo kutenguluka.”<verse eid="LUK 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Cisimo ca mbongo ya muuaya uaya ya kuzimbala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 15:8" />Yesu uatualeleleho kutela vantu cisimo eci nguendi, “Nga mpuevo ali na vimbongo via muuaya uaya likumi, nga hazimbala imo, nkuma kashuameka ndeya yendi, nakukomba mu njivo na kutonda vuino kuvanga noho hakaiuanena ndi? <verse eid="LUK 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 15:9" />Kaha omo ayiuana, akasana vavusamba vendi nava valihata navo na kuvaleka nguendi, ‘Vuaheleleni hamo nange muomu njina iuana mbongo yange ije njazimbalesele.’ <verse eid="LUK 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 15:10" />Njimileka nguange, mucifua cimo vene, muli kuvuahelela hakati katungelo va Njambi hali umo muka vupi uje atenguluka.”<verse eid="LUK 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Cisimo ca muana ua kuzimbala.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 15:11" />Yesu uatualeleleho kuhandeka nguendi, “Kuakele yala uakele na vana va vamala vavali, <verse eid="LUK 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 15:12" />ua muanike uahandekele kuli ishe nguendi, ‘Tate, njihaneko mutambela ua vufuko vuange,’ kaha ishavo uavapangelele vufuko vuendi hakati kavo vavali. <verse eid="LUK 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 15:13" />Kukuahitile ntsimbu ya laha kuhuma haje, ua muanike uambatele vioshe uakele navio na kuya ku cifuti cakulahako na kupihisa viuma viendi vioshe kusenga. <verse eid="LUK 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 15:14" />Muamanusuile kupihisa viuma viendi vioshe, kaha kuakele njala yakama mu cifuti coshe, kaha uaputukile kutsa njala na vuhutu. <verse eid="LUK 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 15:15" />Kaha uayile na kutonda vipangi kuli muntu umo uamu cifuti cije kaha ua mutualele ku lihia nakulisa vangulu. <verse eid="LUK 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 15:16" />Uatondele kulia vije vakele na kulia vangulu, vuno honi naumo uahi uamuhaneneko cimo ca kulia. <verse eid="LUK 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 15:17" />Omo mana ahilukile muli ikeye, uahandekele kuli ikeye vavenia nguendi, ‘Vaka kupanga va vatate vali na viakulia viavingi, yange kuno njili nakutsa njala! <verse eid="LUK 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 15:18" />Njikuta vungenzi njihiluke kuli tate kaha njikahandeka kuli ikeye nguange, “Tate, njapihisila Njambi nove, <verse eid="LUK 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 15:19" />kunjapandele naua kunjisana munove, njipuise umo ua vaka kupanga vove.”’ <verse eid="LUK 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 15:20" />Kaha uakatukile nakuya kuli ishe.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 15:20">“Omo uakele nakuendela halahako, ishe uamumuene kaha ua muvuililile cikeketima kaha ishe uamushatukilile, uamuvumbatelele na kumutsemba. <verse eid="LUK 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 15:21" />Muana uahandekele kuli ikeye nguendi, ‘Tate njapihisila Njambi nove. Kunjapandele naua kunjisana munove.’ <verse eid="LUK 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 15:22" />Vuno honi ishe uahandekele kuli vangamba vendi nguendi, ‘Zambuleni! Neheni cikovelo cacili mu muzike nakumuzika kanzeya ku munie uendi na vinkaku ku viliato viendi. <verse eid="LUK 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 15:23" />Neheni muna ngombe uakuhindala mu mutsihe, kaha tulieni na kuvuahelela, <verse eid="LUK 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 15:24" />muomu munange ou uatsile vuno honi ayoya naua, uazimbalele vuno honi tuna muuana.’ Kaha vaputukile kulia na kuvuahelela.<verse eid="LUK 15:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 15:25" />“Ha ntsimbu ijevene, muana ua mukuluntu uakele mu lihia. Omo uezile kuyehi na njivo, uovuile vaje vakele nakuimba na kukina. <verse eid="LUK 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 15:26" />Kaha uasanene umo ua vangamba na kumuhula nguendi, ‘Vika vili nakulingiua.’ <verse eid="LUK 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 15:27" />Uamukumbuluile nguendi, ‘Munanoko ikeye neja kaha isho natsihi muna ngombe uakuhindala muomu nahiluka oku alimuacili.’ <verse eid="LUK 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 15:28" />Muana ua mukuluntu uanienguele na kuviana kukovela mu njivo. Kaha ishe uatuhukile na kumulambelela linga akovele mu njivo. <verse eid="LUK 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 15:29" />Vuno honi uakumbuluile ishe nguendi, ‘Tala! Ha miaka yoshe njinakupangela ngue ndungo kaha kunjashauile mashiko ove. Vuno honi ku uanjihaneko cipue muna mpembe linga njivuahelele na vavusamba vange. <verse eid="LUK 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 15:30" />Vuno honi omo ou munove nahiluka, uje na pihisa vufuko vuove na vukoyi kaha neja kuimbo, kaha una mutsihila muna ngombe uakuhindala!’ <verse eid="LUK 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 15:31" />Ishe uahandekele kuli ikeye nguendi, ‘Munange, ntsimbu yoshe unakele nange, kaha vioshe njilinavio vinapu viove. <verse eid="LUK 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 15:32" />Vuno honi tuapande kuvuahelela na kujolela, muomu shongoyove ou uatsile kaha ayoya naua, uazimbalele vuno honi vanamuuana.’”<verse eid="LUK 15:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="LUK 16" />
  <para style="s">Cisimo ca muka kutulika uakuzangama</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 16:1" />Yesu uahandekele kuli vandongisi vendi nguendi, “Kuakele yala umo ua kufuka uje uakele na muka kutulika vufuko vuendi. Muka kufuka uje vamulekele nguavo muka kutulika vitenga viove ali nakupihisa vimbongo viove. <verse eid="LUK 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 16:2" />Kaha uamusanene na kuhandeka nguendi, ‘Vika evi njili nakuvua hali yove? Njihane vukaleho vua viuma vioshe muje munatulikilamo vufuko vuange, muomu ku ukapu naua muka kutulika uange.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 16:3" />Muka kutulika ualihandekesele ikeye vavenia nguendi, ‘Nga muene uange anjihumisa vipangi, njilinga vatihoni? Kunjesi na nzili yakulima, nganjihuma vipangi kuno, kaha naua njili na shuamua yakulomba. <verse eid="LUK 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 16:4" />Kaha honi njazivuka vinjikalinga omo vipangi viange vikahua, ngeci vantu vakanjitambule mu vinjivo viavo!’ <verse eid="LUK 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 16:5" />Kaha uasanene vantu vaje vakele na mikuli kuli muene uendi. Uehuile uakulivanga nguendi, ‘Vungahi uakonguele kuli muene uange?’ <verse eid="LUK 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 16:6" />Uamukumbuluile nguendi, ‘Vihita vitanu na vitatu via mingomo ya mazi a olive.’ Kaha uje muka kutulika uahandekele naua nguendi, ‘Livulu liove eli lije limuesa makongo ove, tumama ha mavu sonekamo viseteko via vihita viuana via mingomo.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 16:7" />Ambahoni uehuile mukuavo ua mucivali nguendi, ‘Uakonguele cingahi?’ Kaha uamukumbuluile nguendi, ‘Cihita cimolika ca vinjeke via tiliku,’ kaha uamulekele nguendi, ‘Ambata livulu liove eli sonekamo makumi atanu na atatu a vinjeke via tiliku.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 16:8" />Kaha uje muene uendi uashangazalele uje muka kutulika uakuhona kulongua hakukala na mana, muomu vantu va mavu ano vazivuka muakukela navakuavo kupulakana vana vamu ceke.”<verse eid="LUK 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 16:9" />Njimileka nguange, pangeseni vufuko vua ha mavu kulinga vusamba na vihutu. Kaha omo vufuko vueni vukahua, omo mukatsa vaka mitambula mu vihela via yaye. <verse eid="LUK 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 16:10" />Uoshe akala na vusunga muvia vindende na mu viakama akakala na vusunga, kaha uje kakala na vusunga muvia vindende kaha kakakala na vusunga mu viakama. <verse eid="LUK 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 16:11" />Kaha nga ku uakele na vusunga na vufuko vua ha mavu, iya honi akutsiliela na vufuko vua vusunga? <verse eid="LUK 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 16:12" />Kaha nga ku uakele na vusunga ha vitenga via muntu, nkuma iya honi akakuhana vufuko vuje vuakupande?<verse eid="LUK 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 16:13" />“Uahi ngamba asa kupangela vimiene vavali muomu uje ngamba akazindaho umo naku zangaho mukuavo, cipue alihanako kuli umo na kushaula mukuavo. Kuuasa kupangela Njambi na vimbongo.”<verse eid="LUK 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vihandeka vimo via Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:12-13">Mateu 11:12-13</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 5:31-32">5:31-32</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:11-12">Mako 10:11-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 16:14" />Vafaliseho vaje vapuile vaka kuzanga vimbongo, omo vovuile vioshe evi, kaha vashendumuine Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 16:15" />Vuno honi Yesu uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi, “Yeni vaje vaka kulimuesa kupua vaka vusunga ku mesho a vantu, vuno honi Njambi azivuka mitima yeni, muomu coshe cije vashangazala hakati ka vantu, ku mesho a Njambi cinapu cangoco.<verse eid="LUK 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 16:16" />“Lishiko lia Mosesa na tunanguizi vatuamenene vantu noho Yiuano muka kumbuitika uezile. Hume haje na ntsimbu ino Muzimbu Uacili ua Vumuene vua Njambi valinaku uambulula. Muntu uoshe alinakueseka cikuma kukovela mu Vumuene ovu. <verse eid="LUK 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 16:17" />Vuno honi cacasi melu na mavu kuhita kupulakana ka toma kakande kamu mukanda ua Lishiko lia Mosesa kuhua.<verse eid="LUK 16:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 16:18" />“Uoshe akondola mpueyendi na kuambata ueka nalingi vupangala, kaha uoshe ambata mpuevo uakukondola kuli yaliendi alinga vupangala.<verse eid="LUK 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yala ua kufuka na Lazalu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 16:19" />“Kuakele yala umo uakufuka uje uakele nakuzala vuzalo vua vunengu vuandando yakutula, uakele na ciuano ca kulia cakama ha tangua na tangua. <verse eid="LUK 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 16:20" />Kuakele yala ua cihutu lizina liendi Lazalu uje ivakele nakuneha ku cikolo ca muka kufuka, uje uakele na vimbandu muvila uoshe, <verse eid="LUK 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 16:21" />uakele nakuvandamena kulia vije viakele na kuua ku mesa ya uje yala uakufuka, na tutali vakele nakuija na kuliasa ha vimbandu viendi. <verse eid="LUK 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 16:22" />Uje yala ua cihutu uatsile kaha tungelo vamuambatele kukakala na Avilahama. Kaha na uje yala uakufuka na ikeye naua uatsile kaha vamutsindile, <verse eid="LUK 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 16:23" />uakele mu ngehena na kuyanda. Uanduile mesho endi kaha uamuene Avilahama kulahako ali na Lazalu ku mukulo uendi. <verse eid="LUK 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 16:24" />Kaha uasanene nguendi, ‘Tate Avilahama, njivuileko cikeketima tuma Lazalu ambuitike munie uendi mu mema linga anjitontuese ha ndaka yange, muomu njili na kuvua kuvavala muno mu tuhia.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 16:25" />Vuno honi Avilahama uamukumbuluile nguendi, ‘Munange, vuluka ha ntsimbu yove ije uakele nakuyoya uakele nakutambula viuma viove viacili, na Lazalu ikeye uakele nakutambula via vipi, vuno honi ali nakuyoya muacili yove uli nakuvua kuvavala. <verse eid="LUK 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 16:26" />Kaha naua mukati kove netu hali cina cakama, ngeci uoshe atonda kujavuka kuhuma kuli yetu kuija oko keti ase, kaha naumo uahi asa kujavuka kuhuma oko kuija kuno kutuli.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 16:27" />Kaha yala ua kufuka uahandekele nguendi, ‘Honi, tate, njikulomba tuma Lazalu ku njivo ya tate, <verse eid="LUK 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 16:28" />muomu njili na vamunanana vatanu. Ecela Lazalu aye nakuvanangula linga keti vakeje naua kuno ku cihela ca tuyando.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 16:29" />Avilahama uakumbuluile nguendi, ‘Vali na visoneka via Mosesa na tunanguizi, vanapande kuvovuilila.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 16:30" />Uje yala ua kufuka uahandekele nguendi, ‘Houe tate Avilahama, vuno honi nga umo akasanguka kuvatsi aya kuli vakevo kaha vakatenguluka.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 16:31" />Avilahama uamukumbuluile nguendi, ‘Nga kuvevuilila ku visoneka via Mosesa na tunanguizi, kaha cipue vene muntu uakuhuma ku vatsi ku vakamutava.’”<verse eid="LUK 16:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="LUK 17" />
  <para style="s">Vupi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:6-7">Mateu 18:6-7</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 21">21</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 22">22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:42">Mako 9:42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 17:1" />Yesu uahandekele kuli vandongisi vendi nguendi, “Vieseko via vupi muavusunga vihita, vuno honi tuyando kuli uje avineha! <verse eid="LUK 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 17:2" />Cacili kuli ikeye nga vaka mukutilila livue liakama muntsingo na kumumbila mu cisali, linga keti akakovelese umo ua vanike vavandende mu vupi. <verse eid="LUK 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 17:3" />Zangameni ku vije muli nakulinga.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 17:3">“Nga mukueni alinga vupi munangule, kaha nga alitavela mukonekele. <verse eid="LUK 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 17:4" />Kaha nga muntu umo vene akupihisila lutanu na luvali ha litangua limo, kaha eja kuli yove lutanu na luvali na kuhandeka nguendi, ‘Njatenguluka,’ kaha unapande kumukonekela.”<verse eid="LUK 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lutsilielo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 17:5" />Kaha tunganda vahandekele kuli Muene nguavo, “Vuezelela lutsilielo luetu!”<verse eid="LUK 17:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 17:6" />Muene uahandekele nguendi, “Nga muli na lutsilielo lualundende ngue mbuto ya musalata, ngue muasa kuhandeka ku muti ou ualaha uakama ngueni, ‘Tukuka uka shimbame ha cisali!’ Kaha ukeuo ukamiononoka.<verse eid="LUK 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vipangi via ngamba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 17:7" />“Nga ulina ngamba muka kulima cipue muka kuniunga vampanga, nkuma uasa kuhandeka kuli ikeye omo nga ahuminina ku mehia nguove, ‘Ija hano vene uakutumame na kulia ndi?’ <verse eid="LUK 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 17:8" />Houe! Vuno honi ukahandeka kuli ikeye nguove, ‘Vuahesa viakulia viange via cinguezi, Naua lizitikile vualumo muiva uove nakunjipangela noho njikalia na kunua, nga njamanesa ambahoni ulie na kunua!’ <verse eid="LUK 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 17:9" />Nkuma honi ngamba kuveku mutsantsela hakulinga vije vivamushikile kulinga ndi? Muavusunga houe! <verse eid="LUK 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 17:10" />Neni naua vene, omo mualingile vioshe vije vivamishikile kulinga, handekeni ngueni, ‘Tuva ngamba vangoco, tunalingi lika vipangi vietu.’”<verse eid="LUK 17:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akanguisa vamala likumi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 17:11" />Omo Yesu uakele nakuya ku Yelusalema uahitile mukati ka Samaliya na Ngalileya. <verse eid="LUK 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 17:12" />Kaha uakovelele muimbo muje vamala vambumba likumi vamuuanene, vemanene kulahako. <verse eid="LUK 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 17:13" />Vatambakanene cikuma na kuhandeka nguavo, “Yesu, Muene tuvuileko ngozi!”<verse eid="LUK 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 17:14" />Omo Yesu uavamuene, uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi, “Yeni mukalimuese yeni vavenia kuli vasasendote.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 17:14">Omo vakele nakuya vavalelesele. <verse eid="LUK 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 17:15" />Kaha umo uavo omo uamuene nguendi nakanguka, uahilukile na kushangazala Njambi na lizi liakama, <verse eid="LUK 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 17:16" />uauile na cihanga cendi ku viliato via Yesu na kumutsantsela. Ikeye uapuile Kasamaliya. <verse eid="LUK 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 17:17" />Kaha Yesu uahandekele nguendi, “Nkuma kuvapuile likumi vaje vanakanguka ndi? Nkuma honi ava vatanu na vauana vali kuli? <verse eid="LUK 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 17:18" />Omo vikahoni naumo uahi uavo neja nakuhana citsantsela kuli Njambi kuvanga lika ou keti Kayunda?” <verse eid="LUK 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 17:19" />Kaha Yesu uahandekele kuli ikeye nguendi, “Katuka uye, lutsilielo luove lua kukanguisa.”<verse eid="LUK 17:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuija ca vumuene vua Njambi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:23-28">Mateu 24:23-28</ref>;<ref loc="MAT 24:37-41">37-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 17:20" />Yesu vamuihuile kuli Vafaliseho nguavo, “Ntsimbu muka Vumuene vua Njambi vukeja?” Kaha uavatavele nguendi, “Vumuene vua Njambi kuvukeja mu ngila ije muasa kuvumona na mesho eni. <verse eid="LUK 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 17:21" />Kukuesi akahandeka nguendi, ‘Tala, vuno vulihano!’ Cipue ‘Taleni, vuje vuli kuje!’ Muomu Vumuene vua Njambi muli navuo hakati keni.”<verse eid="LUK 17:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 17:22" />Ambahoni Yesu uahandekele kuli vandongisi vendi nguendi, “Matangua akeja omo mukatonda kumona litangua limo lia Muna Muntu, vuno honi kumukasa kulimona. <verse eid="LUK 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 17:23" />Kaha kukakala vamo vakahandeka kuli yeni nguavo, ‘Taleni ali kuje!’ Cipue, ‘Taleni alihano!’ Vuno honi keti muyeko, keti mukavakavangeye. <verse eid="LUK 17:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 17:24" />Ngue muhiato mukahiatula muilu, kaha vaumona uhuma ku cihela cimo ca lilu nakuya ku cihela cikuavo ca lilu, mukemo vene naua Muna Muntu muakafua ha litangua liendi liakuhiluka. <verse eid="LUK 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 17:25" />Vuno honi napande kuyanda cikuma na kumuviana ku vantu va ntsimbu ino. <verse eid="LUK 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 17:26" />Ngue mucafuile ku matangua a Noua mukemo vene mucikafuilamo naku matangua a Muna Muntu. <verse eid="LUK 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 17:27" />Vantu vakele nakulia na kunua, na kuliambata na kushombuesa, noho Noua uakovelele mu vuato. Kaha livazi liezile nakuvanongesa voshe. <verse eid="LUK 17:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 17:28" />Ngue mucafuile ku matangua a Lote, vantu voshe vanuine, valile, valandesele na kulandulula, vakunine na kutunga, <verse eid="LUK 17:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 17:29" />vuno honi ha litangua lije Lote uahumine mu Sondoma, tuhia na mavue vianokele ngue mema a kuhuma muilu, kaha via vanongesele voshe. <verse eid="LUK 17:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 17:30" />Cikafua ngue mujevene ha litangua liakasholoka Muna Muntu.<verse eid="LUK 17:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 17:31" />“Ha litangua lijevene, uoshe uje yala ali helu lia njivo keti akovele mu njivo nakuambata viuma viendi, naua na uje ali mu lihia liendi keti ahiluke ku njivo yendi. <verse eid="LUK 17:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 17:32" />Vulukeni hali mpuevo ya Lote. <verse eid="LUK 17:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 17:33" />Voshe vaje vatonda kuniunga muono uavo vavenia vaka uzimbalesa, vuno honi vaje vazimbalesa muono uavo vakau uana. <verse eid="LUK 17:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 17:34" />Njimileka, ha vutsiki vuje kukakala vantu vavali ha muhela umo, umo vakamuambata ou mukuavo vakamuseza. <verse eid="LUK 17:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 17:35" />Kaha kukakala vampuevo vavali vaje vakatua hamo mucini cimo, mukuavo vaka muambata kaha mukuavo vakamuseza.” <verse eid="LUK 17:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 17:36" />[Vamala vavali vakapanga mu lihia, umo vakaya nendi mukuavo vakamuseza.]<verse eid="LUK 17:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 17:37" />Kaha vandongisi vendi vamuihuile nguavo, “Kulihoni Muene, kuje kuvikalingiuila?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 17:37">Kaha Yesu uavakumbuluile nguendi, “Kuoshe kuje kuli civimbi kukeko kukali kunguluila makuvi.”<verse eid="LUK 17:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="LUK 18" />
  <para style="s">Cisimo ca ntuluue na muka kusompa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 18:1" />Ambahoni Yesu uatelelele vandongisi vendi cisimo eci kuvalongesa nguendi, vanapande kulombela ntsimbu yoshe kuakuhona kuecela. <verse eid="LUK 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 18:2" />Uahandekele nguendi, “Mu nganda imo muakele muka kusompa uje kakele nakuvuila Njambi liova cipue kusingimika vantu. <verse eid="LUK 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 18:3" />Kaha naua mu nganda ijevene muakele ntuluue uje uakele nakuija kuli ikeye vintsimbu viavingi na kuhandeka nguendi, ‘Njiluileko ku vitozi vange!’ <verse eid="LUK 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 18:4" />Ha ntsimbu yaindende uje muka kusompa uavianene, hajevene uahandekele kuli ikeye vavenia nguendi, ‘Cipue vene kunjiteue Njambi cipue kusingimika vantu, <verse eid="LUK 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 18:5" />vuno honi ou ntuluue nanjishupu cikuma, njapande kumuluilako, muomu nga atualelelaho kuija kaha aka njihonesa!’”<verse eid="LUK 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 18:6" />Kaha Muene uahandekele nguendi, “Ivuilileni vije viahandeka uje muka kusompa uakuhona vusunga! <verse eid="LUK 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 18:7" />Nkuma Njambi kasa kuluila mu vusunga ku vantu vendi vaje valina kulilila kuli ikeye vutsiki na mutania ndi? Nkuma ngueni akasimbula mukuvakuasa ndi? <verse eid="LUK 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 18:8" />Njimileka nguange, hajevene akavaluila. Vuno honi omo Muna Muntu akeja, nkuma akauanaho vaka lutsilielo hano ha mavu ndi?”<verse eid="LUK 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Cisimo ca Kafaliseo na muka kutambula lisimu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 18:9" />Yesu uatele cisimo eci naua ku vantu vaje vaka kutsiliela vusunga vuavo vavenia nakushaula vakuavo. <verse eid="LUK 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 18:10" />Uahandekele nguendi, “Vamala vavali vayile ku njivo ya Njambi nakulombela, umo uapuile Kafaliseo, mukuavo uapuile muka kutambula lisimu. <verse eid="LUK 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 18:11" />Kaha Kafaliseo uemanene na kulomba nguendi, ‘Njikutsantsela Njambi, yange kunjafuile ngue vakuetu vantsintsa, vaka kuhona vusunga, vaka vupangala. Yange kunjafuile ngue uje muka kutambula lisimu nemana kuje. <verse eid="LUK 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 18:12" />Njikaliumina kulia ha matangua avali musondo, njikahana cimo kulikumi ca vioshe vinjikauana.’ <verse eid="LUK 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 18:13" />Vuno honi uje muka kutambula lisimu uemanene ku lahako, kaha kasele cipue kutala kuilu, vuno honi ualipupile ha ntulo na kuhandeka nguendi, ‘Njambi, njivuile ngozi yange muka vupi.’ <verse eid="LUK 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 18:14" />Njimileka,” nguange, “uje muka kutambula lisimu uayile kuimbo liendi mu vusunga kupulakana uje Kafaliseo, voshe vaje valijundula vakevo vavenia vaka vakehesa, vuno honi voshe vaje valikehesa vakevo vavenia vaka vajundula.”<verse eid="LUK 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akuisula vanike vavandende</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:13-15">Mateu 19:13-15</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:13-16">Mako 10:13-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 18:15" />Vantu vanehelelele Yesu vanike vavandende linga avasaleke mavoko, kaha omo vandongisi vendi vacimuene, vesekele kuvindika vaje vantu. <verse eid="LUK 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 18:16" />Vuno honi Yesu uasanene vanike vavandende veje kuli ikeye, uahandekele nguendi, “Eceleni vanike vavandende veje kuli yange keti muvavindike, muomu Vumuene vua Njambi vuli ku vantu ngue ava vanike vavandende. <verse eid="LUK 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 18:17" />Muavusunga njimileka nguange, uoshe uje katambula Vumuene vua Njambi ngue muanike uamundende, kakakovela mu Vumuene vua Njambi.”<verse eid="LUK 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yala ua kufuka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:16-30">Mateu 19:16-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:17-31">Mako 10:17-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 18:18" />Ha litangua limo umo mukuluntu ua Vayunda uehuile Yesu nguendi, “Mulongisi uacili, nkuma vika njinapande kulinga linga njikauane muono uayaye?”<verse eid="LUK 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 18:19" />Yesu uamukumbuluile nguendi, “Vika unjitumbuila nguove uacili?” Naumo uahi “Uacili kuvanga lika Njambi. <verse eid="LUK 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 18:20" />Uzivuka mashiko a Njambi aje ahandeka nguauo, ‘Keti ulinge vupangala, keti utsihe, keti uive, keti uvangeye mukueni vukaleho vua makuli, singimika isho na noko.’”<verse eid="LUK 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 18:21" />Kaha uje yala uakumbuluile Yesu nguendi, “Mashiko oshe aua njaononoka laja hume kuvuanike vuange.”<verse eid="LUK 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 18:22" />Kaha omo Yesu uevuile evi, uahandekele kuli ikeye nguendi, “Kunasupila cuma cimo ci unapande kulinga. Ya ukalandese vioshe vi ulinavio kaha ukahane vimbongo vioshe kuli vihutu, kaha ukakala na vufuko muilu, kaha uije, unjikave.” <verse eid="LUK 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 18:23" />Vuno honi uje yala omo uevuile evi, uanienguele muomu ikeye uakele na vufuko vuavuingi.<verse eid="LUK 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 18:24" />Omo Yesu uamuene nguendi naniengua, kaha uahandekele nguendi, “Cinapu cacikalu kuli vaka kufuka kukovela mu Vumuene vua Njambi! <verse eid="LUK 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 18:25" />Cacasi kuli kamelu kukovela mu lisho lia nguya vuno honi cacikalu cikuma ku muntu muka kufuka kukovela mu Vumuene vua Njambi.”<verse eid="LUK 18:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 18:26" />Vaje vantu vovuile, vamuihuile nguavo, “Nkuma iya honi akovoka?”<verse eid="LUK 18:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 18:27" />Vuno honi Yesu uavakumbuluile nguendi, “Cije cacikalu ku vantu capua cacasi kuli Njambi.”<verse eid="LUK 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 18:28" />Petulu uahandekele nguendi, “Tala! Yetu tunaseza vioshe vituli navio, nakukukava.”<verse eid="LUK 18:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 18:29" />Yesu uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi, “Eyo, muavusunga njimileka uoshe uje naseza njivo yendi, cipue mpueyendi, cipue munaina, cipue visemi vendi, cipue vana vendi, muomu ya Vumuene vua Njambi, <verse eid="LUK 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 18:30" />akatambula viavingi cikuma mu muono ou na muono uayaye mu miaka ije ikeja kulutue.”<verse eid="LUK 18:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ahandeka lua mucitatu via kulutue via ha kutsa cendi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:17-19">Mateu 20:17-19</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:32-34">Mako 10:32-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 18:31" />Yesu uatualele vandongisi vendi likumi na vavali kualikaliavo lika, kaha uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi, “Evuilileni! Tulinakuya mu Yelusalema kuje viuma vioshe vije vivasonekele kuli tunanguizi hali Muna Muntu linga vika lishulisise. <verse eid="LUK 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 18:32" />Muna Muntu vakamuhana ku mavoko a vaje keti Vayunda vaje vaka mushendumuna na kumutuka na kumujekuila. <verse eid="LUK 18:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 18:33" />Vaka mupupa, kaha vaka mutsiha, vuno honi hanima ya matangua atatu vakamusangula.”<verse eid="LUK 18:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 18:34" />Vuno honi vandongisi vendi kuvovuisisile nacimo cahi ha viuma evi, muomu kulumbunuka ca mezi aua vava shuekeleleco linga keti vazivuke vije viahandekele Yesu kuli vakevo.<verse eid="LUK 18:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akanguisa Yala ua kapuputua uje uakele nakulomba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:29-34">Mateu 20:29-34</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:46-52">Mako 10:46-52</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 18:35" />Omo Yesu uahetele kuyehi na Yeliko, kuakele yala umo ua kapuputua uakele kumukulo ua ngila nakulomba. <verse eid="LUK 18:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 18:36" />Omo uevuile civunga ca vantu cili nakuhita, uehuile nguendi “Vika vili nakulingiua?”<verse eid="LUK 18:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 18:37" />Kaha vamulekele nguavo, “Yesu uaku Nazaleta ali nakuhita.”<verse eid="LUK 18:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 18:38" />Kaha uatambakanene nguendi, “Yesu! Muna Ndaviti! Njivuileko cikeketima!”<verse eid="LUK 18:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 18:39" />Vantu vaje vakele kulutue lia civunga, vamulekele linga aholoke. Vuno honi ikeye uatambakanene cikuma nguendi, “Ove Muna Ndaviti! Njivuileko cikeketima!”<verse eid="LUK 18:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 18:40" />Yesu uemanene nakushika nguendi, “Muneheni kuno”. Omo uje yala uashuenene kuyehi, Yesu uamuhuile nguendi, <verse eid="LUK 18:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 18:41" />“Vika utonda linga njikulingile?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 18:41">Kaha uamukumbuluile nguendi, “Muene njitonda linga njimone naua.”<verse eid="LUK 18:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 18:42" />Yesu uahandekele kuli ikeye nguendi, “Mona! Lutsilielo luove luna kukanguisa.”<verse eid="LUK 18:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 18:43" />Kaha hajevene uaputukile kumona, uakavele Yesu, nakushangazala Njambi. Omo vantu vacimuene, kaha voshe vashangazalale Njambi.<verse eid="LUK 18:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="LUK 19" />
  <para style="s">Yesu na Zakeo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 19:1" />Hanima yevi Yesu uakovelele mu Yeliko na kuputuka kuhitanganamo. <verse eid="LUK 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 19:2" />Muakele yala umo mu nganda ije, uje uapuile mukuluntu ua vaka kutambula lisimu lizina liendi Zakeo, uje uapuile muka kufuka. <verse eid="LUK 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 19:3" />Uatondele kumona Yesu muje muamonekelamo, vuno honi kamumuene muomu ya civunga ca vantu kaha naua uapuile uamuihi. <verse eid="LUK 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 19:4" />Kaha uashatukililele kulutue lia civunga, ualondele ku muti ua linongo linga amone Yesu uje uahitile mu ngila ijevene. <verse eid="LUK 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 19:5" />Omo Yesu uahetele ha mutambela uje, uatalele kuilu, kaha uahandekele kuli Zakeo nguendi, “Shuluka vuasi Zakeo, muomu lelo njapande kuija ku njivo yove.”<verse eid="LUK 19:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 19:6" />Kaha Zakeo uashulukile vuasi nakumutambula na kuvuahelela cikuma. <verse eid="LUK 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 19:7" />Vantu voshe vaje vamuene vialingiuile vaninguile nguavo, “Ou yala nai nakupua mungezi ku njivo ya muka vupi!”<verse eid="LUK 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 19:8" />Kaha Zakeo uemanene na kuhandeka kuli Muene nguendi, “Muene ivuilila njihana mutambela ua vufuko vuange kuli vihutu, nga njambatele cimo kuli umo mu ngila ya makuli, kaha njika mufueta vintsimbu viuana.”<verse eid="LUK 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 19:9" />Yesu uahandekele nguendi, “Kuovoka ku neja mu njivo ino lelo, muomu ou yala nendi naua napu muna Avilahama. <verse eid="LUK 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 19:10" />Muavusunga Muna Muntu uezile nakutonda na kuovola vaje vana zimbala.”<verse eid="LUK 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Cisimo ca mbongo ya muuaya uaya ya ngolinde</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 25:14-30">Mateu 25:14-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 19:11" />Omo tele vantu vakele nakuivuilila vije Yesu uakele nakuhandeka, uavatelelele cisimo muomu uakele kuyehi na Yelusalema, kaha vasinganiekele ngue Vumuene vua Njambi hajevene vusholoka. <verse eid="LUK 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 19:12" />Kaha Yesu uahandekele nguendi, “Kuakele muntu uaku vumuene uje uayile ku cifuti ca kulahako linga vakamupuise muene, hanima yevi uasinganiekele kuhiluka linga akuendese vantu vendi. <verse eid="LUK 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 19:13" />Omo tele kanda aye, uasanene vangamba vendi likumi kaha uahanene umo na umo mbongo ya muuaya uaya ya ngolinde na kuvaleka nguendi, ‘Landululeni noho njikeja.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 19:14" />Vuno honi vantu vamu cifuti cendi vamuzindile cikuma, kaha vamutuminine tunganda kuje kuayile nakukahandeka nguavo, ‘Ou yala kutumutondo linga apue muene uetu.’<verse eid="LUK 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 19:15" />“Omo uje yala uahilukile, hanima ya kumuhaka vumuene, uashikile vaje vangamba vahanene vimbongo linga veje kuli ikeye ngeci azivuke cingahi vana landuluilaho. <verse eid="LUK 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 19:16" />Kaha uakulivanga uezile nakuhandeka nguendi, ‘Muene, mbongo imolika ije iuanjihanene yasemuinina honi vimbongo likumi vikuavo.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 19:17" />Kaha uahandekele kuli ikeye nguendi, ‘Unalingi muacili cikuma, ngamba uacili! Kaha muene uahandekele kuli ikeye nguendi, muomu unakala nalutsilielo mu viuma viavindende, njikakuhana nzili yakama ya kutuamenena vinganda likumi.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 19:18" />Kaha uamucivali naua uezile uahandekele nguendi, ‘Muene, mbongo yove imolika ije iuanjihanene yasemuinina vimbongo vitanu.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 19:19" />Kaha naua muene uahandekele kuli ikeye nguendi, ‘Njikakupuisa muka kutuamenena vinganda vitanu.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 19:20" />Ambahoni mukuavo ngamba uezile uahandekele nguendi, ‘Muene, mbongo yove eyi, hanga njaitulikilile ha kantanga kakandende. <verse eid="LUK 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 19:21" />Njevuile liova, muomu yove uapua muntu uavutenu. Ukambata cije keti cove na kuteja vije kuuakuvile.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 19:22" />Kaha muene uahandekele kuli ikeye nguendi, ‘Yove ngamba uamupi! Njikakuhisa na mezi akuhuma mu kanua kove! Uzivuka nguove yange nji yala uavutenu, njikambata vije keti viange na kuteja vije kunjakuvile? <verse eid="LUK 19:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 19:23" />Nkuma vikahoni kuua tulikilile mbongo yange mu njivo yakutulikila vimbongo, ngeci omo munjineja ngue njinauana mbongo yange hamo na kakondueso kayo?’ <verse eid="LUK 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 19:24" />Kaha muene uahandekele kuli vaje vemanene kumukulo nguendi, ‘Muniekeni oyo mbongo, muihane kuli uje ali na vimbongo likumi.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 19:25" />Vuno honi vakevo vahandekele kuli ikeye nguavo, ‘Muene, ali laja na vimbongo likumi!’ <verse eid="LUK 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 19:26" />Kaha ikeye uavatavele nguendi, ‘Muavusunga njimileka nguange, uje ali naco, vakamuhakelako viavingi, vuno honi uje kesi navio, cipue vene vije viavindende viali navio vakamuniekavio. <verse eid="LUK 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 19:27" />Vuno honi ku vitozi vange, vaje kuvatondele linga yange njipue muene uavo, vaneheni kuno kaha vatsihileni ha mesho ange.’”<verse eid="LUK 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akovela na kasingimiko mu Yelusalema</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:1-11">Mateu 21:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:1-11">Mako 11:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:12-19">Yiuano 12:12-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 19:28" />Omo Yesu uamanuisile kuhandeka evi, kaha uayile kulutue luavo nakuya ku Yelusalema. <verse eid="LUK 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 19:29" />Omo Yesu uahetele kuyehi na Mbetefanje na Mbetaniya ku munkinda ua Oliveta, kaha uatumine vandongisi vavali kulutue uavalekele nguendi, <verse eid="LUK 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 19:30" />“Yeni ku limbo lije lili kulutue lueni, omo mukakovelamo mukauana muna cimulu vanamukutu, uje kanda muntu alondeho. Kaha muzituleni mumunehe kuno.” <verse eid="LUK 19:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 19:31" />Nga muntu umo amihula nguendi vika mumuzituila, mulekeni ngueni Muene amutonda.<verse eid="LUK 19:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 19:32" />Kaha vaje vavatumine vayile vakauanene ngue muje muahandekelele Muene. <verse eid="LUK 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 19:33" />Tele vacili nakuzitula uje muna cimulu, kaha vavenia cimulu uavehuile nguendi, “Vika mumuzituila ou muna cimulu?”<verse eid="LUK 19:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 19:34" />Kaha vamutavele nguavo, “Muene ali nakumutonda.” <verse eid="LUK 19:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 19:35" />Vatualele uje muna cimulu kuli Yesu. Kaha vajalele tuzaku tuavo ha muongo uendi, kaha Yesu ualondeleho. <verse eid="LUK 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 19:36" />Omo uakele nakuya ha cimulu, vantu vajalele tuzaku tuavo mu ngila. <verse eid="LUK 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 19:37" />Omo Yesu uahetele kuyehi na Yelusalema, ku cikulo ca munkinda ua Oliveta, kaha civunga cacingi ca vandongisi vendi vaputukile kuvuahelela na kushangazala Njambi na mezi akama ha vikomoueso vioshe viakama vivamuene vije vialingile Yesu, <verse eid="LUK 19:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 19:38" />nguavo, “Uakukuisula muene uje eja mu lizina lia Muene Njambi! Ciyulo muilu na vumpau kuli Njambi!”<verse eid="LUK 19:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 19:39" />Vafaliseho vamo vaje vakele mu civunga vahandekele kuli Yesu nguavo, “Mulongisi, shika vandongisi vove linga vaholoke”<verse eid="LUK 19:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 19:40" />Yesu uavakumbuluile nguendi, “Njimileka nguange, nga ava vakaholoka kaha aua mavue akaputuka kutambakana.”<verse eid="LUK 19:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu alilila Yelusalema</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 19:41" />Omo Yesu uahetele kuyehi na Yelusalema, kaha omo uaimuene ualilile, <verse eid="LUK 19:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 19:42" />uahandekele nguendi, “Nga uazivuka vika vije vitondeka linga lelo kukale ciyulo! Vuno honi vacishuekesa kuli yove! <verse eid="LUK 19:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 19:43" />Ntsimbu ikeja hali yove, omo vitozi vove vaka kutungila cimpaka, nakukuhaka mukati kavo, na kukushetuila mukati ku mitambela yoshe. <verse eid="LUK 19:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 19:44" />Kaha vakevo vakakunongesa hamo na vantu vove vaje vali mu vivumbe viove, kuvakaseze cipue livue limo mu muhela ualio, muomu yove kuuazivukile ntsimbu ije omo Njambi uezile nakukuovola.”<verse eid="LUK 19:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu aya ku Njivo ya Njambi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:12-17">Mateu 21:12-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:15-19">Mako 11:15-19</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:13-22">Yiuano 2:13-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 19:45" />Ambahoni Yesu uakovelele mu njivo ya Njambi, na kuputuka kushekamo voshe vaje vakele nakulandesa, <verse eid="LUK 19:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 19:46" />uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi, “Vanasoneka mu visoneka nguavo, ‘Njivo yange ikapua njivo ya malombelo’, vuno honi yeni muayipuisa cihela ca vezi!”<verse eid="LUK 19:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 19:47" />Yesu uakele nakulongesa mu njivo ya Njambi ha litangua na litangua. Vakuluntu va vasasendote na valongisi va mezi a Lishiko lia Mosesa na vantuama va vantu vatondele kumutsiha, <verse eid="LUK 19:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 19:48" />vuno honi kuvauanene ngila yaku cilingila, muomu vantu voshe vakele naku muvuilila ngeci keti vasezeho cipue lizi limo.<verse eid="LUK 19:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="LUK 20" />
  <para style="s">Cihula caha nzili yakama ya Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:23-27">Mateu 21:23-27</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:27-33">Mako 11:27-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 20:1" />Ha litangua limo Yesu uakele nakulongesa mu mbalanda ya njivo ya Njambi na kuambulula Muzimbu Uacili ku vantu, kaha vakuluntu va vasasendote na valongisi va mezi a Lishiko lia Mosesa, hamo na vakuluntu vezile, <verse eid="LUK 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 20:2" />kaha vahandekele kuli ikeye nguavo, “Tuleke, nzili muka yakama ukalikuasesa nayo kulinga viuma evi? Iya nakuhana nzili yakama eyi?”<verse eid="LUK 20:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 20:3" />Yesu uavakumbuluile nguendi, “Nange naua njimihula cihula cimo. Njilekeni, <verse eid="LUK 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 20:4" />nkuma kumbuitika ca Yiuano cahumine kuli Njambi indi ku vantu?” <verse eid="LUK 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 20:5" />Vaputukile vimpata hakati kavo nguavo, “Vika tukahandeka? Nga tuhandeka nguetu, ‘Cahumine kuli Njambi,’ kaha akatuihula nguendi, ‘Nkuma vikahoni kumua mutsilielelele?’ <verse eid="LUK 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 20:6" />Vuno honi nga tukahandeka nguetu, ‘Cahumininine ku vantu,’ Kaha civunga coshe ca vantu vakatuasha mavue, muomu vovuisisile nguavo Yiuano uapuile Kananguizi.” <verse eid="LUK 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 20:7" />Kaha vakumbuluile Yesu nguavo, “Kutuzivuka kuje kucahumine.”<verse eid="LUK 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 20:8" />Kaha Yesu uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi, “Nange naua kunjimileka kuje kuihuminina nzili ije injili nakulikuasesa mukulinga viuma evi.”<verse eid="LUK 20:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Cisimo ca vaka kupanga mu lihia lia vushuka vua Viniu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:33-46">Mateu 21:33-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:1-12">Mako 12:1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 20:9" />Yesu uatualeleleho kuleka vantu cisimo eci nguendi, “Kuakele yala umo uakele na lihia lia viniu, kaha ualikumuisile kuli vandimi vamo, kaha uayile vungezi vuendi ha ntsimbu yalaha. <verse eid="LUK 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 20:10" />Omo ntsimbu ya kuteja vushuka yahetele, uatumine ngamba uendi kuli vaje vandimi, muku katambulako mutambela uendi kuli vije vanateje. Vuno honi vaje vandimi vapupile uje ngamba, nakumuhiluisa mavoko voko. <verse eid="LUK 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 20:11" />Kaha uje vavenia lihia uatumineko naua ngamba mukuavo, vuno honi vaje vandimi vamupupile naua na kumulinga muamupi, kaha uamuhiluisile mavoko voko. <verse eid="LUK 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 20:12" />Uatumineko naua ngamba ua mucitatu, kaha vaje vandimi vamu vulumuine naua nakumumbila hambaza lia lihia. <verse eid="LUK 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 20:13" />Ambahoni vavenia lihia uahandekele nguendi, ‘Nkuma njikalinga vati? Njikatuma munange injazanga, hamo vaka musingimika!’ <verse eid="LUK 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 20:14" />Vuno honi omo vandimi vamumuene, kaha valihandekesele hakati kavo nguavo, ‘Ou ikeye muna uje vavenia lihia. Ijeni tumutsihe, kaha tukasuana vufuko vuendi!’ <verse eid="LUK 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 20:15" />Nankuma vamumbilile hambaza lia lihia lia vushuka vua viniu, kaha vamutsihile.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:15">Yesu uavehuile nguendi, “Vika akalinga uje vavenia lihia kuli vaje vandimi? <verse eid="LUK 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 20:16" />Akeja na kutsiha vaje vantu na kuhana lije lihia ku vandimi veka.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:16">Omo vantu vovuile evi, vahandekele nguavo, “Muavusunga vene keti ngoco houe!”<verse eid="LUK 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 20:17" />Yesu uavatalele nakuvehula nguendi, “Visoneka vilumbununa vika omo vihandeka nguavio,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:17">‘Livue lije vene vakakutunga vavianene,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 20:17">likelio linapu cisimi ca mumbango.’<verse eid="LUK 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 20:18" />Kaha uoshe uje akauila ha livue lije akavatuka vimpindi mpindi, vuno honi nga lije livue lika uila hali muntu umo, likamusaniuna.”<verse eid="LUK 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Cihula ca ha kufueta lisimu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:15-22">Mateu 22:15-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:13-17">Mako 12:13-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 20:19" />Valongisi va mezi a Lishiko lia Mosesa na vakuluntu va vasasendote vayonguele kukuata Yesu ha ntsimbu ijevene, muomu vazivukile nguavo cisimo eci nacitela vakevo, vuno honi vateuele vantu. <verse eid="LUK 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 20:20" />Nankuma, va vandamenene ntsimbu ya cili. Kaha vahanene lizika kanua ku vantu vamo valipuise ngue vaka vusunga, kaha va vatumine kuli Yesu linga vakamueseke na vihula ngeci vamuhane ku mavoko a Nguvulu. <verse eid="LUK 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 20:21" />Kaha vaje vavatumine vehuile Yesu nguavo, “Mulongisi tuazivuka nguetu yove ukahandeka vusunga na kulongesa vusunga, naua kuue kutala hali muntu cipue uapua ua vulemu, cipue keti ua vulemu vuno honi ntsimbu yoshe ukalongesa vantu vusunga muje muatondela Njambi ngeci vayoyemo. <verse eid="LUK 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 20:22" />Tuleke, nkuma Lishiko lietu litutavesa kufueta lisimu kuli Sezale indi houe?”<verse eid="LUK 20:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 20:23" />Vuno honi Yesu uazivukile kuzangama cavo, kaha uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi, <verse eid="LUK 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 20:24" />“Njimueseni mbongo ya muuaya uaya ya siliva. Nkuma cihanga ceya na lizina lieya viliho?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:24">Kaha vamukumbuluile nguavo “via Sezale!”<verse eid="LUK 20:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 20:25" />Nankuma Yesu uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi, “Muacili, haneni kuli Sezale vije viapande kuli Sezale, kaha haneni kuli Njambi vije viapande kuli Njambi.”<verse eid="LUK 20:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 20:26" />Kaha kuvasele kumu uanenaho mulonga ha mezi aua ku mesho a vantu. Valikomokelele ku kukumbulula cendi kaha vaholokele kuluu.<verse eid="LUK 20:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Cihula ca ha kusanguka ku Vatsi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:23-33">Mateu 22:23-33</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:18-27">Mako 12:18-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 20:27" />Kaha Vasanduki vamo, vaje vatsiliela nguavo vantu kuvakasanguka ku vatsi, vezile kuli Yesu nakumuhula nguavo, <verse eid="LUK 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 20:28" />“Mulongisi, Mosesa uatusonekelele Lishiko eli nguendi, ‘Nga yala atsa, kaha aseza mpueyendi vuno honi kesi na vana, kaha munaina ambate uje ntuluue linga asemeneko vana va uje natsi.’ <verse eid="LUK 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 20:29" />Kuakele vamunaina vatanu na vavali, kaha uje uamukuluntu uambatele mpuevo, uatsile kuakuhona muana. <verse eid="LUK 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 20:30" />Kaha uje ua mucivali uambatele uje mpuevo naua uatsile kuakuhona muana <verse eid="LUK 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 20:31" />kaha uamucitatu naua. Cuma cimo cafuile mujevene kuli voshe vaje vatanu na vavali, voshe vatsile kuakuhona vana. <verse eid="LUK 20:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 20:32" />Kaha kukumanusuila uje mpuevo uatsile. <verse eid="LUK 20:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 20:33" />Nankuma, ha litangua lije omo vatsi vaka sanguka, uje mpuevo akapua ueya hakati kavaje voshe vamuambatele vatanu na vavali?”<verse eid="LUK 20:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 20:34" />Yesu uavakumbuluile nguendi, “Vantu va ntsimbu ino vakambata na kushombuesa naua, <verse eid="LUK 20:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 20:35" />vuno honi vampuevo na vamala vaje vapande kusanguka ku vatsi na kuyoya mu ntsimbu ije ikeja kulutue, kuva kambata cipue kushomboka. <verse eid="LUK 20:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 20:36" />Vakevo vakapua ngue tungelo kuvakasa naua kutsa muomu vanapu vana va Njambi, muomu vanasanguka kuvatsi. <verse eid="LUK 20:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 20:37" />Mosesa nahana vukaleho ngeci vatsi vaka sanguka. Mu visoneka vije vihandeka via ciputa cije cakele nakuuema, cipuevene Mosesa ahandeka hali Muene Njambi ikeye vene ‘Njambi ya Avilahama, Njambi ya Isake, na Njambi ya Yakomba.’ <verse eid="LUK 20:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 20:38" />Ikeye uapua Njambi ua vaka kuyoya, keti ua vaka kutsa, muomu kuli ikeye vantu voshe vayoya.”<verse eid="LUK 20:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 20:39" />Kaha vamo valongisi va mezi a Lishiko vahandekele nguavo, “Mulongisi, uakumbulula muacili!” <verse eid="LUK 20:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 20:40" />Kuhuma ha ntsimbu ije kuvasele naua kuihula Yesu vihula vieka.<verse eid="LUK 20:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Cihula ca hali Kilistu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:41-46">Mateu 22:41-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:35-37">Mako 12:35-37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 20:41" />Yesu uavehuile nguendi, “Nkuma vika honi vali nakuhandeka nguavo, Kilistu akapua ua ku ntanga ya Ndaviti? <verse eid="LUK 20:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 20:42" />Muomu Ndaviti vavenia nahandeka mu livulu lia miaso nguendi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:42">‘Muene uahandekele kuli Muene uange nguendi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 20:42">Tumama ku livoko liange lia cilio,<verse eid="LUK 20:42" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 20:43" />noho njikapuisa vitozi vove ngue cituamo caku viliato viove.’<verse eid="LUK 20:43" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 20:44" />Nga Ndaviti ikeye uamutumbuile nguendi, ‘Muene,’ kaha vatihoni Kilistu apua mutekuluila ua Ndaviti?”<verse eid="LUK 20:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu anangula linga vazangame ku valongisi va mezi a lishiko</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:1-36">Mateu 23:1-36</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:38-40">Mako 12:38-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 20:45" />Kaha omo civunga ca vantu vakele nakuvuilila, Yesu uahandekele kuli vandongisi vendi nguendi, <verse eid="LUK 20:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 20:46" />“Zangameni kuli valongisi va mezi a Lishiko, vaje vazanga kuenda na vikovelo viavo via laha na kuzanga kuvameneka na kasingimiko mu vihela viakulandesela, na kuhangula vituamo viacili mu vinjivo via malombelo na ku vihela via vulemu ku viuano. <verse eid="LUK 20:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 20:47" />Vakevo vakakuisi vantuluue na kuvevila ku vinjivo viavo, kaha vashueka vilinga viavo na malombelo alaha! Kaha kashitiko kavo kakapua kakama cikuma!”<verse eid="LUK 20:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="LUK 21" />
  <para style="s">Mulambu ua ntuluue</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:41-44">Mako 12:41-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 21:1" />Ha litangua limo omo Yesu uakele nakutalazeka, kaha uamuene vaka kufuka vali nakuhana milambu yavo mu njivo ya Njambi, <verse eid="LUK 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 21:2" />kaha naua uamuene ntuluue umo ua cihutu uje uahanene tumbongo tuvali tua muuaya uaya tua vunengu. <verse eid="LUK 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 21:3" />Kaha Yesu uahandekele nguendi, “Muavusunga njimileka nguange, ou ntuluue ua cihutu nalambula viavingi kupulakana voshe vaje vantu vakufuka, <verse eid="LUK 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 21:4" />njahandeka evi muomu veka vanalambula via kusalaho ku vufuko vuavo, vuno honi ou mpuevo nalambula vioshe vianakele navio via kulikuasa navio.”<verse eid="LUK 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ahandeka via kulutue via kunonga ca njivo ya Njambi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:1-2">Mateu 24:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:1-2">Mako 13:1-2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 21:5" />Vamo va vandongisi va Yesu vakele nakuhandeka ha njivo ya Njambi, ha vucili vua mavue aje vaitungisile, na vuana vuje vakele nakuhana muku ivuahesa, kaha Yesu uahandekele nguendi, <verse eid="LUK 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 21:6" />“Maneni njimileke ha viuma vioshe evi munamono. Ntsimbu ikaheta omo vaka humisa livue lioshe mu muhela ualio, kaha mavue oshe akasiuka.”<verse eid="LUK 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tuyando na mapakeso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:3-14">Mateu 24:3-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:3-13">Mako 13:3-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 21:7" />Vandongisi va Yesu vamuihuile nguavo, “Mulongisi, muaka muka evi viuma vikalingiua?” Na cimueso muka tuzivuka naco nguetu ntsimbu inahete ya viuma vioshe evi vilingiue.<verse eid="LUK 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 21:8" />Yesu uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi, “Zangameni keti vamikuise. Vantu vavengi vakeja mu lizina liange na kuhandeka nguavo, ‘Yange vene ikeye!’ Kaha naua nguavo, ‘Ntsimbu inahete honi!’ Vuno honi keti mukava kavangeye. <verse eid="LUK 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 21:9" />Omo mukevua vinzita na kulitengulukila, keti mukateue, viuma evi vinapande kulingiua tahi, vuno honi ku vilumbununa ngue kuhua ca mavu cili muyehi.”<verse eid="LUK 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 21:10" />Ambahoni Yesu uahandekele naua nguendi, “Cifuti cikalua nzita na cifuti cikuavo, kaha vumuene vukalua na vumuene vukuavo. <verse eid="LUK 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 21:11" />Kukakala mandunduma, na njala yakama, na mishongo ya kulitambuisa ku vihela viakuliseza seza, kukakala viuma viakuteuesa na vimueso viaku komouesa vije vikahuminina muilu. <verse eid="LUK 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 21:12" />Omo ntsimbu kanda viuma evi visholoke, vakamikuata na kumiyandesa, vakamituala kuvi njivo via malombelo avo naku mihaka mu tumenga, kaha vakamituala ku vimiene naku vanguvulu mukumieseka muomu ya lizina liange. <verse eid="LUK 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 21:13" />Ikapua ntsimbu yacili kuli yeni ya kuambulula Muzimbu Uacili. <verse eid="LUK 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 21:14" />Nankuma, vihakeni mu mitima yeni keti muvisinganiekele vualumo ngueni vika tukahandeka, <verse eid="LUK 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 21:15" />muomu njikamihana mana akuzivuka vije vimukahandeka linga vitozi veni kuvakasa kumihisa cipue kuviana vimukahandeka. <verse eid="LUK 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 21:16" />Cipue visemi veni, na vamuanoko, na vavushoko veni na vavusamba veni vakamienda vungungu. Kaha vamo hakati keni vaka vatsiha. <verse eid="LUK 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 21:17" />Kaha voshe vakamizinda muomu ya lizina liange. <verse eid="LUK 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 21:18" />Vuno honi cipue cinkambu cimo caku mutue ueni ku cikazimbala. <verse eid="LUK 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 21:19" />Koleseni ngoo, kaha mukohiela miono yeni.<verse eid="LUK 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ahandeka ha kunonga ca Yelusalema</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:15-21">Mateu 24:15-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:14-19">Mako 13:14-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 21:20" />“Omo mukamona Yelusalema vana izengeleka ku civunga ca masualale, kaha zivukeni ngueni kunonga cayo cili muyehi. <verse eid="LUK 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 21:21" />Ambahoni vaje vali mu Yundeya vanapande kuteuela ku minkinda, kaha na vaje vali mu nganda vapande kuhumamo, kaha vaje vali hambanza lia nganda naku mehia vanapande keti vakovelemo mu nganda. <verse eid="LUK 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 21:22" />Aua akeuo matangua a kashitiko, vivahandekele mu visoneka linga vilishulisise. <verse eid="LUK 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 21:23" />Luvinda ku vampuevo vaje vakakala na mazimo na vampuevo vaje vaka jamuesa ha ntsimbu ije! Tuyando tuakama tukeja ha cifuti eci, na vukalu vua Njambi vukeja hali vantu ava. <verse eid="LUK 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 21:24" />Kaha vamo vaka vatsiha na mukuale, kaha vakuavo vakavatuala ku vunzinda ku mafuti eka, kaha vaje keti Vayunda vaka pihisa Yelusalema noho ntsimbu yavo ikaheta.<verse eid="LUK 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuija ca muna muntu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:29-31">Mateu 24:29-31</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:24-27">Mako 13:24-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 21:25" />“Kaha viuma via kukomouesa vikalingiua ku litangua, naku ngonde naku vingongonosi. Vantu voshe vaha mavu vakevua liova lia kuohia ca cisali na kukuma ca mankimba kaha kuvakazivuka vivakalinga. <verse eid="LUK 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 21:26" />Vantu vaka lezimuka ku liova omo vakavandamena vije vikasholoka hano ha mavu oshe, muomu viuma vioshe via muilu vikalininganga. <verse eid="LUK 21:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 21:27" />Kaha vakamona Muna Muntu akeja mu mashuelua na nzili na vumpau vuakama. <verse eid="LUK 21:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 21:28" />Omo viuma evi vikaputuka kulingiua, kaha katukeni nanzili na kutala kuilu, muomu kuohiela ceni cili muyehi.”<verse eid="LUK 21:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Cilongesa ca muti ua mukuyu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:32-35">Mateu 24:32-35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:28-31">Mako 13:28-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 21:29" />Ambahoni Yesu uavatelele cisimo eci nguendi, “Singaniekeni ha muti ua mukuyu na miti yeka yoshe. <verse eid="LUK 21:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 21:30" />Omo mumona maputa auo aputuka kuzovelela, munapande kuzivuka ngueni ntondue ili muyehi. <verse eid="LUK 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 21:31" />Kaha mucifua aci vene, omo mukamona viuma evi vilingiua muzivuke ngueni Vumuene vua Njambi vuli muyehi.<verse eid="LUK 21:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 21:32" />“Muavusunga njimileka, viuma vioshe evi vikalingiua oku vantu voshe va ntsimbu ino vaciyoya. <verse eid="LUK 21:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 21:33" />Melu na mavu vikahita, vuno honi mezi ange kakahiti.<verse eid="LUK 21:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Munapande kulivuahesela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 21:34" />“Zangameni! Keti mushoshomue cikuma mitima yeni ku via viuano, na viakulia, na via kunua viakupendesa na kulinienga ha viuma vije via ha mavu. Nga muvilinga litangua lije lika miniangumuna ngue mu ukapiluka muheto. <verse eid="LUK 21:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 21:35" />Litangua lije likeja ku vantu voshe vali hano ha mavu. <verse eid="LUK 21:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 21:36" />Livuaheseleni na kulombela ntsimbu yoshe linga mukakale na nzili yakuhiana vioshe vije vikalingiua nakuimana ku mesho a Muna Muntu.”<verse eid="LUK 21:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 21:37" />Yesu uakale na kulongesa mu njivo ya Njambi ha matangua aje, kaha kuheta ku ntsimbu ya cinguezi, uakele nakuhumamo na kuya ku munkinda ua Oliveta kukakalako vutsiki vuoshe. <verse eid="LUK 21:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 21:38" />Ku cimene na cimene coshe vantu voshe vakele nakuya mu njivo ya Njambi na kumuvuilila.<verse eid="LUK 21:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="LUK 22" />
  <para style="s">Vutumbe vua kutsiha Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:1-5">Mateu 26:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:1-2">Mako 14:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 11:45-53">Yiuano 11:45-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 22:1" />Omo ntsimbu yahetele muyehi ya ciuano ca kulia mbolo ya kuhona cimbaluila, cije civasana nguavo Ciuano ca Paseka. <verse eid="LUK 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 22:2" />Kaha vakuluntu va vasasendote na valongisi va mezi a Lishiko, vatondele ngila ya vushueke ya kutsilamo Yesu muomu vakele na liova lia vantu.<verse eid="LUK 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yundasa atava kuenda Yesu vungungu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:14-16">Mateu 26:14-16</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:10-11">Mako 14:10-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 22:3" />Ambahoni Satana uakovelele muli Yundasa uje ivasana Sakaliote, umo uavaje likumi na vavali ua vandongisi. <verse eid="LUK 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 22:4" />Kaha Yundasa uayile na kukahande ku vakuluntu va vasasendote na vaka kuniunga Njivo ya Njambi, uavamuesela ngila yakuendela Yesu vungungu. <verse eid="LUK 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 22:5" />Kaha vakevo vavuahelelele cikuma, valitavasanene kumuhana vimbongo. <verse eid="LUK 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 22:6" />Yundasa uatavele, kaha uatondele ngila imo ya kuendelamo Yesu vungungu cakuhona vantu kuzivuka.<verse eid="LUK 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu alivuahesela kulia ca ciuano ca Paseka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:17-25">Mateu 26:17-25</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:12-21">Mako 14:12-21</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:21-30">Yiuano 13:21-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 22:7" />Litangua liahetele lia ciuano ca mbolo ya kuhona cimbaluila, omo vatsihile vana va vampanga vakulia ha ciuano ca Paseka. <verse eid="LUK 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 22:8" />Yesu uatumine Petulu na Yiuano nguendi “Yemuye muka vuahesele vualumo kutukalila ciuano ca Paseka.”<verse eid="LUK 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 22:9" />Kaha vamuihuile nguavo, “Kuli kuje utonda linga tuka civuaheleseko?”<verse eid="LUK 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 22:10" />Yesu uavakumbuluile nguendi, “Omo mukakovela mu nganda, muka uana muntu nambata njava ya kutekuila mema. Mukaveni noho akaheta mu njivo ije yakakovela. <verse eid="LUK 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 22:11" />Handekeni kuli vavenia njivo ngueni, ‘Mulongisi natutumu kukuihula nguendi, ulikuli mulili uje yange na vandongisi vange utukalila ciuano ca Paseka?’ <verse eid="LUK 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 22:12" />Kaha akamimuesa mulili uakama helu lia njivo, vanauvuahesa vualumo, kuje kukeko mukavuahesela.”<verse eid="LUK 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 22:13" />Kaha vayile vauanene viuma vioshe ngue muavalekelele Yesu, vavuahesele viakulia via ciuano ca Paseka.<verse eid="LUK 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mesa ya Muene</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:26-30">Mateu 26:26-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:22-26">Mako 14:22-26</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 11:23-25">1 Kolinte 11:23-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 22:14" />Omo ntsimbu yahetele Yesu uatumamene ku mesa hamo na tunganda vendi. <verse eid="LUK 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 22:15" />Uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi, “Njatondele cikuma kulia eci ciuano ca Paseka hamo neni ntsimbu kanda njiyande, <verse eid="LUK 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 22:16" />muomu njimileka nguange, kuhuma lelo kunjikacili naua kuvanga noho calishulisisa muacili mu Vumuene vua Njambi.”<verse eid="LUK 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 22:17" />Ambahoni Yesu uanonele nganja ya viniu, kaha uatsantselele kuli Njambi, nakuhandeka kuli vandongisi vendi nguendi, “Ambateni nganja eyi mulishumuine hakati keni. <verse eid="LUK 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 22:18" />Njimileka nguange, kuhuma lelo kunjikanu naua neni viniu kuvanga noho Vumuene vua Njambi vuneja.”<verse eid="LUK 22:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 22:19" />Uambatele naua mbolo uatsantselele kuli Njambi, kaha uaipazuile uava haneneyo nguendi, “Eyi inapu muvila uange uvanahana hali yeni. Lingeni lingeni eci mukunjivuluka.” <verse eid="LUK 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 22:20" />Mu cifua cimo vene omo vamanusuile kulia ca cinguezi, uambatele nganja uahandekele nguendi, “Eyi nganja inapu litavasano lialiha lia Njambi livanakutu na maninga ange aje ahitilile hali yeni.<verse eid="LUK 22:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 22:21" />“Vuno honi taleni! Ou anjenda vungungu ali hamo nange kuno ku mesa! <verse eid="LUK 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 22:22" />Muna Muntu akatsa ngue muje muatondelelemo Njambi, vuno honi tuyando tuendi uje akamuenda vungungu!” <verse eid="LUK 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 22:23" />Kaha vandongisi vendi vaputukile kulihozola hakati kavo nguavo, iya honi akalinga cuma eci.<verse eid="LUK 22:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vimpata hali uje napu uakama cikuma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 22:24" />Kaha kuaputukile vimpata hakati ka vandongisi nguavo, iya umo hakati kavo napu uakama cikuma. <verse eid="LUK 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 22:25" />Yesu uandekele kuli vakevo nguendi, “Vimiene va vaje keti Vayunda vali na nzili ha vantu vavo. Kaha vaje vaka kuyula vavatumbula vakuasi va vantu.” <verse eid="LUK 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 22:26" />Vuno honi eyi keti ikeyo ngila hakati keni, vuno honi uoshe uje uakama hakati keni napande kupua uamundende, kaha ntuama yeni napande kupua ngue ngamba. <verse eid="LUK 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 22:27" />Iya uakama cikuma? Nkuma uje natumama alia, indi uje muka kupanga viakulia? Nkuma keti uje natumama alia ku mesa ndi? Vuno honi yange njili hakati keni ngue uje muka kupanga.<verse eid="LUK 22:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 22:28" />Yeni munakala nange mu tuyando tuange tuoshe. <verse eid="LUK 22:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 22:29" />Ngue muje muananjihana Tate nzili ya kuyula, neni naua njikamihana nzili yakuyula, <verse eid="LUK 22:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 22:30" />linga neni mukalie na kunua ku mesa yange mu Vumuene vuange, kaha mukatumama ha matanda nakuyula miyati likumi na ivali ya Isaleli.<verse eid="LUK 22:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ahandeka via kulutue ngeci Petulu akamuviana</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:31-35">Mateu 26:31-35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:27-31">Mako 14:27-31</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:36-38">Yiuano 13:36-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 22:31" />Simoni, Simoni! Ivuilila, Satana atonda kumuhangununa muva voshe, ngue muje muvakahangununa tiliku ku mujungu. <verse eid="LUK 22:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 22:32" />Vuno honi yange njakulombelela linga lutsilielo luove keti luhue. Kaha omo ukatenguluka na kuhiluka kuli yange, unapande kukolesa vamuanoko.<verse eid="LUK 22:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 22:33" />Vuno honi Petulu uamukumbuluile nguendi, “Muene, njalivuahesela laja kuya nove mu kamenga na kukatsa nove!”<verse eid="LUK 22:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 22:34" />Yesu uamukumbuluile nguendi, “Muavusunga Petulu njikuleka nguange,” “Vutsiki vuno vene ntsimbu kanda ndemba atambeke, ukanjiviana lutatu.”<verse eid="LUK 22:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Cikuama, cola na mukuale</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 22:35" />Yesu uehuile vandongisi vendi nguendi, “Muje njamitumine cakuhona cikuama, cola cipue vinkaku nkuma muahonoueleko cuma cimo ndi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:35">Kaha vamukumbuluile nguavo, “Houe!”<verse eid="LUK 22:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 22:36" />Yesu uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi, “Vuno honi ntsimbu ino, ou ali na cikuama cipue cola napande kuambata, kaha uoshe nahonoua mukuale napande kulandesa kazaku kendi alande mukuale. <verse eid="LUK 22:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 22:37" />Muomu vanacisoneka nguavo, ‘Vamutandelele kumo na vaka kushaula Lishiko.’ Kaha njimileka nguange eci cinapande kulishulisisa hali yange. Eyo vioshe vije vivanasoneka hali yange vili nakulishulisisa.”<verse eid="LUK 22:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 22:38" />Vandongisi vahandekele nguavo, “Muene tala! Kuli mikuale ivali eyi!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:38">Kaha uavakumbuluile nguendi, “Mukemo vene!”<verse eid="LUK 22:38" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu alombela ha munkinda ua Oliveta</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:36-46">Mateu 26:36-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:32-42">Mako 14:32-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 22:39" />Yesu uahumine mu nganda, kaha uayile ku munkinda ua Oliveta ngue muje muakele nakulingilamo. Kaha vandongisi vendi vamukavele. <verse eid="LUK 22:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 22:40" />Omo uahetele kuje uavalekele nguendi, “Lombeleni linga keti mukovele muvieseko.”<verse eid="LUK 22:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 22:41" />Kaha uahumine kavundende kuli vakevo kaha uatsikamene nakulombela nguendi, <verse eid="LUK 22:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 22:42" />“Tate nga utonda uhumisa eyi nganja ya tuyando kuli yange. Keti ngue ku cizango cange, vuno honi cizango cove cilingiue. <verse eid="LUK 22:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 22:43" />Kangelo uahumine muilu uasholokele kuli ikeye na kumusimpisa. <verse eid="LUK 22:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 22:44" />Muomu ya tuyando tuakama ualombelele cikuma, kaha ntuima yendi yapuile ngue mambase a maninga anduekela ha mavu.”<verse eid="LUK 22:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 22:45" />Kaha omo uakatukile kuhuma mu kulombela, uayile kuli vandongisi vendi uavauanene vanakosa tulo, muomu vazeyele na vusiua. <verse eid="LUK 22:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 22:46" />Kaha uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi, “Vikahoni muakosela? Hindukeni mulombele, linga keti mukovela muvieseko.”<verse eid="LUK 22:46" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu vamukuata</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Mateu 26:47-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:43-50">Mako 14:43-50</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:3-11">Yiuano 18:3-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 22:47" />Tele Yesu uakele nakuhandeka navo, hajevene civunga ca vantu cahetele. Yundasa Sakaliote uje uava likumi na vavali uavatuamenene. Kaha uashuenene kuli Yesu na kumuntsemba. <verse eid="LUK 22:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 22:48" />Vuno honi Yesu uahandekele kuli ikeye nguendi, “Yundasa nkuma yove uenda Muna Muntu vungungu na kumutsemba ndi?”<verse eid="LUK 22:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 22:49" />Kaha omo vandongisi vaje vakele hamo na Yesu vamuene vije vialingiuile vahandekele nguavo, “Muene tulikuasese mikuale ndi?” <verse eid="LUK 22:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 22:50" />Kaha umo ua vandongisi va Yesu uavatuile lituitui lia cilio lia ngamba ua kasasendote uakama.<verse eid="LUK 22:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 22:51" />Vuno honi Yesu uamu vianesele nguendi, “Ecela.” Kaha uakuatele lituitui lia uje yala nakulihiluisilako naua.<verse eid="LUK 22:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 22:52" />Ambahoni Yesu uahandekele kuli vaje vakuluntu va vasasendote na kuli vamo vakuluntu va vaka kuniunga njivo ya Njambi na ku vakuluntu vaje vezile na kumukuata nguendi, “Nkuma muneja na mikuale na vimbueti ngue njimuizi ndi? <verse eid="LUK 22:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 22:53" />Njinakele neni mu njivo ya Njambi ha matangua oshe vikahoni kumua njikuatelele. Vuno honi eyi ikeyo ntsimbu yeni, omo nzili ya milima ili nakuyula.”<verse eid="LUK 22:53" /></para>
  <para style="s">Petulu aviana Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:57-58">Mateu 26:57-58</ref>;<ref loc="MAT 26:69">69</ref>;<ref loc="MAT 26:75">75</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:53-54">Mako 14:53-54</ref>;<ref loc="MRK 14:66">66</ref>;<ref loc="MRK 14:72">72</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:12-18">Yiuano 18:12-18</ref>;<ref loc="JHN 18:25-27">25-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 22:54" />Vakuatele Yesu kaha vamutualele ku njivo ya Kasasendote uakama, kaha Petulu uamukavele munima uakele halahako. <verse eid="LUK 22:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 22:55" />Vamo vavuekele tuhia mukati ka cipango vatumamene nakuota, kaha Petulu uatumamene navo. <verse eid="LUK 22:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 22:56" />Omo ngamba umo uampuevo uamuene Petulu natumama kuje ku tuhia, uamutalele ntooma, kaha uahandekele nguendi, “Yala ou naua uakele hamo na Yesu.”<verse eid="LUK 22:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 22:57" />Vuno honi Petulu uavianene nguendi, “Yove mpuevo yange kunjimuzivuka!”<verse eid="LUK 22:57" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 22:58" />Kaha omo kuahitile ka ntsimbu kakandende, yala ueka naua uamuene Petulu, kaha uahandekele nguendi, “Nove naua u umo uavo” Vuno honi Petulu uamukumbuluile nguendi, “Ove yala houe, keti yange!”<verse eid="LUK 22:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 22:59" />Omo kuahitile ka ntsimbu lika, kaha yala mukuavo naua uahandekele nanzili nguendi, “Ou yala cilivene uakele hamo na Yesu, nendi naua Kangalileya!”<verse eid="LUK 22:59" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 22:60" />Vuno honi Petulu uamukumbuluile nguendi, “Ove yala yange kunjizivuka evi ulinakuhandeka!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:60">Vuno honi hajevene tele acili nakuhandeka, ndemba uatambekele. <verse eid="LUK 22:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 22:61" />Kaha Muene uatengulukile uatalele kuli Petulu, kaha Petulu uavulukile vije via mulekele Muene nguendi, “Ntsimbu kanda ndemba atambeke vutsiki vuno vene ukanjiviana lutatu” <verse eid="LUK 22:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 22:62" />Kaha Petulu uatuhukile hambanza na kulila cikuma.<verse eid="LUK 22:62" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu vamushendumuna na kumupupa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:67-68">Mateu 26:67-68</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:65">Mako 14:65</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 22:63" />Vamala vaje vaniungile Yesu vamushendumuine na kumupupa. <verse eid="LUK 22:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 22:64" />Vamukutile tanga ha mesho, kaha vahandekele kuli ikeye nguavo, “Handeka vunanguizi! Iya na kupupu?” <verse eid="LUK 22:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 22:65" />Vahandekele viuma viavingi via kumushaula.<verse eid="LUK 22:65" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vasompesa Yesu ku mesho a mpunga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:59-66">Mateu 26:59-66</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:55-64">Mako 14:55-64</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:19-24">Yiuano 18:19-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 22:66" />Omo kuacele vakuluntu voshe va vantu valiuanene hamolika. Vakuluntu va vasasendote, na valongisi va mezi a Lishiko voshe kuvakele, kaha vanehele Yesu ku mpunga yavo. <verse eid="LUK 22:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 22:67" />Kaha vamuihuile nguavo, “Tuleke, yove Kilistu ndi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:67">Kaha Yesu uavakumbuluile nguendi, “Cipue nga njimileka nguange yange, kumukanjitsiliela.” <verse eid="LUK 22:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 22:68" />Kaha naua nga njimihula cihula, kumukasa kunjitava. <verse eid="LUK 22:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 22:69" />Vuno honi hume lelo Muna Muntu akatumama ku livoko lia cilio lia Njambi muka nzili yoshe.<verse eid="LUK 22:69" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 22:70" />Kaha voshe vamuihuile nguavo, “Nkuma yove u Muna Njambi ndi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:70">Ikeye uavakumbuluile nguendi, “Mukemo vene, mu munahandeka.”<verse eid="LUK 22:70" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 22:71" />Kaha vahandekele nguavo, “Vikahoni tutondela naua vukaleho vueka? Yetu vavenia tualivuila laja muanacihandeka.”<verse eid="LUK 22:71" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="LUK 23" />
  <para style="s">Yesu vamutuala kuli Pilato</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:1-2">Mateu 27:1-2</ref>;<ref loc="MAT 27:11-14">11-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:1-5">Mako 15:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:28-38">Yiuano 18:28-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 23:1" />Ambahoni mpunga yoshe yakatukile na kutuala Yesu kuli Pilato. <verse eid="LUK 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 23:2" />Kaha vaputukile kumuvangeya nguavo, “Tuauana ou yala alina kutanganesa vantu vetu mukuvaleka linga keti vafuete lisimu kuli Sezale, kaha alinakuhandeka naua nguendi ikeye Kilistu Muene.”<verse eid="LUK 23:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 23:3" />Nankuma Pilato uamuhuile nguendi, “Nkuma yove Muene ua Vayunda ndi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 23:3">Yesu uamukumbuluile nguendi, “Mukemo vene munahandeka.”<verse eid="LUK 23:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 23:4" />Ambahoni Pilato uahandekele ku vasasendote vakama na civunga nguendi, “Yange kunjauanene mulonga kuli ou muntu.”<verse eid="LUK 23:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 23:5" />Vuno honi vakevo vahandekele na nzili nguavo, “Ikeye alinakulinga mpindakano ku vantu na vilongesa viendi linga valuise Yundeya yoshe. Uaputukilile mu Ngalileya, kaha hano honi nejakuno.”<verse eid="LUK 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu vamutuala kuli Helonde</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 23:6" />Omo Pilato uevuile eci, kaha uehuile nguendi, “Nkuma ou yala Kangalileya ndi?” <verse eid="LUK 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 23:7" />Omo Pilato uazivukile ngeci Yesu uahumine ku nganda ije yakele nakuyula Helonde, kaha uamutumine kuli muene Helonde, uje naikeye uakele mu Yelusalema ha ntsimbu ije. <verse eid="LUK 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 23:8" />Helonde uavuahelele cikuma omo uamuene Yesu, muomu uovuile viendi kaha na laja uakele nakutonda cikuma kumumona. Uakele nalishungu lia kumona Yesu alinga vikomoueso. <verse eid="LUK 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 23:9" />Nankuma Helonde uehuile Yesu vihula viavingi, vuno honi Yesu katavele cipue lizi limo. <verse eid="LUK 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 23:10" />Kaha vakuluntu va vasasendote na valongisi va mezi a Lishiko vayile kulutue nakuvangeya Yesu muakama. <verse eid="LUK 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 23:11" />Kaha Helonde na masualale vendi vamushendumuine naku mulinga mua mupi, ambahoni vamuzikile kazaku kandando yakama, kaha vamuhiluisile kuli Pilato. <verse eid="LUK 23:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 23:12" />Kaha ha litangua lije vene Helonde na Pilato valikuatele vusamba, vuno honi tele kanda evi vapuile muntu na citozi cendi.<verse eid="LUK 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu vamusompela kutsa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:15-26">Mateu 27:15-26</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:6-15">Mako 15:6-15</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:39">Yiuano 18:39</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:16">19:16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 23:13" />Pilato uasanene hamo vakuluntu va vasasendote na vantuama na vantu, <verse eid="LUK 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 23:14" />kaha uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi, “Muanehe ou yala kuli yange na kuhandeka ngueni alina kutanganesa vantu. Ivuilileni, yange njamuihuile ku mesho eni, kaha kunjauanene mulonga ua cuma cimo cacipi cimunamuvangeya. <verse eid="LUK 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 23:15" />Cipue Helonde kauanene mulonga muli ikeye mukemo namuhiluisa kuli yetu. Ou yala kukuesi cuma canalingi linga va mutsihe. <verse eid="LUK 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 23:16" />Njikamupupa lika kaha njikamuecela linga aye.” <verse eid="LUK 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 23:17" />Kuakele cilika cavo cije Pilato uatondele kuhumisila vantu cinzinda umo mu kamenga uje ivatondele ha ntsimbu ya Ciuano ca Paseka.<verse eid="LUK 23:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 23:18" />Kaha civunga coshe ca vantu ca tambakanene nguavo, “Mutsihe!” Tuhumisele Mbalambasa. <verse eid="LUK 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 23:19" />(Mbalambasa vamuhakele mu kamenga muomu uakele nakuneha mpindangano mu nganda na kuntsiha vantu)<verse eid="LUK 23:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 23:20" />Vuno honi Pilato uatondele kuecela Yesu, kaha uahandekele naua ku civunga. <verse eid="LUK 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 23:21" />Vuno honi voshe vatambekele cikuma nguavo, “Mushukike! Mushukike!”<verse eid="LUK 23:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 23:22" />Kaha Pilato uahandekele naua lua mucitatu nguendi, “Vupi muka vuanalingi? Yange kunjauanene cuma cimo ca kumutsihila! Njimupupa lika na kumuecela aye.”<verse eid="LUK 23:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 23:23" />Vuno honi vantu vatualeleleho kutambeka nguavo Yesu vamushukike, kaha ha kutambeka cavo uavahaneneye. <verse eid="LUK 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 23:24" />Nankuma, Pilato uatetele cije cimpande, ngue muvalombele vakevo. <verse eid="LUK 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 23:25" />Kaha Pilato uecelele Mbalambasa muntu ivatondele, uje uakele mu kamenga ha mulonga uakuneha mpindangano na kutsiha vantu. Kaha uavahanene Yesu linga vamulinge muje muvatondelele vavenia.<verse eid="LUK 23:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu vamushukika ha cilindakano</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:32-44">Mateu 27:32-44</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:21-32">Mako 15:21-32</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:17-27">Yiuano 19:17-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 23:26" />Kaha masualale vatualele Yesu mukumushukika, tele vali nakuya valiuanene na yala umo ua lizina lia Simoni uaku Silene, uje uezile mu nganda. Kaha vamukuatele nakumutuika cilindakano ca Yesu kaha vamulekele linga akave Yesu munima.<verse eid="LUK 23:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 23:27" />Civunga cakama ca vantu ca mukavele, hakati kavo hakele vampuevo vaje vakele nakulilila cikuma muomu ya ikeye. <verse eid="LUK 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 23:28" />Yesu uatengulukile kuli vakevo nakuhandeka nguendi, “Yeni vampuevo vamu Yelusalema! Keti mulile yange vuno honi lilileni yeni vavenia na vana veni. <verse eid="LUK 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 23:29" />Muomu matangua alina kuija omo vantu vakahandeka nguavo, ‘Vakukuisula vantsimpi, vaje kuvasemene tukeke na vaje ku vajamuesele.’ <verse eid="LUK 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 23:30" />Ikapua ntsimbu ije vantu vakahandeka ku minkinda nguavo, ‘Tuuileni! Naku minkinda yaindende nguavo, tufuikeni!’ <verse eid="LUK 23:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 23:31" />Muomu nga valinga viuma evi ku muti uakutontola, kaha honi cikafua vati ku muti uakuma?”<verse eid="LUK 23:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 23:32" />Kaha naua kuakele mihuza vavali va vamala vavatualele hamo na Yesu na kuvashukika. <verse eid="LUK 23:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 23:33" />Omo vahetele kucihela cije vatumbuile nguavo, “Cikola,” kaha vashukikile Yesu ha cilindakano na vaje mihuza vavali umo ku livoko liendi lia cilio mukuavo ku livoko lia cimoshue. <verse eid="LUK 23:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 23:34" />Yesu uahandekele nguendi, “Tate vakonekele! Muomu kuvazivuka cije civalinakulinga.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 23:34">Kaha masualale valipangezelele vuzalo vuendi na kuta nkela. <verse eid="LUK 23:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 23:35" />Vantu vemanene kuje nakutalela tele vantuama va Vayunda vamushendumuna nguavo, “Uovuele vakuavo, nendi aliovole ikeye vavenia nga ikeye Kilistu uje yanahangula Njambi!”<verse eid="LUK 23:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 23:36" />Kaha masualale vamushendumuine naua vezile hayehi kuli ikeye vamuhanene viniu via kushasha. <verse eid="LUK 23:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 23:37" />Vahandekele kuli ikeye nguavo, “Liovole yove vavenia nga u Muene ua Vayunda!”<verse eid="LUK 23:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 23:38" />Helu lia cilindakano cendi hakele mezi aua nguavo, “Ou ikeye Muene ua Vayunda.”<verse eid="LUK 23:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 23:39" />Kaha muhuza umo ivamushukikile hamo nendi uahandekele lizi lia kumushaula nguendi, “Nkuma keti yove Kilistu ndi? Liovole yove vavenia netu naua utuovole!”<verse eid="LUK 23:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 23:40" />Kaha uje mukuavo muhuza uamutenukilile nguendi, “Nkuma yove kuvuila Njambi liova ndi? Indi muomu unatambula cihiso cimo nendi. <verse eid="LUK 23:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 23:41" />Cihiso cetu cinatupande, muomu tunambata fueto ya vilinga vietu, vuno honi yala ou kesi na vupi.” <verse eid="LUK 23:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 23:42" />Kaha uahandekele kuli Yesu nguendi, “Yesu njivuluke omo ukeja mu vumuene vuove.”<verse eid="LUK 23:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 23:43" />Yesu uamukumbuluile nguendi, “Muavusunga njikuleka nguange lelo vene ukakala hamo nange mu Palandaisi.”<verse eid="LUK 23:43" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kutsa ca Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:45-56">Mateu 27:45-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:33-41">Mako 15:33-41</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:28-30">Yiuano 19:28-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 23:44" />Omo tele litangua lili hakati ka mutue, kaha litangua liazivalele kuakekele milima ha mavu oshe kutuala noho ha ntsimbu ya mucitatu ya mutania ua cinguezi. <verse eid="LUK 23:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 23:45" />Kaha ntanga ije yakele mu njivo ya Njambi yatavukile hakati kuhuma kuilu na ha mavu. <verse eid="LUK 23:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 23:46" />Kaha Yesu uatambekele na lizi liakama nguendi, “Tate! Njihaka cimbembesi cange mu mavoko ove.” Hanima yakuhandeka mezi aua uatsile.<verse eid="LUK 23:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 23:47" />Omo mukuluntu ua masualale uamuene vije vialingiuile, uashangazalele Njambi nakuhandeka nguendi, “Muavusunga yala ou uapuile muka vusunga.”<verse eid="LUK 23:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 23:48" />Omo vantu vaje vakungulukile ku cihela cije vamuene viuma vije valingiuile, kaha vahilukile ku vinjivo viavo oku valipupanga ha vintulo viavo mu vusiua. <verse eid="LUK 23:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 23:49" />Kaha voshe vaje vazivukile Yesu ha mutuntu uendi hamo na vampuevo vaje vamukavele kuhuma ku Ngalileya vemanene kulahako nakutala viuma evi.<verse eid="LUK 23:49" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vatsinda Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Mateu 27:57-61</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Mako 15:42-47</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">Yiuano 19:38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 23:50" />Kuakele yala umo lizina liendi Yosefa uaku Alamatiya mu nganda ya Yundeya. Uapuile yala uacili ua kasingimiko, <verse eid="LUK 23:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 23:51" />uje uakele nakuvandamena kuija ca Vumuene vua Njambi. Cipue vene uapuile umo uamu mpunga, katavele ku vutumbe na vilinga viavo via kuluisa Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 23:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 23:52" />Uayile kuli Pilato nakulomba muvila ua Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 23:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 23:53" />Ambahoni uahumisile muvila ua Yesu ha cilindakano, kaha ua uzengelele ha ntanga ya liniu, kaha ua ulangekele mu cihilo cije civa cokuele mu livue cije kanda vantsindemo muntu. <verse eid="LUK 23:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 23:54" />Liapuile litangua lia mucitanu cinguezi omo litangua lia Sapalalo kanda lihete.<verse eid="LUK 23:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 23:55" />Vampuevo vaje vakavele Yesu kuhuma ku Ngalileya vayile hamo na Yosefa, vakamuene cihilo cije nakumona muje muvalangekelelemo muvila ua Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 23:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 23:56" />Ambahoni vayile ku vinjivo viavo nakukavuahesa mazi aluengo luakunika muacili linga vakavuavese muvila ua Yesu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 23:56">Kaha ha litangua lia Sapalalo vahuimine kuya ku Lishiko lia Mosesa.<verse eid="LUK 23:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="LUK 24" />
  <para style="s">Kusanguka ca Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:1-10">Mateu 28:1-10</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:1-8">Mako 16:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:1-10">Yiuano 20:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 24:1" />Omo kuacele cimene mene lia calumingu vampuevo vayile ku cihilo, vambatele mazi avavuahesele. <verse eid="LUK 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 24:2" />Kaha vauanene livue liakama vana lihumisa ku cikolo ca cihilo. <verse eid="LUK 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 24:3" />Nankuma vakovelelemo vuno honi kuuanenemo muvila ua Muene Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 24:4" />Vemanene kuje tele valikomokela, kaha hajevene kuasholokele vamala vavali vaje vemanene kuli vakevo mu vuzalo vuakuviakuma. <verse eid="LUK 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 24:5" />Vaje vampuevo vovuile liova cikuma kaha vakotamene ha mavu, vaje vamala vavehuile nguavo, “Vika mutondela muka muono ku vantsi? <verse eid="LUK 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 24:6" />Uahiko kuno nasanguka laja. Vulukeni muje muahandekele kuli yeni tele acili mu Ngalileya. <verse eid="LUK 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 24:7" />‘Muna Muntu vaka muhana ku mavako a vantu va vipi, vaka mushukika, kaha vaka musangula hanima ya matangua atatu.’”<verse eid="LUK 24:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 24:8" />Ambahoni vaje vampuevo vavulukile mezi endi. <verse eid="LUK 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 24:9" />Kaha vahumine kuje ku cihilo vakalekele viuma vioshe vivamuene kuli vaje likumi na umo lia vandongisi na vakuavo voshe. <verse eid="LUK 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 24:10" />Vaje vampuevo vapuile Maliya Mangandalena, na Njuana, na Maliya vaina ya Yakomba na vampuevo vakuavo vaje valekele evi viuma ku tunganda. <verse eid="LUK 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 24:11" />Vuno honi tunganda vasinganiekele ngue vije vivahandekele vaje vampuevo keti viaseho kaha kuva vatsilielelele. <verse eid="LUK 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 24:12" />Vuno honi Petulu uakatukile na kushatukila ku cihilo, uakotamenenemo kaha uamuenemo lika vintanga na ceka cahi. Kaha uahilukile kuimbo na kulikomokela ha viuma vije vialingiuile.<verse eid="LUK 24:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuenda kuya ku Emausi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:12-13">Mako 16:12-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 24:13" />Ha litangua lijevene vandongisi vavali va Yesu vakele na kuya ku limbo lije livatumbuile nguavo Emausi, ntunda yapuile makilomita likumi na imo kuhuma ku Yelusalema. <verse eid="LUK 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 24:14" />Vakele nakuhandeka kuli umo na mukuavo ha viuma vioshe vije vialingiuile. <verse eid="LUK 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 24:15" />Tele vacili nakuhandeka na kuliyongola, Yesu uezile hayehi navo nakuenda navo. <verse eid="LUK 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 24:16" />Vamumuene vuno honi kuvamuzivukile. <verse eid="LUK 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 24:17" />Yesu uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi, “Nkuma vimpande muka muli nakuhandeka oku muenda?” Vemanene kaha vihanga viavo viasholokele mu vusiua. <verse eid="LUK 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 24:18" />Kaha umo uavo lizina liendi Kolopase, uamuhuile nguendi, “Nkuma yove u mungezi muno mu Yelusalema ndi? Muomu yove lika uje kazivuka vije vinalingiua mu matangua ano.”<verse eid="LUK 24:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 24:19" />Kaha uavehuile nguendi, “Viuma muka?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 24:19">Vamutavele nguavo, “Via Yesu uaku Nazaleta. Yala ou uapuile kananguizi ua nzili muvilinga na mu mezi kuli Njambi naku vantu voshe <verse eid="LUK 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 24:20" />Kaha vakuluntu vetu va vasasendote na vaka kuyula vamuhanene kuli nguvulu linga amuhise na kumutsiha, kaha vamushukikile ha cilindakano. <verse eid="LUK 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 24:21" />Vuno honi tuatsilielele nguetu ikeye akapatula Isaleli! Kaha lelo linapu litangua lia mucitatu kuhuma haje vialingiuile viuma evi. <verse eid="LUK 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 24:22" />Vampuevo vamo hakati ketu vatukomokesele, vamenekelele ku cihilo cimene mene, <verse eid="LUK 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 24:23" />vuno honi kuvakauanene muvila uendi. Kaha vahilukile nguavo vakamuene cimona ca tungelo vaje vavalekele nguavo ali nakuyoya. <verse eid="LUK 24:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 24:24" />Kaha vamo hakati ketu vayileko ku cihilo, kaha vakauanene ngue muje muvahandekelele vaje vampuevo, vuno honi kuvamumuene.”<verse eid="LUK 24:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 24:25" />Ambahoni Yesu uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi, “Yeni vilema, musimbula vatihoni kutsiliela vije vioshe vivahandekele tunanguizi! <verse eid="LUK 24:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 24:26" />Nkuma Kilistu kapandele kuyanda ha viuma evi nakukovela mu vumpau vuendi ndi?” <verse eid="LUK 24:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 24:27" />Kaha Yesu uaputukile kuvalumbuinina viuma vioshe vije vahandekele mu visoneka hali ikeye, kuputukila mu mavulu a Mosesa na kutuala ku visoneka via tunanguizi voshe.<verse eid="LUK 24:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 24:28" />Omo vahetele kuyehi na limbo kuje vakele nakuya, Yesu ualingile ngue atuvakana kamandende kuya kulutue, <verse eid="LUK 24:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 24:29" />Vuno honi vamulombele na kuhandeka nguavo, “Tumama netu muomu cinapu cinguezi kaha na litangua liatoko.” Kaha uayile na kukala navo. <verse eid="LUK 24:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 24:30" />Omo uatumamene navo mukulia kaha uambatele mbolo naku ikuisula uaipazuile na kuvahanayo. <verse eid="LUK 24:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 24:31" />Kaha mesho avo ashokolokele vazivukile nguavo nkumani ikeye, vuno honi ualavukile kuli vakevo. <verse eid="LUK 24:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 24:32" />Kaha valihandekesele umo na mukuavo nguavo, “Nkumani mukemo mitima yetu yovuile kuvuahelela cikuma omo uakele nakuhandeka netu mu ngila na kutulumbunuina viuma via mu Visoneka.”<verse eid="LUK 24:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 24:33" />Vakatukile ha ntsimbu ijevene vahilukile ku Yelusalema, vauanene vandongisi likumi na umo vanalikungulula hamo na vakuavo veka naua. <verse eid="LUK 24:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 24:34" />Vahandekele nguavo, “Muavusunga vene Muene nasanguka! Nalisholola kuli Simoni!”<verse eid="LUK 24:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 24:35" />Kaha vaje vavali vambuluile vije vialingiuile mu ngila, namuje vazivukilile nguavo nkuma ikeye Muene Yesu omo uatavuile mbolo.<verse eid="LUK 24:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu alisholola kuli vandongisi Vendi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:16-20">Mateu 28:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:14-18">Mako 16:14-18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:19-23">Yiuano 20:19-23</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:6-8">Vilinga 1:6-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 24:36" />Tele ntsimbu vaje vavali vakele nakuvaleka viuma evi, vuasi vuasi Yesu vavenia uemanene hakati kavo uahandekele nguendi, “Ciyulo cikale neni.”<verse eid="LUK 24:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 24:37" />Kaha vovuile liova cikuma, muomu vasinganiekele nguavo vanamono ndumba ya muntu. <verse eid="LUK 24:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 24:38" />Vuno honi uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi, “Nkuma vikahoni munalijujukila? Nkuma vika muli na kulikanouela mu mitima yeni? <verse eid="LUK 24:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 24:39" />Taleni mu mavoko ange na mu viliato viange. Taleni yange vene. Njikuateni, kaha mukazivuka muomu nduma ya muntu kakele na ntsitu na vitsiha ngue evi muamono vinjili navio.”<verse eid="LUK 24:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 24:40" />Uahandekele evi na kuvamuesa mu mavoko na mu viliato viendi. <verse eid="LUK 24:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 24:41" />Cipue ngoco vene kuvatsilielele muomu vavuahelele cikuma na kulikomokela kaha Yesu uavehuile nguendi, “Muli na viakulia linga njilie ndi?” <verse eid="LUK 24:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 24:42" />Kaha vamuhanene mbazuvuila ya intsi uakuoca. <verse eid="LUK 24:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 24:43" />Kaha uaitambuile na kulia ha mesho avo.<verse eid="LUK 24:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 24:44" />Ambahoni uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi, “Evi vikevio viuma vije njamilekele omo njakele neni nguange viuma vioshe vije vivasonekele hali yange mu Lishiko lia Mosesa, na visoneka via tunanguizi na mu miaso viapande kulishulisisa.”<verse eid="LUK 24:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 24:45" />Ambahoni uashokoluele mana avo linga vovuisise visoneka, <verse eid="LUK 24:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 24:46" />na kuhandeka kuli vakevo nguendi, “Visoneka viahandeka nguavio, Kilistu napande kuyanda kaha vakamusangula hanima ya matangua atatu.” <verse eid="LUK 24:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 24:47" />Visoneka viahandeka naua nguavio ngeci kutenguluka na kukonekela ca vipi vanapande kuviambulula mu lizina liendi ku mafuti oshe, kuputukila mu Yelusalema. <verse eid="LUK 24:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 24:48" />Yeni munapu vakaleho ha viuma evi. <verse eid="LUK 24:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 24:49" />Kaha yange njikatuma kuli yeni cije cakulahesele Tate. Vuno honi munapande kuvandamena mu nganda noho mukatambula nzili eyi kuhuminina muilu.<verse eid="LUK 24:49" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu vamutuala Muilu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:19-20">Mako 16:19-20</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:9-11">Vilinga 1:9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 24:50" />Ambahoni uahumine navo mu nganda uavatualele kuyehi na Mbetaniya kuje uajunduile mavoko endi nakuvakuisula. <verse eid="LUK 24:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 24:51" />Tele ali nakuvakuisula, ualisezele navo nakumutuala muilu. <verse eid="LUK 24:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 24:52" />Vamulemesele kaha vahilukile mu Yelusalema na kuvuahelela cikuma. <verse eid="LUK 24:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 24:53" />Kaha vakele ntsimbu yoshe mu njivo ya Njambi na kusantsela Njambi.<verse eid="LUK 24:53" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 24" />
</usx>